{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"44c3520f-1b28-4689-ac8a-3e24f756a990","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:48:47.552Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"a5d78a38c3b33787e5b5d9b7008e9de2db1c7b9a9ca69bf894342b554f4e1149","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"2268e431-bab8-4a12-abdb-975676366e52","keep":1437,"tail":["21954aafb5858237e4d0d7f2fe5b393f37bf77111ae279a5760b6cbfd98f2fb2","2fa159ab30d01e44efdc6eca42204b75facefff1ded3f4fbbb12c601dc5c7309","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1439,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"0e6a6a68ca627b362b2cad5b1c758f6fdcbbdaefb1dfaa135e2718f45522660c"}
{"parentUuid":"c3bbd0dc-44cf-45ca-ba01-30b71c5c3770","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvY4yHLHo4EQb5X5BgDn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything is merged and main is green: CI passes on `f06bb0fd5` (#503) and `54e8f87d3` (#501). Only #495 (the changeset process docs) and #493 (the automated 0.20.0 release PR) are open.\n\n**What's done on the 1.0 audit.** All seven high-confidence findings are fixed and merged: consistent JSON error envelopes, camelCase keys everywhere, exit 2 for usage errors, one condition per error code, unknown-key and tag validation, and the cleanup batch. Main is green and the classification test is in place.\n\n**What's next, in order of value**\n1. **Cut 0.20.0.** Review #493. Its changelog now carries about eight entries in the layered shape. There are two breaking changes (camelCase keys and the E111/E171 meanings) and one behavior change (exit 2), all with `Breaking:` or `Action:` notes. Read the rendered release PR as a user before merging, which is our own rule from #495.\n2. **Two follow-ups from #500.**\n   - E254 is a catch-all error code that names several config conditions.\n   - A few E171 sites in `release/binding.rs` and `release/derive.rs` look user-reachable through config but weren't verified.\n   - Both would be bad to fix after 1.0 freezes the codes. I'd start with a check for which E171 sites a user can actually reach.\n3. **Remaining 1.0 stability gaps I haven't audited:**\n   - Whether every `--format json` report carries `schemaVersion`. The camelCase guard covered most types, not all.\n   - The GitHub Action's outputs and inputs.\n   - Tag-name stability.\n4. **Trail #162** still has plan items open: retry on forge calls and the pre-merge guard against a stale release PR. It's real release-safety work that I haven't verified.\n5. **Housekeeping:** the locked agent worktrees (yours to release, or say \"force it\").\n\nI'd do 1 first since it needs only your read, and start 2 in parallel as an investigation, which changes nothing until we agree.\n\nneeds input: say go on 2 (the E254 and E171 investigation), and review #493."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_read_input_tokens":838722,"output_tokens":711,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":489,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":711,"cache_read_input_tokens":838722,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":489},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8f0795ee-2ee4-4ef1-ac60-981f2e353e0d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgvY4xwFDgcmDkNS8MzXS","requestRef":"44c3520f-1b28-4689-ac8a-3e24f756a990","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"22cf9f76-f13a-4f3b-98b7-86a12f90dd2b","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:48:54.428Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/cli-polish","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
