{"parentUuid":"b67e19f0-5cd4-452c-9bc8-bce3d3e115cb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fddf1b3c-8d23-4438-96c6-01148de494a2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XcZWC1AaKHkMzbZMDzXTXR","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Async agent launched successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the agentId below, into a user-facing reply.)\nagentId: aafeb13134f6a0ae4 (internal ID - do not mention to user. Use SendMessage with to: 'aafeb13134f6a0ae4', summary: '<5-10 word recap>' to continue this agent.)\nThe agent is working in the background. You will be notified automatically when it completes. You know nothing about its results until that notification arrives — do not report, assume, or predict them; continue other work or respond to the user in the meantime.\nDo not duplicate this agent's work — avoid working with the same files or topics it is using.\noutput_file: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/aafeb13134f6a0ae4.output\nDo NOT Read or tail this file via the shell tool — it is the full subagent JSONL transcript and reading it will overflow your context. If the user asks for progress, say the agent is still running; you'll get a completion notification."}]}]},"uuid":"63f87ddb-8ca4-48ec-97cd-d820a8853545","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:20:00.896Z","toolUseResult":{"isAsync":true,"status":"async_launched","agentId":"aafeb13134f6a0ae4","description":"Pin schemaVersion on every JSON output","resolvedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","prompt":"Task: make sure EVERY `--format json` output carries `schemaVersion`, and pin it with a test, because docs/stability.md freezes this from 1.0 (\"Every report carries schemaVersion\"). Repo: Callisto (Rust release tool). Read AGENTS.md and docs/stability.md first and follow them.\n\nSetup: first `git switch -c fix/json-contract-complete origin/main` (the local origin/main ref is current; you cannot fetch). If the branch exists, switch to it. Work only here.\n\nKnown: the previous PRs added envelope-checking tests for FAILING commands (crates/callisto-cli/tests/error_envelope_tests.rs) and a camelCase guard (crates/callisto-cli/tests/schema_guard_test.rs), and put `release pending` and `release build-python` into the standard envelope. `release inspect` success deliberately prints the raw input document (a durable document with its own versioning); decide from the code whether that is acceptable under the promise and report it, do not change it without evidence it is wrong.\n\nRequired:\n1. Enumerate EVERY command and subcommand that accepts `--format json` (read crates/callisto-cli/src/cli.rs and the command handlers; include hidden CI-plumbing ones). For each, find what its SUCCESS output looks like, with the built binary where the command can run offline in a small temp workspace (a git repo with a Cargo workspace and `callisto init --yes`). Build a table: command, success output has schemaVersion (yes/no), command key, dryRun key, camelCase keys (yes/no), notes. Include `schema`, `completions` (not JSON, say so), `matrix`, `compose-pr-body`, `release plan|execute|inspect|artifact-manifest|build-python|pending`, `release-pr verify|decide|commit-plan`, `status`, `version`, `snapshot`, `pre`, `add`, `init`.\n2. Fix any gap in a Rust report type with the standard envelope (follow how ReleasePendingReport was added in crates/callisto-model/src/release/report.rs), keeping the payload keys unchanged.\n3. Add ONE table-driven test that runs the real binary for every command that can run offline with `--format json` and asserts: valid JSON on stdout, top-level `schemaVersion` is a number, and (for reports that have them) `command` equals the documented command name and `dryRun` is a bool; and fails with a message naming any command missing it. Commands that cannot run offline in a test (needs network or toolchain) are listed in the test as an explicit allow-list with a reason, so a new command forces a decision.\n4. Also check the callisto-action outputs (.github/actions/callisto-action/action.yml and the scripts that set them) against docs/stability.md: the Stable table says the action INPUTS are stable; list the inputs and outputs in docs as they exist and note any that are undocumented or inconsistently named (do not rename anything; report).\n\nConstraints: smallest complete change; no new dependencies. Do NOT add a changeset; return in plain words what a script sees now versus before for any output you changed. Do not commit, push or sign. Verify with `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli -p callisto-model`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` judged by exit code, plus a mutation check on the table test (remove a report's schemaVersion and confirm it fails). If you add error codes, they must be classified in crates/callisto-cli/src/error.rs / tests/usage_exit_codes_tests.rs (see that test). Final report: the command table, fixes, new test names, commands with exit codes, and anything you are unsure of.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/aafeb13134f6a0ae4.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5cd8af54-84ad-48e2-ae3e-10ac41280718","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","branch":"fix/cli-polish","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b67e19f0-5cd4-452c-9bc8-bce3d3e115cb","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/cli-polish","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
