{"parentUuid":"07f54a94-03c4-4323-9e58-605c8a15fbfd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fddf1b3c-8d23-4438-96c6-01148de494a2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014x9UxcCV9E5ed8Qhx2TKBk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Async agent launched successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the agentId below, into a user-facing reply.)\nagentId: a3658a1f85bca2d75 (internal ID - do not mention to user. Use SendMessage with to: 'a3658a1f85bca2d75', summary: '<5-10 word recap>' to continue this agent.)\nThe agent is working in the background. You will be notified automatically when it completes. You know nothing about its results until that notification arrives — do not report, assume, or predict them; continue other work or respond to the user in the meantime.\nDo not duplicate this agent's work — avoid working with the same files or topics it is using.\noutput_file: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a3658a1f85bca2d75.output\nDo NOT Read or tail this file via the shell tool — it is the full subagent JSONL transcript and reading it will overflow your context. If the user asks for progress, say the agent is still running; you'll get a completion notification."}]}]},"uuid":"257adc77-59b1-4dff-b4a6-a24b7f8d8a7f","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:20:00.943Z","toolUseResult":{"isAsync":true,"status":"async_launched","agentId":"a3658a1f85bca2d75","description":"Find and fix scaling hotspots","resolvedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","prompt":"Task: find and fix the next performance hotspot in Callisto when a monorepo is very large. Repo: Callisto (Rust release tool). Read AGENTS.md first (it forbids a git process per package) and follow it.\n\nSetup: first `git switch -c perf/scale-hotspots origin/main` (the local origin/main ref is current; you cannot fetch). If the branch exists, switch to it. Work only here.\n\nAlready measured and fixed: on a synthetic workspace of 1,800 packages (1,500 Cargo crates in a dependency chain plus 300 npm packages) `status`, `version --dry-run` and `compose-pr-body --publish-plan` are flat in package count (8 to 23 git processes, under about 2.6 s on a debug build), and the unreleased-changes check was changed from one `git diff` per changed package to one per tag commit. A benchmark harness is at /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/perf_bench.sh (read it; it builds a temp repo, shims `git` to count processes, and times four commands; env N = cargo crates, M = npm packages, CH = changed packages, BIN = the callisto binary). Copy it to your own scratch location rather than editing it.\n\nUnmeasured dimensions to test, each with a real run and numbers (processes, wall time, scaling from small to large):\n1. Many pending changesets: 200, 1,000 and 3,000 changeset files each naming one or a few packages, then `status`, `version --dry-run`, `version --emit-preview`, `compose-pr-body`. Look for super-linear time (quadratic merging or sorting) and for one file read or one git call per changeset.\n2. Many tags: 5,000 and 20,000 tags (several tags per package, as a long-lived repo has), then the same commands. Look for work per tag beyond one `git tag` / `for-each-ref` call.\n3. A long history: 20,000 commits on main; commands that walk history (`status`, `version` with commit inference if enabled, unreleased-changes, `release plan`).\n4. A wide dependency graph: 1,500 packages where many depend on one core package (fan-out), and a deep chain; cascade planning.\n5. Startup cost on a tiny repo (cold `callisto --help` and `status`), release build numbers for the main commands at 1,800 packages (build release with `cargo build --release -p callisto-cli`; it takes a few minutes).\n\nMethod: measure first, then fix only hotspots where the improvement is at least 2x at the large scale or removes a per-item process or a quadratic loop. For each fix, keep results identical (differential or golden tests), add a test that pins the call count or complexity (use the existing RecordingGit-style runners in crates/callisto-graph/src/changed.rs tests as a pattern), and re-run the same measurement to show before and after. If everything is already flat, say so with the numbers, and do not invent a change.\n\nConstraints: smallest complete change per hotspot; no new dependencies; match surrounding comment density. Do NOT add a changeset; return in plain words what a user with a large repo gets. Do not commit, push or sign. Verify with `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` judged by exit code, plus a mutation check on each new test. Final report: the measurement table (dimension, small, large, scaling verdict), each fix with before and after numbers, files changed, new tests, commands with exit codes, and anything you are unsure of.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a3658a1f85bca2d75.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5cd8af54-84ad-48e2-ae3e-10ac41280718","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","branch":"fix/cli-polish","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"07f54a94-03c4-4323-9e58-605c8a15fbfd","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/cli-polish","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
