t stay E171 and the agent's table of site-by-site reasons was reviewed (some judged by reading, not reproduced). docs/errors.md, docs/config.md and docs/specs/release.json updated; the changeset is minor with a Breaking note.\nCompatibility: a script matching E254 for these values, or E171 for a registry kind mismatch, must match the new codes; exit codes unchanged.\nVerified: ten new tests drive the real binary (each asserts the new code and the absence of E254 and E171) plus a test that every new code is documented; a mutation changing E336 back to E254 fails its test; `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. Not run: CI.\nStyle rules (strict): one line per paragraph, never hard-wrap; succinct and plain; no backstory, no filler, no emoji, no session links; sections \"## Summary\", \"## Breaking\" and \"## Verify\"; under 230 words. Return only the title (conventional-commit style, lower case after the type) on the first line, a blank line, then the body.","agentId":"apr506-body-496dc0e8355dce54","resolvedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","teammate_id":"pr506-body@session-6cc3e47b","agent_id":"apr506-body-496dc0e8355dce54","agent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","name":"pr506-body","color":"red","tmux_session_name":"in-process","tmux_window_name":"in-process","tmux_pane_id":"in-process","team_name":"session-6cc3e47b","is_splitpane":false,"plan_mode_required":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"535e2af2-9136-4a4e-ad06-d1819abee5a8","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5e465e9b44611fbd","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5e465e9b44611fbd","branch":"test/stability-contracts","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"pu