{"parentUuid":"2f17cf25-1d6f-40db-903b-3cac5a604c7b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2a894959-123c-4c43-8372-1dc734ea2ed7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01589sgHzr16D4NhoKX3PBhv","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Spawned successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the ID below, into a user-facing reply.)\nagent_id: apr505-body-79958490efa09431\nname: pr505-body\nThe agent is now running and will receive instructions via mailbox."}]}]},"uuid":"dcb59e73-7397-4671-b45b-664c6789fdf2","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:40:07.606Z","toolUseResult":{"status":"teammate_spawned","prompt":"Write the title and body for a test-only pull request in the Callisto repo (a release tool heading to 1.0). Read the diff at /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr505.diff. Change: docs/stability.md freezes `--format json` reports from 1.0 (\"every report carries schemaVersion\"). An audit of every command's JSON success output found every one already carries `schemaVersion`, so no report type changed. A new table-driven test `every_json_success_output_carries_a_schema_version` runs the real binary for 21 invocations across two workspaces (a fresh init+add workspace and a release-commit fixture driven through plan, inspect, artifact-manifest and execute with fake publishers) and asserts stdout is valid JSON with a numeric top-level `schemaVersion`, and for reports that command equals the documented name and `dryRun` is a bool. It walks the clap command tree including hidden commands, so every command must be in the table or an explicit exempt list with a reason (`completions`, `help`, `schema`, `release build-python`), which makes a new command force a decision. The test makes no network calls: the fixture's GitHub-looking `origin` is given an unreachable local proxy in repo config. docs/stability.md gains a sentence: `release inspect` prints the raw intent, manifest or receipt, each with its own `schemaVersion`, and `schema` prints JSON Schema documents, not reports. Findings reported, not changed: the Action's inputs are snake_case and outputs camelCase (`hasChangesets`, `published`, `publishedPackages`), and `schema` output has no schemaVersion.\nVerified: a mutation making `matrix` print JSON without the envelope fails the test; `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. Not run: CI. No changeset (tests and one doc sentence).\nStyle rules (strict): one line per paragraph, never hard-wrap; succinct and plain; no backstory, no filler, no emoji, no session links; sections \"## Summary\" and \"## Verify\"; under 200 words. Return only the title (conventional-commit style, lower case after the type) on the first line, a blank line, then the body.","agentId":"apr505-body-79958490efa09431","resolvedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","teammate_id":"pr505-body@session-6cc3e47b","agent_id":"apr505-body-79958490efa09431","agent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","name":"pr505-body","color":"green","tmux_session_name":"in-process","tmux_window_name":"in-process","tmux_pane_id":"in-process","team_name":"session-6cc3e47b","is_splitpane":false,"plan_mode_required":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"535e2af2-9136-4a4e-ad06-d1819abee5a8","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5e465e9b44611fbd","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5e465e9b44611fbd","branch":"test/stability-contracts","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto