 fail it); a 3,000-package test fails when the index is rebuilt per lookup (18 s vs 0.04 s; it is wall-clock based with about a 250x margin, so a very loaded CI machine is the only flake risk); the existing version-commit tests including a 105-edit and merge-commit cases pass; `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. Not run: CI.\nNot changed, reported: `version --emit-preview` takes 33 to 45 s when thousands of packages are bumped because each manifest and changelog write does a file fsync and a directory fsync (about 75% of the time is macOS F_FULLFSYNC); left alone because it is the durability invariant in AGENTS.md.\nStyle rules (strict): one line per paragraph, never hard-wrap; succinct and plain; no backstory, no filler, no emoji, no session links; sections \"## Summary\" and \"## Verify\"; under 260 words. Return only the title (conventional-commit style, lower case after the type) on the first line, a blank line, then the body."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b19a827c-c846-4010-9214-d62b0d693238","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwVktdo8f8BoV6gNKbBd","requestRef":"3473aa6b-e1f5-4ca8-96ea-586f7d7a8c0a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e81e008f-1535-40f5-b0d5-908a6abedac3","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:59:12.722Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3658a1f85bca2d75","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"perf/scale-hotspots","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
