{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"ea5c4338-c984-4e52-a54e-8a09f33f56de","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:59:14.195Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"a5d78a38c3b33787e5b5d9b7008e9de2db1c7b9a9ca69bf894342b554f4e1149","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"3473aa6b-e1f5-4ca8-96ea-586f7d7a8c0a","keep":1539,"tail":["1ab20a1a2bc778944ea8669081536f01dfe08d22be0c11dacf516b46a9f871f0","d7ad7bbef9f3b431e5cf36967c73996249feee7177844921b3da4ad55f53a2aa","41d93bbfb52011e0642c79c34afc54c3cc4c2007798d6922697df613e3d63011"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1541,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"fce4fd9c752ae931b3970a4a88a784f368cdae77678b5223c1b312f45d5e97ba"}
{"parentUuid":"196454bf-4ca0-4129-99df-2009c60b8a97","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwVmcnLj5JPEPPFeFGFC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #507, the performance work, is open and linked to trail 250, and its description is being written. All five checks pass outside the sandbox, and it doesn't conflict with #504 to #506. CI has not run.\n\n**What it fixes.** The benchmark found two real hotspots in `release`, both with byte-identical output (checked on two large cases):\n- **Preflight check:** one git process per releasing package, about 3,000 for 1,500 releasing packages. It now uses one batched `git log` plus one batched read.\n- **Package lookup:** a rescan of every package once per entry. It's now a map built once, with every call site migrated.\n\n| Case | Before | After |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `release --dry-run`, 1,800 packages (release build) | 8.1 s, 3,012 git processes | 1.3 s, 14 |\n| Same with a 20,000-commit history | 7.9 s | 1.6 s |\n| `compose-pr-body`, debug build | 12.1 s | 1.5 s |\n\n**Findings**\n- **Flat or linear:** everything else I asked about, including thousands of changesets, 20,000 tags and a 20,000-commit history.\n- **Left alone, and worth your call:** `version --emit-preview` takes 33 to 45 s at 1,800 packages when thousands are bumped. About 75% of the time is macOS `F_FULLFSYNC`, from a file and directory fsync per manifest and changelog write. That is the durability invariant in AGENTS.md, so I won't touch it without your say. Linux should be much cheaper, but isn't measured.\n\n**What I caught in review**\n- The batched `git log` used `--diff-merges=first-parent`, which needs git 2.31, and the repo documents no minimum git version. I swapped it for the older `-m` equivalent, and the merge-commit tests still pass.\n- The agent's first benchmark run briefly staged synthetic crates and created tags in the shared repo. It cleaned up, and I confirmed zero stray tags and only the seven intended files changed.\n\n**Open for 0.20.0 now:** #504 to #507. Once those merge I'll render #493 and read it as a user.\n\nneeds input: reviews on #504 to #507, a yes on the two small E165 help changes, and tell me if you want the macOS fsync cost looked at."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1713,"cache_read_input_tokens":926402,"output_tokens":768,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1713,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":768,"cache_read_input_tokens":926402,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1713,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1713},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5a2f2522-b741-4920-8279-25538c9176da","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwVmcSzrQZAcY4TkLUcJ","requestRef":"ea5c4338-c984-4e52-a54e-8a09f33f56de","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6e451e02-0346-463a-86cf-27256d64bf86","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:59:19.648Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3658a1f85bca2d75","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"perf/scale-hotspots","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
