{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"9ebb59c0-c965-4160-a05e-da2cb0db5d50","snapshotMessageId":"66c73df1-28fb-4d1a-90d9-600415eb0878","trackingPath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/memory/feedback_rust_types_not_tests_lean.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-11-11T17:48:56.839Z","realParentDir":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/memory"},"timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:48:56.842Z"}
{"parentUuid":"9ebb59c0-c965-4160-a05e-da2cb0db5d50","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0658810f-618e-4833-a9c2-dfcbe0909bad","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TTeXkVFXuXnyxdWZbi9Ce8","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/memory/feedback_rust_types_not_tests_lean.md"}]},"uuid":"5762183d-f770-42b4-b72a-3fbda004c960","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:48:56.883Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/memory/feedback_rust_types_not_tests_lean.md","content":"---\nname: rust-types-not-tests-lean\ndescription: \"Prefer compiler-enforced structure over tests, shell, text scans and string lists; delete before adding; no speculative generality. User called out over-engineering in the 0.20 stability batch.\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8\n  modified: 2026-11-11T17:48:56.843Z\n---\n\nIn Rust, enforce invariants with types (a trait bound, a private constructor, an exhaustive `match`) so the compiler checks them. A test is the fallback for what types cannot see, and it should be small.\n\n**Why:** In the 0.20 stability batch (2026-11-11) I let implementer agents add shell scripts plus text files to pin Action inputs, a source-text scan for `deny_unknown_fields`, a 21-invocation binary test for `schemaVersion` that the `Report` trait already guaranteed, a 233-code string list to classify exit codes, a Windows-length pathspec budget for an unsupported platform, and 15 new error codes (each a permanent frozen API). The user said \"you're not thinking in the rust way and you're over-engineering way too much\". The repo had already deleted a source-grepping test (#488).\n\n**How to apply:**\n- Before adding a test, ask whether a type or a private function makes the bug unrepresentable; do that instead. Reuse what is already in the tree (`insta`, `yaml-rust2`, `emit_report`/`Report`) rather than shell or text files.\n- No source-text scanning tests, no hand-maintained lists of strings that mirror code, no wall-clock assertions (count calls instead).\n- No code for unsupported platforms or hypothetical limits (docs/stability.md says Windows is unsupported).\n- Every new public surface (an error code, a JSON key, a flag) is permanent after 1.0: prefer fewer, broader ones.\n- Put \"prefer types, delete before adding, no speculative generality\" in every implementer brief, and review agent output for these before pushing.\n\nRelated: [[feedback_no_overengineering_confirm_intent]], [[feedback_measure_value_before_building]].\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"22e32aec-cc90-451c-983e-afa1f5faa2e2","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","branch":"fix/json-contract-complete","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":6,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9ebb59c0-c965-4160-a05e-da2cb0db5d50","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","