{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"d634e717-27d3-41a9-a95a-8c1c7220bf57","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:56:40.389Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"695f414a39ce3b032e2986d48ae249479dcae54fae64012bcc9ae05f86bb3ea8","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"383f0f6a-838d-4795-9159-6d6d3de6fb06","keep":10,"tail":["2d901e1df26464505b91d64bf805d8aed6a27339529c03f91a270c04abc9f3ac","1cd3f935835cab6477ea4331012f4981aec32bf0c5ed17bc49e4fe6c927b9a43","478dd67715da51b3dd001996a610b2c98e2f83e9d6e933d6d4d19614a517471a"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",12,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"b7e7413b872a3064d8cee5fa325246198136099582e6ee4ddcb2d342a469aa38"}
{"parentUuid":"32d32ebe-77a8-445e-bc7d-83806601da89","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwa9ev9kbPCTFRScpx3V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The defect hunter reported two confirmed bugs. I read the code for the first and it matches; I haven't run either repro myself.\n\n1. **`changedSinceLastTag` is wrongly false when the workspace is in a subdirectory of the git repo.**\n   - `changed.rs:67-68` builds `rev:directory` specs, and git resolves those from the repo top level, not the cwd. In a workspace at `repo/ws`, `HEAD:pkg-a` doesn't exist at either rev, so both ids come back `None` and compare equal.\n   - Committed changes are then reported as unchanged, and `release_preview.rs:638` loses its uncovered-change warnings in that layout.\n   - The fix is `rev:./dir` (and `rev:./` for the root), plus a `None`/`None` check.\n   - This is also a regression risk in my #494 perf work, which introduced the spec form.\n2. **`pre enter 01` and `pre enter beta.01` are accepted, but `version` then fails.** SemVer forbids a numeric identifier with a leading zero, so the failure comes later as E035 instead of E324 at entry. The fix is one rule in the dotted validator in `snapshot.rs`.\n\nThe hunter found nothing wrong in exit-code mapping, the JSON envelope, config validation or `add` duplicates. `first_parent_commits_by_path` and `ReleaseOwners` (#507) aren't on this branch, so they weren't reviewed. Its note that my uncommitted change deletes the `schemaVersion` test is intended: the `Report` trait now covers it.\n\nThe over-engineering audit is still running.\n\nI'd fix both as one small PR off `origin/main`, with the subdirectory case as a regression test, in a new named worktree. Say go and I'll start; it doesn't wait on the audit.\n\nneeds input: go for the PR with both fixes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1295,"cache_read_input_tokens":85941,"output_tokens":618,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1295,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":618,"cache_read_input_tokens":85941,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1295,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1295},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"af7993c4-64bd-46c6-92f7-c53034aef8bf","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgwa9efWyXDzjEr2UZHd7","requestRef":"d634e717-27d3-41a9-a95a-8c1c7220bf57","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8c173b09-6fa6-4540-9c94-84f20381c5c4","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:56:45.417Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/json-contract-complete","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
