{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":8710,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"a33ca82a-8d1e-404d-be96-61534ca663b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwaAFPq4KP3Cv2xN7Syk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The audit is back with nine findings; I haven't verified any of them against the code yet. They are ranked below by value, and every deletion is proposed, not done.\n\n| # | Finding | Where | Note |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Credential-name lists duplicated five times, and two already disagree | `runner.rs:47,63`, `provider/registry.rs:339`, `model/registry.rs:189`, test harness | The worth-doing one: drift means a secret can reach a build backend or the logs. Fix with one table in callisto-model that derives each list. |\n| 2 | `USAGE_CODES` and `RUNTIME_CODES` (about 260 codes) | `error.rs:51`, `usage_exit_codes_tests.rs:13` | Replace with an exhaustive `exit_kind()` per error type and delete both lists plus the meta-test. This is the type-based fix you asked about. |\n| 3 | About 9 source-text scanning tests | `architecture.rs`, `error_registry_architecture.rs`, `model/lib.rs`, `snapshot.rs:513` | Delete most, fold the docs check into one test. Keep the manifest-parsing tripwire. |\n| 4 | Two workflow-grep shell scripts (about 315 lines) | `.github/tests/verify-release-workflow-*.sh` | Medium risk because they enforce owner policy. Leave the action scripts that run real jq or bash. |\n| 5 | About 5 wall-clock bounds in `runner.rs` | `runner.rs:882-1487` | Drop the elapsed assertions, keep the behaviour ones. |\n| 6 | `PATHSPEC_BUDGET` chunking for Windows | `changed.rs:112-195` | Delete. The auditor notes macOS ARG_MAX is about 1 MB, so a huge monorepo could still hit it. |\n| 7 | Global mutable state | `note.rs:7`, `runner.rs:12` | Plumb a value through instead. |\n| 8 | `test_auto_traits` | `model/lib.rs:83` | Delete, the `Report` bounds already guarantee it. |\n| 9 | Redundant `_` arm | `cascade.rs:58` | Tiny cleanup. |\n\nTwo corrections to my earlier assumptions. The nine E330–E339 codes aren't on this branch (#506 is separate), so config errors are already consolidated here. The auditor also found no reinvented crates.\n\nI'd do the work as three small PRs off `origin/main`, each in its own worktree:\n- **Bug fixes:** the subdirectory `changedSinceLastTag` bug and the `pre enter 01` bug.\n- **Credential unification:** finding 1.\n- **Deletions:** findings 2, 3, 5, 6 and 8, then the shell scripts as a separate PR if you want them.\n\nneeds input: say go (or name which of these to skip) and I'll start with the bug-fix PR and the credential unification in parallel."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4926,"cache_read_input_tokens":87236,"output_tokens":998,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4926,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":998,"cache_read_input_tokens":87236,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4926,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4926},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f67875c8-26fc-4abc-9412-93354feb9297","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwaAF8CTyNF3UP9Q5k3z","requestRef":"28c277a1-3a1e-4b18-aa6b-406f55f5ecdb","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bb24ab28-cb0d-418f-8825-d03ee4ddc171","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:56:56.220Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4",