EASE_CREDENTIALS in crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/release/provider/registry.rs:339, SECRET_CREDENTIAL_ENV in crates/callisto-model/src/registry.rs:189. They differ (NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG vs CALLISTO_PUBLISH_NPM_CONFIG). Trace which environment each child process (build backend, publish, git, hooks) actually receives and from where those variables get set. Decide: can CALLISTO_PUBLISH_NPM_CONFIG or any other credential reach a build backend or be echoed unredacted? State the intended purpose of each list and propose the single table (name, secret-value?, withheld-from-build?, withheld-from-other-children?) that reproduces today's behaviour exactly, noting any behaviour that would change.\nB. Exit kind. List the enum variants (file:line, enum name) behind each code in USAGE_CODES and USAGE_WHEN_FROM_FLAG_CODES in crates/callisto-cli/src/error.rs. Say which error enums hold them and whether a `fn exit_kind(&self)` with `_ => Runtime` per enum would reproduce today's exit codes exactly, and where CliError::is_usage_error and main.rs consume it. Check docs/stability.md for what is promised.\nC. changed.rs: crates/callisto-graph/src/changed.rs changed_source_files_since_last_tag. Why are diffs pathspec-scoped? How are `ignore` excludes applied (exclude_pathspec)? Could one unscoped `git diff --name-only <commit>` per tag commit, mapped to packages via SpecIndex plus a Rust-side ignore filter (globset/ignore crates if already dependencies), give identical results? List semantics that would differ (ignore patterns, gitignored/untracked, submodules, --relative). Also note the `rev:dir` bug at lines 67-68 (git resolves rev:path from the repo top, not cwd; should be rev:./dir).\nD. Open PR overlap: for open PRs #495, #504, #505, #506, #507 on orin-dx/callisto (use `gh pr list` and `git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only origin/main origin/<branch>` pairwise), report which touch usage_exit_codes_tests.rs, error.rs, changed.rs, runner.rs, registry.rs and which pairs conflict, so a plan can order the work.\nUnder 800 words, ranked by how much each changes the plan.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a88279d0f6b9addf4.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b8c69ee1-31b9-49f7-9e60-06f6304cb096","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","branch":"fix/json-contract-complete","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":6,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0bbbaf4d-879c-432b-a999-ae84e429dce3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/json-contract-complete","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
