{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":8710,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"c46c2876-2384-411a-9312-f6d62da5e88f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwauJ9TtxqSmpfafytAe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Michi has nothing Callisto can swap in today. The michi investigation is finished; the Callisto-internals one is still running. This is a subagent's report from a read-only run, and I haven't re-checked it myself.\n\n**Verdict by area**\n\n| Area | Swap? | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| Secret redaction | No | Michi's `redact_secrets` is better (one pass, longest secret wins, idempotent), but Callisto's redactors live in `callisto-model` (MIT) and can't import the FSL `michi-core`. Callisto also masks token shapes (`npm_`, `ghp_`, `pypi-`, Bearer, `.npmrc`), which michi lacks. |\n| Retry and backoff | No | Michi's backoff differs (jitter, a max rule, async Tokio). Callisto's `Retry-After` is scraped from stderr prose, not an HTTP header, and its loop is sync with an injected `Sleeper`. |\n| Exit codes and error codes | No | `ErrorCode` is nine HTTP-flavoured categories, `exit_code()` always returns 1, and there is no exit-code registry. The coarse codes would lose information. |\n| Subprocess runner | No | Michi has nothing on subprocess execution. |\n\n**One upstream candidate:** the token-shape masker (`TOKEN_PREFIXES`, bearer, `.npmrc`) fits michi's rendering-safety remit. It passes only part of michi's \"second independent tool\" gate, so wait for another tool to need it.\n\n**What this means for the plan**\n- Michi isn't where the simplification comes from. The plan stays inside Callisto: `exit_kind()`, one credential table, the `semver::Prerelease` fix, the `SpecIndex` diff rewrite and the deletions.\n- Callisto's redaction can't use michi's cleaner implementation because of the licence split. Moving it out of `callisto-model` would be an architectural change, not a cleanup, so I'd leave it.\n- The agent didn't check whether Callisto has an equivalent of michi's `Sensitive<T>`, or `michi-graph`'s version pin.\n\nThe second agent (credential trace, `exit_kind` mapping, the `changed.rs` rewrite and PR overlap) is still running. I'll bring back the full plan when it lands."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4163,"cache_read_input_tokens":128759,"output_tokens":776,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4163,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":776,"cache_read_input_tokens":128759,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4163,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4163},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"735bed3a-9bc3-498a-9abc-66e9607ffaaa","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwauHsqteLi5e971PGs8","requestRef":"437d2387-a7a0-4d1b-afb7-2b5585f4a6e7","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"20bb9336-c955-4db8-9074-68ddd6f9c794","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:06:38.438Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/json-contract-complete","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
