{"parentUuid":"6bb03e8a-7bee-4b8b-bc1a-8e0f5effb621","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwb2DugAb9bPXSm2QtaS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Only partly. The bug-fix PR doesn't depend on the running investigation, so we can start it now. The rest of the plan needs the investigation's answers.\n\n- **Can start now:** the `rev:./dir` fix for `changedSinceLastTag`, and `semver::Prerelease` for `pre enter`. Both are confirmed and small, and each needs a regression test.\n- **Waits on the agent:**\n  - the credential table, because it decides whether this is a security fix;\n  - `exit_kind()`, because it needs the enum-by-enum mapping;\n  - the `changed.rs` rewrite, because of the ignore-pattern semantics;\n  - the PR order, because #495 and #504–#507 may conflict.\n- **Doesn't depend on it:** the invariant-ladder section in `AGENTS.md` and the Brain memory. Michi gave us nothing to change there.\n\nI'd start the bug-fix PR now in a new named worktree off `origin/main` and write the full plan when the agent reports. That should be soon, since it has been running a few minutes.\n\nneeds input: say go to start the bug-fix PR, or tell me to wait."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":140,"cache_read_input_tokens":134297,"output_tokens":462,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":86},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":140,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":462,"cache_read_input_tokens":134297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":140,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":140},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_mana