{"parentUuid":"76cec260-cdd1-46b4-a0a7-b1ac72de5ec9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwdUv18jBubkHZR6Mmof","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HwNoNp7av36H7gZK9h7gdf","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr504_body.md","content":"## Summary\n\n`docs/stability.md` promises tag names and exit codes, and neither had a test. Changing them would break users silently, so this pins both with tests that run the real binary. Test-only, no production or action code changes.\n\n- Tag names: `version`, `release plan` and `release execute` run with fake publishers. A unique package is tagged `foo@1.1.0`, a name shared by two ecosystems `cargo/foo@1.1.0`, and `tag-template` overrides both.\n- Exit codes: clap parse errors exit 2 in text and JSON mode, and `--help`, `status --help` and `--version` exit 0.\n\n`{name}` is not a `tag-template` placeholder, only `{version}`, as documented.\n\nNot pinned here: the Action inputs and strict `callisto.toml` parsing. A shell script with text lists and a source-text scan were tried and dropped as the wrong tool; unknown config keys are covered by behavior tests elsewhere.\n\n## Verify\n\nA mutation per area fails its test: qualified-prefix join, ignoring `tag-template`, and `Cli::parse` swapped for a `try_parse` that exits 1. `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI has not run.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":184114,"output_tokens":531,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":825,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"i