{"parentUuid":"7e9ed176-240e-4845-a985-6fb78fdca784","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwdkacGmkwHz7SGeX81w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#505, #504 and #507 are fixed, pushed with signed commits, and their titles and bodies match the new content. Each passed `just pre-push`, `lint`, `doc-check`, `test` and `workflow-contracts` by exit code. CI is running and all three show as blocked on it. I skipped #495 and left #506's codes as they were.\n\n| PR | Change |\n|---|---|\n| #505 | `write_json` is now crate-private `write_document`, with `write_error_json` for the error envelope. The 21-invocation `json_contract_tests.rs` is deleted because the `Report` trait already guarantees `schemaVersion`. Retitled \"refactor(cli): make untyped JSON output crate-private\". |\n| #504 | Deleted the Action-input shell script, its `.txt` lists, the `justfile` line and the `deny_unknown_fields` source-scan guard. The tag-name and exit-code tests that drive the real binary stay. Retitled \"test: pin tag names and exit codes against the real binary\". |\n| #507 | Dropped the 3,000-package wall-clock test. The counting-runner test still pins the git work. |\n\n- #504's edit to `usage_exit_codes_tests.rs` is unchanged, so its overlap with #506 is the same as before.\n- #504's body says unknown-key rejection (E325) has its own tests in `config/resolve.rs`. I saw a test match on `UnknownField` there but didn't read it end to end.\n- I used the original agents' worktrees for #504 and #507, since their branches were already checked out there.\n\n**Next:** merge as CI goes green. Then `exit_kind()` (needs #504 and #506 merged), the deletions PR, the `changed.rs` rewrite (needs #507 merged) and the bug-fix PR (not started; it needs a go).\n\nresult: #505, #504 and #507 trimmed of the over-engineering, signed and pushed with bodies updated; all five repo checks pass for each and CI is running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":950,"cache_read_input_tokens":196262,"output_tokens":742,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":88},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":950,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":196262,"cache_creation_input_tokens":950,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":950},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d8d66b2e-9f5d-4430-939c-c42c7c3dea70","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwdkaM98oTZNvpGPY9ox","requestRef":"8e039b8b-a202-4d8d-9bc6-e41fc7ef98bd","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7c615c6e-ffd7-4b55-8e3d-cacb012c8f93","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:44:00.549Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3658a1f85bca2d75","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"perf/scale-hotspots","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
