{"parentUuid":"782db6a5-b333-463b-bb47-7e17a26378f2","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"We're cutting over-engineering from the 0.20 batch and fixing two confirmed bugs; #505, #504 and #507 are now trimmed and pushed, waiting on CI. Next: say go and I'll start the bug-fix PR.","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:49:36.152Z","uuid":"ed630789-d922-46cf-a786-4f73dd815f3b","isMeta":false,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3658a1f85bca2d75","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"perf/scale-hotspots","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"ed630789-d922-46cf-a786-4f73dd815f3b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d87524e8-0dd9-482f-a90e-8a0c2568c0bc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"change #115 has one finding:\n\n<pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">\n### Medium finding\n\n**Location:** `crates/callisto-model/src/vcs/access.rs:542`\n\nWhen Git's `log.showRoot=false` is set, `--name-only` emits the root commit's hash without filenames, so the new index loses that commit. If a version was set there and publishing stopped before tagging, an unchanged retry now gets an unknown version commit and is rejected by `crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/release/local.rs:345`. Pass `--root` to preserve the previous hash-only query's behavior.\n</pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">\n"},"uuid":"c0c08d89-7aef-4a12-9587-af810824c3ea","timestamp":"2026-11-11T19:21:01.540Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":213,"turnIndex":275},"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3658a1f85bca2d75","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"perf/scale-hotspots","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
