{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"0c50e827-c4e3-4c12-ba80-ab8159805ed1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwm2MQ3MedLrpa6wtFUB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Five agents are running in parallel, each on its own branch in an isolated worktree:\n\n| Agent | Branch | Model, effort |\n|---|---|---|\n| Bug fixes (`rev:./dir`, `semver::Prerelease`) | `fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags` | Sonnet, medium |\n| `exit_kind()` replacing the code lists | `refactor/exit-kind` | Opus, high |\n| Deletions (text-scan tests, wall-clock asserts, cascade arm, `DryRun` newtype) | `refactor/delete-redundant-checks` | Sonnet, medium |\n| `note_once` without the global | `refactor/note-without-global` | Sonnet, medium |\n| `AGENTS.md` invariant-ladder section | `docs/invariant-ladder` | Sonnet, low |\n\n- **Why those models:** Opus with high effort for `exit_kind` because it needs the most judgment, and Sonnet for the rest, which are mechanical or small.\n- **Scope:** I split the file ownership so the agents don't conflict. The deletions agent is told not to touch `error.rs`, the error-code tests, `changed.rs` or `note.rs`.\n- **Rules every agent got:** signed commits, no session links, checks judged by exit code, and push without opening a PR. Each is also told to prefer types, delete before adding, and add no error codes.\n- **Wave 2, once these land:** the `changed.rs` unscoped-diff rewrite (after the bug-fix branch merges) and the error-code scanner collapse (after `exit_kind` merges).\n- **My follow-up:** changesets for the two bug fixes via the courier agents, then PR text via `courier:pr`, then a Brain memory for the invariant ladder.\n\nI'll read each report against its branch before opening any PR.\n\nneeds input: none, I'll report as the agents finish."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15258,"cache_read_input_tokens":222919,"output_tokens":630,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15258,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":630,"cache_read_input_tokens":222919,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15258,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15258},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1fe98287-b35d-481e-93cc-a396fa24305c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgwm2M8f7GMHDBNkdQVLN","requestRef":"2a2aec47-0359-4207-9508-1564181c6849","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e5546c37-ab86-48a2-8ad2-da04951f2c55","timestamp":"2026-11-11T20:19:21.081Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3658a1f85bca2d75","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"perf/scale-hotspots","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
