{"parentUuid":"49b61a39-f44c-4147-bdbc-5b5bc40b5305","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"25caeee7-c95f-47f0-b90b-e24e7845e6cc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LZcRaCt5yjkvH62cA1XrqN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-cli: minor\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\tMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n6\t\n7\t- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n8\t- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/` or an empty part (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n9\t\n10\tAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.\n11\t"}]},"uuid":"5370d94b-f729-4081-a297-3c20655591b6","timestamp":"2026-11-11T20:33:05.501Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7/.changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n\n- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/` or an empty part (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n\nAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"49b61a39-f44c-4147-bdbc-5b5bc40b5305","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userT