{"parentUuid":"197918e8-f8eb-4239-90ea-dbfa71acb640","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwn5UqxS9zzpQCa5z19k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DvhFGnK3z2VbyRytv4ZmLa","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7/.changeset/status-in-subdirectory-workspace.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\n`callisto status` and the release preview now see committed changes when your Callisto workspace is a subdirectory of the git repository.\n\n- `callisto status` reported `changedSinceLastTag: false` for packages that had commits since their last tag. It now reports `true`.\n- `callisto release --dry-run` no longer misses the warning for changed packages that have no changeset.\n- `callisto version` reads manifests and checks for pending changesets at HEAD correctly from a subdirectory workspace.\n\nNothing to do. A workspace at the repository root was never affected.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":304416,"output_tokens":607,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":80},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":389,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":607,"cache_read_input_tokens":304416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":389},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01DvhFGnK3z2VbyRytv4ZmLa":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7/.changeset/status-in-subdirectory-workspace.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\n`callisto status` and the release preview now see committed changes when your Callisto workspace is a subdirectory of the git repository.\n\n- `callisto status` reported `changedSinceLastTag: false` for packages that had commits since their last tag. It now reports `true`.\n- `callisto release --dry-run` no longer misses the warning for changed packages that have no changeset.\n- `callisto version` reads manifests and checks for pending changesets at HEAD correctly from a subdirectory workspace.\n\nNothing to do. A workspace at the repository root was never affected.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f8ede0dd-93f4-403b-adcf-5507ab3d8532","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgwn5UZLrDxTFTD7KGRPV","requestRef":"aabeba44-e2d9-4f05-8946-365adf4cfd52","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9db7f0e1-8163-4ac1-b18e-426331213847","timestamp":"2026-11-11T20:33:09.531Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"197918e8-f8eb-4239-90ea-dbfa71acb640","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"25caeee7-c95f-47f0-b90b-e24e7845e6cc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CBhqnCzj2gaeBmskWKVPFs","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7/.changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"5aa221b7-5519-43e3-a857-c28022c4de1a","timestamp":"2026-11-11T20:33:09.726Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7/.changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md","oldString":"a tag with a space, `!`, `/` or an empty part (E324)","newString":"a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324)","originalFile":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n\n- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/` or an empty part (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n\nAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":5,"oldLines":6,"newStart":5,"newLines":6,"lines":[" Mistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them."," "," - An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.","-- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/` or an empty part (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.","+- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work."," "," Action: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"197918e8-f8eb-4239-90ea-dbfa71acb640","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
