{"parentUuid":"c1cbf51e-fac2-4651-aed7-8b3dcb8233a3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwnFMDr1EL8JKA37zz1S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The changesets are committed (signed) and pushed on `fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags`, and the five checks exit 0 again. The PR text is being written.\n\n- **New changeset:** `.changeset/status-in-subdirectory-workspace.md` (patch). It covers `status` and the release preview in a subdirectory workspace. I dropped the courier draft's claim that `callisto release` reads manifests correctly now, since only the `version.rs` sites were shown affected.\n- **Folded in:** the leading-zero `pre enter` note goes into the unreleased `catch-bad-input-early.md`. Users never had a released version that accepted those tags, so a separate fix entry would have described something they never saw.\n\nI'll open the PR when the narrator returns.\n\nneeds input: none."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1805,"cache_read_input_tokens":306582,"output_tokens":260,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1805,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":260,"cache_read_input_tokens":306582,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1805},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9819259d-1318-43ce-be76-c1dc8c17b745","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwnFLtktKcdsHUtf998S","requestRef":"aa84a2d5-0e46-454a-b43a-8b35dfd84c6f","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"71b