{"parentUuid":"2e8db756-62b2-4362-9ad0-9d2d9002e4d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwnHCNqjf3ZQefUNPEX6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wave 1 is complete: four PRs are open, and I dropped the `note_once` item. All four have signed commits, and per the agents the five repo checks (`just pre-push`, `lint`, `doc-check`, `test`, `workflow-contracts`) exit 0 locally. CI hasn't run on any of them.\n\n| PR | What it does |\n|---|---|\n| #511 | Fixes two bugs: `status` and the release preview missing committed changes when the workspace is below the repo root, and `pre enter` accepting `01` and `beta.01`. It adds a changeset and folds the tag note into the unreleased `catch-bad-input-early.md`. |\n| #508 | `ExitKind` and `exit_kind()` replace the exit-code string lists and the meta-test. |\n| #509 | Deletes 143 lines of checks the compiler already enforces. |\n| #510 | The \"Enforcing an invariant\" section in `AGENTS.md`. |\n\n**Merge notes**\n- **#511 gaps:** the real binary was not run from a subdirectory workspace, and the two `release_decision.rs` sites have no dedicated regression test.\n- **#508 tradeoff:** a new usage error must be added to its `exit_kind` match deliberately, or it exits 1.\n- **#509 skips:** the `map_err` scan stays because clippy misses `|_ident|`, and the `DryRun` newtype was skipped as a net addition.\n\n**Next, after these merge:** the `changed.rs` unscoped-diff rewrite that removes the Windows pathspec chunking (it depends on #511), the error-code scanner collapse (it depends on #508), and refreshing the 0.20.0 release PR #493 so you can read its changelog before merging. I also still need to delete the leftover local `worktree-agent-*` branches and write the Brain memory for the invariant ladder.\n\nneeds input: none. Tell me when #508–#511 merge and I'll start wave 2."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":246,"cache_read_input_tokens":311666,"output_tokens":648,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":246,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":648,"cache_read_input_tokens":311666,"cache_creation_input_tokens":246,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":246},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3f597743-58f5-4137-bc60-79625a4e5b7e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwnHC5FGgAh1QWNaekRV","requestRef":"e72668d6-eb6b-4928-a6d6-85b8933b3091","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8f917ead-73bf-4ecb-83ee-d12bab49b8f3","timestamp":"2026-11-11T20:35:49.060Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
