{"parentUuid":"b796d0ab-894b-43cc-8224-4af99301d98c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"70b64f50-a594-4912-a68b-5df06771320c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T2K9ecJrEh3FSYZmtAC2fM","type":"tool_result","content":"archive/\nPLAN-release-notes.md  3.1K\nDESIGN-release-pr-apply.md  8.7K\nANALYSIS-2026-11-review-and-slop-patterns.md  12.5K\nNEXT-WORK.md  4.2K\nMICHI-FEEDBACK-0.12.md  3.4K\nDECISION-PROPOSALS-2026-10-21.md  5.9K\n# Next work\n\nLocal only, never PR it. Rewritten 2026-10-23 after the plans were found stale; earlier plans are in `archive/` (V1-REVIEW-2026-10-20, D01-DECISIONS, NPM-PUBLISH-WAVE, MICHI-GRAPH-BRIEF, MICHI-0.6-HAN\n\n## State\n\n- 0.14.0 is released. Release PR #340 is open; merge it after #342 so the reverted hints changesets drop out. The release PR head gets no CI from the workflow token: re-trigger before merging.\n- Open PRs: #341 (a registry look cannot wait past the confirmation window), #342 (revert the tag annotation hints), the docs cleanup PR.\n- Shipped and verified: canonical `eco/name` references (E316, E317), historical tag ownership, one tag and release per package, per-distribution publish ordering, redacted failure tail, npm prereleas\n- Performance: done. v0.12 to now on the synthetic fixtures: 400 packages `version` 8.4 s to 0.13 s, `release` 5.0 s to 0.10 s, `status` over 300 s to 0.15 s; 10,000 packages `version` 237 s to 2.0 s,\n\n## Open, not blocked\n\n- Private workspace root `package.json` is listed as a package (`npm/monorepo`). Needs the owner's choice of exclusion shape (lean: `[[package]] match = \"npm/monorepo\"` with `ignore = true`).\n- Fixed group cannot share one tag or one GitHub release title (E194). Design pass: ADR 9 and 12. The title is the cheap part.\n- Spec drift: the 2026-10-20 review sampled about 14% of criteria false or partly true (E-codes, matrix JSON `command` key, VER-APPLY-14). Not re-verified after the fixes since then.\n- #290 guard gaps (history capped at 100, merge-only edits missed): not re-verified after #326.\n- T12: production-path registry tests for Cargo and PyPI bypass binding; `registry_endpoint.rs` rejects non-https, loopback included. Decide the approach or drop it. T12-DX (measured under-ten-minute \n- Release target table: `matrix.rs` has its own 18 triples instead of rustc target facts (small).\n\n## Waiting on michi\n\n- `ready_by_edge` is on michi main but not in a release (0.6.0 is the only published version). When released: replace the `eligible_in` ancestor check and `is_registry_effect` with `Needs::Issued` and\n- npm `@orin-dx/michi` 0.6.0 is held until 2026-10-24 02:55 UTC.\n- michi-pipeline is not adopted: its steps need `'static` ownership and Callisto's providers are borrowed. The look-patience fix (#341) removed the reason to push for a scoped step API.\n\n## Owner decisions open\n\n- OIDC trusted publishing: npm first (`id-token: write` on `execute`, policy script change, `docs/projects/OIDC-TRUSTED-PUBLISHING.md`). Owner said post-1.0 feature to build, priority raised 2026-10-2\n- Accept ADR 12 (conditions are met per the 2026-10-23 check); ADR 11's partial revision.\n- Enable GitHub immutable releases; Entire `push_sessions` and `push_checkpoints`; the no-output publish limit.\n- Private and HTML-only PyPI; npm channel promotion; checksums; wrapper bump severity; inferred-only releases (ADR 2); release-commit provenance.\n- Decided: lockstep versioning, all four crates to 1.0, libraries documented internal; pre mode refused on the managed route (E318); W4 print-only redacted tail.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Read `AGENTS.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, the matching `docs/architecture/` topic and `docs/adr/README.md` first.\n- One `just ci` at a time (`zsh /tmp/claude-501/ci.sh <worktree> <log>`; read the log's own `exit=` line). No parallel cargo builds in one checkout.\n- Measure before building an optimization (see memory: measure-value-before-building).\n- Stacked PRs are native GitHub stacks (`gh stack link`). No force pushes, no session links, one line per Markdown paragraph.\n- Worktree sessions: `/usr/bin/git`, plain commands, scripts written with the Write tool.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8eab7953-6112-4c12-80de-4c0f584cc5cd","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:02:15.152Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"archive/\nPLAN-release-notes.md  3.1K\nDESIGN-release-pr-apply.md  8.7K\nANALYSIS-2026-11-review-and-slop-patterns.md  12.5K\nNEXT-WORK.md  4.2K\nMICHI-FEEDBACK-0.12.md  3.4K\nDECISION-PROPOSALS-2026-10-21.md  5.9K\n# Next work\n\nLocal only, never PR it. Rewritten 2026-10-23 after the plans were found stale; earlier plans are in `archive/` (V1-REVIEW-2026-10-20, D01-DECISIONS, NPM-PUBLISH-WAVE, MICHI-GRAPH-BRIEF, MICHI-0.6-HAN\n\n## State\n\n- 0.14.0 is released. Release PR #340 is open; merge it after #342 so the reverted hints changesets drop out. The release PR head gets no CI from the workflow token: re-trigger before merging.\n- Open PRs: #341 (a registry look cannot wait past the confirmation window), #342 (revert the tag annotation hints), the docs cleanup PR.\n- Shipped and verified: canonical `eco/name` references (E316, E317), historical tag ownership, one tag and release per package, per-distribution publish ordering, redacted failure tail, npm prereleas\n- Performance: done. v0.12 to now on the synthetic fixtures: 400 packages `version` 8.4 s to 0.13 s, `release` 5.0 s to 0.10 s, `status` over 300 s to 0.15 s; 10,000 packages `version` 237 s to 2.0 s,\n\n## Open, not blocked\n\n- Private workspace root `package.json` is listed as a package (`npm/monorepo`). Needs the owner's choice of exclusion shape (lean: `[[package]] match = \"npm/monorepo\"` with `ignore = true`).\n- Fixed group cannot share one tag or one GitHub release title (E194). Design pass: ADR 9 and 12. The title is the cheap part.\n- Spec drift: the 2026-10-20 review sampled about 14% of criteria false or partly true (E-codes, matrix JSON `command` key, VER-APPLY-14). Not re-verified after the fixes since then.\n- #290 guard gaps (history capped at 100, merge-only edits missed): not re-verified after #326.\n- T12: production-path registry tests for Cargo and PyPI bypass binding; `registry_endpoint.rs` rejects non-https, loopback included. Decide the approach or drop it. T12-DX (measured under-ten-minute \n- Release target table: `matrix.rs` has its own 18 triples instead of rustc target facts (small).\n\n## Waiting on michi\n\n- `ready_by_edge` is on michi main but not in a release (0.6.0 is the only published version). When released: replace the `eligible_in` ancestor check and `is_registry_effect` with `Needs::Issued` and\n- npm `@orin-dx/michi` 0.6.0 is held until 2026-10-24 02:55 UTC.\n- michi-pipeline is not adopted: its steps need `'static` ownership and Callisto's providers are borrowed. The look-patience fix (#341) removed the reason to push for a scoped step API.\n\n## Owner decisions open\n\n- OIDC trusted publishing: npm first (`id-token: write` on `execute`, policy script change, `docs/projects/OIDC-TRUSTED-PUBLISHING.md`). Owner said post-1.0 feature to build, priority raised 2026-10-2\n- Accept ADR 12 (conditions are met per the 2026-10-23 check); ADR 11's partial revision.\n- Enable GitHub immutable releases; Entire `push_sessions` and `push_checkpoints`; the no-output publish limit.\n- Private and HTML-only PyPI; npm channel promotion; checksums; wrapper bump severity; inferred-only releases (ADR 2); release-commit provenance.\n- Decided: lockstep versioning, all four crates to 1.0, libraries documented internal; pre mode refused on the managed route (E318); W4 print-only redacted tail.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Read `AGENTS.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, the matching `docs/architecture/` topic and `docs/adr/README.md` first.\n- One `just ci` at a time (`zsh /tmp/claude-501/ci.sh <worktree> <log>`; read the log's own `exit=` line). No parallel cargo builds in one checkout.\n- Measure before building an optimization (see memory: measure-value-before-building).\n- Stacked PRs are native GitHub stacks (`gh stack link`). No force pushes, no session links, one line per Markdown paragraph.\n- Worktree sessions: `/usr/bin/git`, plain commands, scripts written with the Write tool.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"261a298c-2009-4da9-8de9-53a908f59d15","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","branch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b796d0ab-894b-43cc-8224-4af99301d98c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
