{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"3526ffa7-6a49-40e1-80ef-a9e55a8b3d76","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:05:36.012Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"695f414a39ce3b032e2986d48ae249479dcae54fae64012bcc9ae05f86bb3ea8","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"10afb777-4ef3-4442-83a6-c8e962d26a5a","keep":348,"tail":["61cda661b1025d57918db9fd51c4ce0d4ca083edc4b63dcd731b878b00d23378","4a2ae21bd8b2279803dc0621fa679a3e860b6e01ac26dd3a678eb759d8120c42"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",349,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"b3b56c0e5097febbc1514ada2156d5c7dba3114cdcb2399fcbc708b327194c72"}
{"parentUuid":"96521bbb-0588-4dfc-8599-89611191e683","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwpZFH9Tk8pmbeQPhbXS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The duplicate-load investigation is done, and it closes the question: don't change this. This is the agent's report, read but not re-run by me.\n\n- **Cost:** about 200 ms per extra load at 1,800 packages, much less in typical repos.\n- **Only redundant duplicate:** `release plan` loads the workspace twice with nothing written in between. Fixing it needs new `_in(&Workspace)` variants (2 CLI callers, about 6 in tests), which cuts against \"delete before adding\". The saving is marginal, so I'd skip it.\n- **Deliberate re-loads, leave alone:** `release`, `release execute` and the Python publish path re-load on purpose as an integrity check. Sharing the workspace would weaken the check.\n- **`init`:** each load uses a different config, so they can't be shared. It runs once per repo.\n- **`note_once`:** it has 2 non-test call sites, not the 8 the earlier agent reported (`walk.rs:213` and `ignore_walk.rs:152`). It would still be needed for `init` and the validate flows. Keep it.\n\nSo the answer to \"can we drop the global\" is no, and no PR comes out of this. That also corrects my earlier guess that the duplicate load was a real waste worth a refactor.\n\nWaiting on the docs-versus-code drift audit, which is still running.\n\nneeds input: none."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1820,"cache_read_input_tokens":319872,"output_tokens":446,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1820,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":446,"cache_read_input_tokens":319872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1820,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1820},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4c2b9c36-739f-4673-abc1-f58537ac5a44","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwpZEzYKWWRBhzWRkQLq","requestRef":"3526ffa7-6a49-40e1-80ef-a9e55a8b3d76","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5aacaf56-3b20-49f9-b438-ce05de68eb33","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:05:40.096Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
