{"parentUuid":"9a1a9b68-9468-4078-a0e8-5b086b8a17cf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8ec2ac28-8d31-4dfa-909f-a9559b62cf93","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014iQUi6LahQow5QatqQYXJQ","type":"tool_result","content":" crates/callisto-cli/src/cli.rs |  2 +-\n docs/specs/cli.json            | 18 +++++++++---------\n 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)\n-    /// Tag to append to the snapshot version (e.g. a commit SHA or branch name).\n+    /// Tag to append to the snapshot version (letters, digits and `-` only, e.g. a short commit SHA or PR number).\n-      \"criterion\": \"`callisto help` prints the root help; `callisto help <command>` (nested names accepted as multiple words) prints that subcommand's help; an unknown command name exits 1 naming it. `callisto completions <shell>` never offers a hidden subcom\n+      \"criterion\": \"`callisto help` prints the root help; `callisto help <command>` (nested names accepted as multiple words) prints that subcommand's help; an unknown command name exits 2 with `E283` naming it. `callisto completions <shell>` never offers a h\n-      \"criterion\": \"When a command fails under `--format json`, stderr ends with a JSON object `{\\\"schemaVersion\\\", \\\"command\\\", \\\"error\\\": {\\\"code\\\", \\\"message\\\", \\\"help\\\", \\\"path\\\"}}` and the exit code is 1; `command` is the subcommand that was parsed and `\n+      \"criterion\": \"When a command fails under `--format json`, stderr ends with a JSON object `{\\\"schemaVersion\\\", \\\"command\\\", \\\"dryRun\\\", \\\"error\\\": {\\\"code\\\", \\\"message\\\", \\\"help\\\", \\\"path\\\"}}` and the exit code is 1, or 2 for a usage error as defined in \n-      \"criterion\": \"When a command fails under text format, stderr shows a diagnostic with an error code and a message, and the exit code is 1.\",\n+      \"criterion\": \"When a command fails under text format, stderr shows a diagnostic with an error code and a message