arent; no non-numeric code. Keep the existing helper style in crates/callisto-graph/tests/common if reusable. Delete the superseded tests, the `include_str!` file list, the history comment in model/lib.rs, and any hard-coded code lists. Do not weaken any property: before deleting a test, name the property it guarded and the new test that covers it, and demonstrate by a throwaway mutation (duplicate a code, remove a code from docs/errors.md, remove a `code(...)` from one variant; revert after) that the consolidated test fails for each. Prefer a net deletion of lines.\nREPORT (under 200 words): the property map (old test -> new test), net lines removed/added, mutation results, commit signed?, five verify results, anything unproven.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a062b7dd650f28157.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8aa93a79-3a09-47f6-8bad-879383f5874b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","branch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b3f3e1fd-1eaf-4733-a422-c93ebdc54420","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682