{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"ec0595aa-58da-40e8-9d1c-c7ea2800d564","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwqFDtvPsPFCeYzBcix5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"With #508–#511 merged, wave 2 is running. I confirmed that the open docs branch merges cleanly into the updated main.\n\n**Running now**\n- **`refactor/changed-files-without-pathspecs`** (Sonnet, high): replaces the pathspec chunking and `PATHSPEC_BUDGET` in `changed.rs` with one unscoped `git diff` per tag commit, mapped through `SpecIndex`, with ignore patterns applied via `globset`. Output must not change, and it's told to report any glob-semantics difference.\n- **`refactor/one-error-code-scan`** (Sonnet, medium): collapses the overlapping error-code scanners into one test that discovers source files itself, with no hand-kept file list. Before deleting each old test it must show the new one fails on a duplicate code, a code removed from the docs, and a variant without a code.\n- **PR text** for `docs/align-cli-spec-with-exit-codes` (the spec exit-code fixes, the `snapshot --tag` help, and the envelope `dryRun` key). I'll open that PR when the text returns.\n\n**Waiting on you**\n1. Should bad flag values uniformly exit 2? Today an unknown `--package` exits 1 (E102) but E227 exits 2.\n2. Should `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` be documented as an alias or removed?\n\n**Also pending:** refreshing release PR #493 (0.20.0) so you can read the rendered changelog, which I'll do once these land. The Brain memory for the invariant ladder and the leftover `worktree-agent-*` branches also wait. You asked me to keep that work until your review is done.\n\nneeds input: decisions 1 and 2."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8605,"cache_read_input_tokens":342032,"output_tokens":562,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8605,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":562,"cache_read_input_tokens":342032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8605,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8605},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d5d6d8bc-42d5-404a-89c4-5963cfb5c162","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwqFDV84gbgvSMfE79ey","requestRef":"67d98704-627b-4778-bda8-e207d8f7ffeb","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7e494d4a-ab6e-40e0-b4dd-3be8fbf167d8","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:14:42.812Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"docs/align-cli-spec-with-exit-codes","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
