{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"454da981-d4da-444a-a0b6-41c0e8974fd0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwqmKWrNdmaci6xkcuSv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#513 (the scanner collapse) is open, and the `changed.rs` rewrite passes my review, with its PR text being written.\n\n- **Rewrite:** +63/−138 across `changed.rs` and `vcs/access.rs`. It deletes `PATHSPEC_BUDGET`, `list_in_chunks`, `exclude_pathspec` and the Windows-only chunking. It runs one unscoped diff per tag commit and filters through `globset`.\n- **Checks and signature:** all five repo checks exit 0, per the agent, and GitHub reports the commit `valid`.\n- **Output:** unchanged for the default ignore list. The only production caller passes `DEFAULT_IGNORED_PATHS`.\n- **One difference:** `{a,b}` is treated as alternation by `globset` and not by git. No default pattern uses braces and users can't supply ignore patterns, so nothing reaches it today.\n- **Improvement:** a `pkg[1]` directory is now matched literally, with a new real-git test.\n- **Not measured:** the diff on a very large workspace. The cost should be small, since the unscoped diff lists only files changed since the tag, but that's unverified.\n\nI'll open the PR when the text returns. PR #512 (CLI spec exit codes) and #513 are open for your review, along with the pending decisions on exit-2 consistency and the `pre-major-inference` alias.\n\nneeds input: the two pending decisions, whenever you're ready."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1641,"cache_read_input_tokens":378071,"output_tokens":486,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1641,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":486,"cache_read_input_tokens":378071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1641,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1641},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"73818777-79c3-406d-ba41-857cbec12c1d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwqmK6Yo9RaYEfecNzjj","requestRef":"f440bd4f-e6ba-403d-ab2d-5832724a88a2","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"24cf956e-f5d5-482c-b314-b33e778d4105","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:21:30.108Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
