{"parentUuid":"e9222bd8-4477-4cad-9ba3-9e80029cf00f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6b7c858c-20ba-40c0-9e3d-ce3a9d0561be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A1gJVoYC6r3MbiavEK8EDS","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias/.changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"999127ff-8a36-4dba-b0e7-9f815333df23","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:25:55.434Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias/.changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md","oldString":"Action: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.","newString":"- `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` is rejected (E256). It was accepted as `off` but never documented; use `\"off\"`.\n\nAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it, and replace `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` with `\"off\"`.","originalFile":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n\n- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n\nAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":4,"newStart":7,"newLines":6,"lines":[" - An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored."," - `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work."," ","-Action: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.","+- `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` is rejected (E256). It was accepted as `off` but never documented; use `\"off\"`.","+","+Action: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it, and replace `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` with `\"off\"`."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e9222bd8-4477-4cad-9ba3-9e80029cf00f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
