{"parentUuid":"3ad66db8-c378-44af-9e32-a3269d10556b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwrRLiazHS6WMwkxwn5y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything that didn't need your merges or decisions is done. Four PRs are open, and the release PR and the exit-code decision are the only open items.\n\n**Open PRs (all signed, five repo checks exit 0 locally, CI not yet run)**\n- **#512:** aligns `docs/specs/cli.json` with the real exit codes and fixes the `snapshot --tag` help.\n- **#513:** one error-code registry test replaces the overlapping scanners (net −244 lines).\n- **#514:** removes the Windows pathspec chunking in `changed.rs`; output unchanged.\n- **#515:** removes the undocumented `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` alias, with a bullet in the unreleased changeset. This is my call, made because the alias appears nowhere in the docs. If you'd rather keep it, close #515 and document it instead.\n\n**Also done:** the Brain memory for the invariant ladder is recorded, and my own feedback memory has the follow-up notes from this session.\n\n**Decided, no PR:** the duplicate workspace load stays. The re-loads in the release validate flows are deliberate, and `note_once` stays.\n\n**Not done**\n- **Uniform exit 2 for bad flag values:** unknown `--package` exits 1 (E102) while E227 exits 2. This is a frozen 1.0 behavior and your decision. It would build on `exit_kind`, which is merged, so it's a small change once you choose.\n- **Release PR #493 (0.20.0):** blocked, and the changelog should be read after #512–#515 merge. I haven't refreshed it.\n- **Leftover agent worktrees and local branches:** untouched, per your earlier instruction to keep the work.\n\nneeds input: the exit-2 decision, and a go on the #493 refresh after #512–#515 merge."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_read_input_tokens":399093,"output_tokens":595,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":399093,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"277ffd18-38c6-4983-9a04-bdfbfe1881de","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwrRLTTqs74XwDtxjcHX","requestRef":"75f6fa15-0fdb-4bc1-9003-3f1d0d5ab894","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"92a2e576-498a-4ab1-8183-d975c95e6d85","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:30:07.284Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
