{"parentUuid":"74b6b60e-b10e-4f29-a89e-c743ecd89fa5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwuj7WwEhbfTqTbqd9m1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Updated: I fetched Caliper's refs (your working tree wasn't touched) and found the code. Your local Caliper `main` was 437 commits behind, which is why it looked missing earlier. The `states_bases` code is on `origin/main` and on `origin/feat/checker-supplies-facts`, which I'm taking to be change #224. I haven't fixed or run anything.\n\n**The finding holds on that branch**\n- **Where:** `crates/semantic/src/convert.rs`, in the name-only traversal around line 400. It calls `base_types` only when `states_bases(&info)` is true. The `else` branch returns `Vec::new()`.\n- **The gate:** `states_bases` checks `object_flags & (OBJECT_CLASS | OBJECT_INTERFACE) != 0`.\n- **Why it fails:** in TypeScript, an instantiated generic like `Props<string>` carries the `Reference` object flag, and the `Interface` flag sits on its generic target. So the check rejects it, the traversal stops with an empty list, and `HTMLAttributes` never reaches `composes`, which `component.rs` then uses.\n- **Not proven:** the TypeScript flag behavior is from my reading of how the checker reports types, not a run. A fixture with exactly `Props<string> extends React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>` would confirm it.\n\n**Fix direction:** when a type has the `Reference` flag, resolve its generic target and follow that, so the `HTMLAttributes` bases are retained. I haven't checked whether the RPC layer already has a call for resolving the target, so that part is open.\n\nI can't change Caliper from this session, whose write access is limited to Callisto worktrees. Your Caliper checkout is also on `main`, with an untracked `apps/validate/` directory I left alone.\n\nneeds input: a session working in Caliper. Tell me to start one on `feat/checker-supplies-facts` with a regression fixture for `Props<string>`, or paste the branch where you want it fixed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1822,"cache_read_input_tokens":406032,"output_tokens":1157,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":483},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1822,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1157,"cache_read_input_tokens":406032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1822,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1822},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b0dc4abc-5af0-41a6-bca6-a5b0188848ed","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgwuj79rTFTUMYVAqVgZ4","requestRef":"8c957203-b8a9-4598-b1a4-c28995656d57","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a8696c9d-cb79-49a4-abc7-974d1ee6a9b5","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:13:32.834Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
