{"parentUuid":"c8df341e-645e-4dcd-930b-0e11742162e2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwx7BV9Yb3z4sp9s5NAR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cleanup is done. All 15 agent worktrees and 32 local branches are gone, with nothing unpushed lost.\n\n**Removed**\n- **Worktrees (15):** I confirmed each was clean (no uncommitted changes) and had nothing ahead of its remote before removing it. That included the four locked ones: `fix/input-validation`, `fix/error-envelope`, `fix/note-once` and `fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags`. Their PRs (#501, #499, #496, #511) are merged.\n- **Local branches (32):** the 15 branches belonging to those worktrees, plus 17 strays: the `worktree-agent-*` branches, `refactor/note-without-global`, and `perf/batch-changed-files` (#494, merged). The strays had no commits beyond `origin/main`.\n\n**Left in place**\n- **In use:** the main checkout, `docs/changeset-process` (#495, open) and `fix/drop-false-inference-alias` (#515, open).\n- **Not mine:** the four `~/Projects/callisto-fixtures/` worktrees (`wt-cleanup-1/2/3` and `clean-cleanup`) and their `chore/callisto-*` branches. They look like an earlier cleanup effort, and I haven't checked whether they're merged.\n\n**Remote branches:** I didn't delete any on `origin`. The branches for the merged PRs #501 and #503–#514 are still there for you to delete, or turn on GitHub's auto-delete on merge.\n\nI'm still working from the `drop-false-inference-alias` worktree, so #515 keeps it.\n\nresult: cleanup done: 15 merged agent worktrees and 32 local branches removed after confirming each was clean and fully pushed; open-PR worktrees and the callisto-fixtures worktrees untouched."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":310,"cache_read_input_tokens":421297,"output_tokens":607,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool