{"parentUuid":"6beff09e-4285-4ecb-aa3c-0911a2c0f3f6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwxFzHToL3BQWhk9MWQW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's what I'd tackle, in order. Items 1 and 2 are small and block merges, and item 3 needs your decision.\n\n1. **Unblock the Dependabot PRs.** #516 fails on the action-pin mismatch, and #517 (cargo routine crates) may have the same kind of problem. Fix the pin in `install-workflow-linters/action.yml`, and add `/.github/actions/` to the Dependabot config so it stops recurring. Small.\n2. **Fix the Python requirement parser bug.** The proptest found `¡[\\u{b}[`, where parse, render and parse again isn't idempotent. It's a real bug, and it will flake CI on random runs until fixed. One PR with the regression seed. Small to medium.\n3. **Decide uniform exit 2 for bad flag values.** Today unknown `--package` exits 1 (E102) but E227 exits 2. Exit codes freeze at 1.0, so this has to be decided before the release. It builds on the merged `exit_kind`, and the change itself is small once you choose.\n4. **Land #515 and #495, then refresh and read release PR #493 (0.20.0).** You said to include the stability and performance work in that release. I'd read the rendered changelog as a user before merging.\n5. **Caliper change #224 fix.** It needs a session in the Caliper repo, with a `Props<string>` regression fixture.\n6. **Further v1 work.** `NEXT-WORK.md` is stale, so I'd rewrite it first from verified state. The open items there need your decisions: the private workspace root listed as a package, the fixed-group tag and title (E194), and OIDC publishing.\n7. **Leftover audit items, lower value.** The `docs/errors.md` help wording that paraphrases the code, the two workflow-grep scripts, near-identical tests that `rstest` could collapse, and the `has_*` bools in `init.rs`. None are urgent.\n\nI'd start with 1 and 2 in parallel, since they're independent. I'd use a Sonnet agent for the pin fix and Opus at medium effort for the parser bug, because it needs judgment about requirement syntax.\n\nneeds input: say go for 1 and 2 (or reorder), and give me the exit-2 decision for item 3."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1064,"cache_read_input_tokens":430224,"output_tokens":1029,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":281},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1064,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1029,"cache_read_input_tokens":430224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1064,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1064},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"963617e9-e93c-4a47-8030-9a23bff2ae71","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwxFyzbYUn1Kw1pjJQE1","requestRef":"904a8f4d-5dc8-4606-8168-129b3c8047aa","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"34636039-fe38-4636-bd56-b58a46f64137","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:46:44.787Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
