{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"c0543be2-8f41-4437-85f0-1d741280a795","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:52:48.965Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"695f414a39ce3b032e2986d48ae249479dcae54fae64012bcc9ae05f86bb3ea8","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"79ffecb2-8682-46f7-9209-187fb6df49d2","keep":578,"tail":["5c2cfb6228545328cb06caf23323d27a6b1ad5063a2c5c369a166617ff63a6da","8919126f04c9b3b088414beb0238ba3d4686b287427850adab20d440d54de804","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",580,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"13b3abb1a4ffcc88188781f4b8f6bfe272e49ff0a4d7b968cf4ac4d7ce70faa6"}
{"parentUuid":"aef0ec56-bf72-4646-93a3-e5dd6459bb3f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwxjSuMhpSDZvQY1JLc1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Not in the repo, but the scratch scripting is excessive. Of the files added to `origin/main` since yesterday, the only `.sh` or `.py` file ever added was `.github/tests/verify-action-inputs.sh`, from #504. I deleted it before #504 merged, and it isn't on `main`. No script from this work is in the repo.\n\n**Outside the repo: yes, I overdid it.** My session scratch directory holds 226 `.sh` and `.py` files. Three kinds:\n- **The `verify.sh` wrapper.** It runs the same five `just` recipes and prints PASS/FAIL. Each agent runs the repo's own `just` recipes anyway, so the wrapper adds nothing and depends on a path outside the repo. Agents calling `just pre-push && just lint && …` directly would do the same job.\n- **Hundreds of one-off edit and probe scripts.** I wrote them because the worktree guard rejects compound git commands and heredocs, so each multi-step git or file operation needed a script file. Plain Edit/Write plus separate single commands would have worked for most of them.\n- **Python edit scripts from the changeset work.** I used these for text edits that the Edit tool does directly.\n\nNone of this ships, and the scratch directory is deleted with the job, so there's no repo debt. But it costs tokens and obscures what I ran.\n\n**From here on:** I'll use the Edit and Write tools for file changes and plain `just` recipes for checks, and I'll keep scripts only where the worktree guard forces a multi-step git sequence. I'll also stop pointing agents at my `verify.sh` in new briefs. The five agents already running have it in their prompts, so those finish as they are.\n\n**Repo scripts that remain:** the `.github/tests/*.sh` files were already there and aren't from this session. The over-engineering audit currently running covers whether any of them should go."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":326,"cache_read_input_tokens":451339,"output_tokens":620,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":326,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":620,"cache_read_input_tokens":451339,"cache_creation_input_tokens":326,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":326},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1f1ac5fd-4ad8-49d2-abe1-ed01e985844b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwxjSeEcfm2suqnMr4PA","requestRef":"c0543be2-8f41-4437-85f0-1d741280a795","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d0cb61dd-e6ea-4639-b770-7080cd70d407","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:52:54.731Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a444090653d1cbe25","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
