{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"09b9daba-c01c-4598-a753-bbf2de163216","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwxpes5ftqVyw9yjHctu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eight agents are now running in parallel. I'll review each branch and open its PR as it reports.\n\n| Agent | Branch | Content |\n|---|---|---|\n| Dependabot pin | pushed to #516's branch, plus `ci/dependabot-composite-actions` | Fixes the mismatched `install-action` pin and makes Dependabot cover composite actions. It also reports why #517 fails. |\n| Python parser | `fix/python-requirement-idempotency` | Parse, render, parse idempotency, with the regression seed. |\n| Exit 2 | `fix/flag-value-errors-exit-2` | Flag-caused errors exit 2, classified per call site. |\n| `errors.md` wording | `docs/errors-fix-column` | The Fix column now matches the code's help text. |\n| Delete atomic alias | `refactor/drop-manifests-atomic-alias` | Removes the 117-line alias, repoints its users and deletes the duplicate tests. |\n| Exhaustive matches | `refactor/exhaustive-matches` | Wildcard arms hiding new variants, such as the one in `walk.rs` that would silently turn a new ecosystem into npm. |\n| Flags to enums | `refactor/flags-to-enums` | `ProviderCapabilities` and the `init` platform bools become enums, so invalid states can't exist. |\n| Audit | done | I used its findings to launch the three branches above. |\n\n**Skipped from the audit, deliberately**\n- **Narrowing about 138 `pub` items in `callisto-graph`:** the libraries are documented as internal, and the count is only a lower bound.\n- **`LockfileRefreshResult.success`:** it's always true, but it's a JSON field, so removing it is a wire change you should decide on.\n- **Test tables:** a table would save about 250 lines at best.\n- **The `runner.rs` helper dedupe:** about 30 lines, low value. `wait-timeout` as a dependency was rejected, because it wouldn't remove the capture logic that holds the real invariants.\n\nneeds input: one decision, when you have a moment. Should I remove the always-true `success` field from `LockfileRefreshResult` before 1.0, or leave it documented? I'll bring back the branches as they report."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9042,"cache_read_input_tokens":459661,"output_tokens":749,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9042,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":749,"cache_read_input_tokens":459661,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9042,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9042},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d84f3145-fa98-4fe0-bec7-348459317d39","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwxpeZEEvtcWR3wvFMQo","requestRef":"13f3eb49-91d6-499b-8eb4-77f188234f47","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"62ad53a6-85af-438f-a7aa-db87450dd26c","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:54:05.230Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a444090653d1cbe25","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
