, neutral). I ran no `--log-failed` because nothing failed.\n</agent-message>","reason":"absorbed_mid_turn","commandUuid":"13956653-faa9-4cbf-9f1a-9d151fae27d6","deliveryId":"f76c1451-fe64-4bc0-bd4e-27570968f5b7"}
