{"parentUuid":"54bb669f-a57e-4035-8491-f4bc3d6ddf2b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwyfmJQ1yrAgEVvh34ze","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LLLcPJRHAWn2jw5WW1rzZF","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_dependabot.md","content":"## Summary\n- Dependabot's github-actions ecosystem now scans `/.github/actions/*` as well as `/`.\n- Dependabot PR #516 (taiki-e/install-action 2.88.0 to 2.90.1) failed Workflow Contracts: it bumped the pin in four workflow files but not in the composite action `.github/actions/install-workflow-linters/action.yml`, and `verify-action-pins.sh` requires one commit per action across the repo.\n- Cause: `.github/dependabot.yml` listed only `/`, and Dependabot does not edit composite actions under `.github/actions/` unless that directory is listed. Every bump of an action used in both places would fail the same way.\n- The mismatch on #516 itself was fixed separately by a commit on that Dependabot branch.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix: CI configuration only.\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] None needed: CI configuration only.\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None apply: no flow, flag, config key or spec'd behavior changed.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n- [ ] Not proven: Dependabot's handling of the new `directories` glob cannot be tested locally. The next action-bump PR will show whether it also updates `install-workflow-linters/action.yml`; if it does not, the glob needs revisiting.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1941,"cache_read_input_tokens":510034,"output_tokens":601,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"se