{"parentUuid":"961c0cc5-db7b-496c-98fd-5e86b880d01a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"55fd7449-25d6-4254-8edc-5f53ec06365a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AEUSTGaAdXvjWhRhTZQUXZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-cli: minor\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\tUsage errors now exit 2, as the stability promise says, so a script can tell a mistake in the command from a failure in the workspace.\n6\t\n7\t- A bad or missing flag value that Callisto checks after parsing now exits 2, like a clap-level mistake always did. Examples: `add --package a:patch`, `add --package cargo/a:bogus`, `add` without `--summary`, `init` without `--yes` and without a terminal, `snapshot --tag` with a space, and `--dry-run` on commands that need an output file.\n8\t- Failures about your workspace, config, git or registries still exit 1.\n9\t- The JSON error envelope is unchanged.\n10\t\n11\tAction: a script that checks for exit code 1 after a bad argument must also accept 2. Checking for any non-zero code is unaffected.\n12\t"}]},"uuid":"7066a732-ca77-4452-b73f-f53780c65d37","timestamp":"2026-11-11T23:09:41.786Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a444090653d1cbe25/.changeset/usage-errors-exit-2.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nUsage errors now exit 2, as the stability promise says, so a script can tell a mistake in the command from a failure in the workspace.\n\n- A bad or missing flag value that Callisto checks after parsing now exits 2, like a clap-level mistake always did. Examples: `add --package a:patch`, `add --package cargo/a:bogus`, `add` without `--summary`, `init` without `--yes` and without a terminal, `snapshot --tag` with a space, and `--dry-run` on commands that need an output file.\n- Failures about your workspace, config, git or registries still exit 1.\n- The JSON error envelope is unchanged.\n\nAction: a script that checks for exit code 1 after a bad argument must also accept 2. Checking for any non-zero code is unaffected.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"961c0cc5-db7b-496c-98fd-5e86b880d01a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a444090653d1cbe25","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
