ere). Facts: docs/stability.md promises exit 2 for a bad or missing argument or flag, including values validated after parsing, but several flag-caused failures exited 1. Now exit 2 (via `exit_kind()`): an unknown package passed with `--package` on add, matrix and release (E102), invalid `init --forge-repository` (E187) and `--product-package` (E189), `release pending --from` that is not a release commit (E328), a repeated `--package` in a release selection (E169, only the Duplicate reason), invalid `--decision`/`--preview`/`--snapshot` values (E281), `release execute` flags contradicting the intent (E232, E233), and `release plan --artifact-repository` mismatching the config (E230, only at the plan site: a `from_flag: bool` field was added to that variant's two call sites, no new code or key). Still exit 1 on purpose: a valid flag meeting workspace, config, git or intent state that cannot support it (E188, E299, E219, E308, E304, E202, E234, E277, E123, E124), and the same value read from callisto.toml, a changeset or pre.json. Not changed: E103 (add --package reaches it, but a changeset can too through version, and the variant carries no origin). The rule is added to docs/stability.md (one sentence). Spec text updated: docs/specs/cli.json (CLI-ADD-06, CLI-INIT-12), matrix.json, release.json line ~410. Tests: usage_exit_codes_tests.rs has one real-binary case each for E102, E169, E328, E281 and a new init test (E187 and E189 exit 2, E188 exits 1); no binary tests for E230/E232/E233 because they need the release-plan machinery. Changeset: the existing unreleased `.changeset/usage-errors-exit-2.md` was extended (script action: a check for exit code 1 after a bad argument must also accept 2; a check for any non-zero code is unaffected). Net +61/-12 (code and docs) plus the changeset. This is a behavior change on a surface that freezes at 1.0, decided by the maintainer's agent-assisted recommendation: call it out as a decision to confirm before merge. Verify: just pre-push, lint, doc-check, test exit 0; workflow-contracts exited 1 once in an unrelated flaky shell test (test_release_pr_contract.sh, SIGPIPE exit 141) and passed on re-run; CI has not run. Rules: succinct, plain, one line per paragraph (never hard-wrap), no emoji, no AI slop, no session links or Claude trailers. Return JSON per your contract.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/aa72a10295a8a9601.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7e7b8cfc-4798-4509-890c-35edc97f33d1","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a444090653d1cbe25","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a444090653d1cbe25","branch":"fix/flag-value-errors-exit-2","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a444090653d1cbe25","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5f12d37d-da1f-4dc4-8148-42ec61b30e32","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a444090653d1cbe25","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/flaky-release-pr-contract","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
