200 and 1,800 packages vs the previous numbers in docs or PR #507 (release --dry-run about 1.3 s at 1,800).\nREPORT (under 700 words): ranked list of verified 1.0 blockers (with evidence and smallest fix), then things that can wait, then stale items you found already done. Mark anything you could not verify. Do not pad."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ae0650a6-cc99-4f3c-8869-06ca7aecea4a","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgx7xHJKC4iNhzRmNqWhr","requestRef":"546d0eb3-79b9-4579-b38b-b72415460116","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"383cff2f-a4e3-4102-8af5-ae97b54b16e7","timestamp":"2026-11-12T00:54:04.875Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a444090653d1cbe25","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/flag-value-errors-exit-2","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"383cff2f-a4e3-4102-8af5-ae97b54b16e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx7xHbBTSvNWuvagXT6C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013JzJCo5z8XFbBU6EA3Stc2","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Remove always-true LockfileRefreshResult success","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","effort":"medium","isolation":"worktree","run_in_background":"true","prompt":"You work in an isolated git worktree of orin-dx/callisto (Rust release CLI). Read AGENTS.md (\"Enforcing an invariant\") and docs/stability.md (how breaking changes to a report are versioned). `git fetch origin` then `git switch -c refactor/lockfile-refresh-result origin/main`.\nHOUSE RULES: prefer types so wrong states cannot exist; delete before adding; add no error code/flag; one-line comments only for a non-obvious WHY. Commit signed (`git commit -S`; if gpg fails inside the sandbox retry that same command with dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true; never gpgsign=false); no Claude-Session trailers or claude.ai links. Verify by EXIT CODE with the repo's recipes, one at a time, run with dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true after committing: `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test`, `just workflow-contracts` (all exit 0; if workflow-contracts fails with 141, re-run it once). Push `git push -u origin refactor/lockfile-refresh-result`. No PR, no changeset (the caller writes it).\nTASK: `LockfileRefreshResult` (crates/callisto-model/src/report.rs ~103) has `success: bool` that is constructed only with `true` (crates/callisto-graph/src/apply.rs ~760; failures return `Err`), plus `exit_code: Option<i32>` alongside it that is redundant. It is a field of a serialized report, so removing it is a wire change. First read docs/stability.md and docs/specs/*.json and `callisto schema` source to see how a removed field must be versioned (schemaVersion bump? deny_unknown_fields on the reader side? the camelCase-field test?), and what reports carry it (version/ snapshot reports?). If it can be removed with a schemaVersion bump that stability.md allows pre-1.0, do it: remove `success` (and `exit_code` if it is also always None or derivable), bump the affected report's schemaVersion constant and update the checked-in schema/spec/test expectations (insta snapshots, docs/specs/*.json, the schema command output) so everything agrees; make it the smallest consistent change. If the change would require touching many report consumers or cannot be done consistently, STOP and report instead of forcing it.\nREPORT (under 150 words): which report(s) and schemaVersion changed, fields removed, files touched, commit signed?, the five exit codes, anything you stopped on."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1012,"cache_read_input_tokens":592520,"output_tokens":3527,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1392},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1012,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3527,"cache_read_input_tokens":592520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1012,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1012},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013JzJCo5z8XFbBU6EA3Stc2":{"description":"Remove always-true LockfileRefreshResult success","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","effort":"medium","isolation":"worktree","run_in_background":"true","prompt":"You work in an isolated git worktree of orin-dx/callisto (Rust release CLI). Read AGENTS.md (\"Enforcing an invariant\") and docs/stability.md (how breaking changes to a report ar