{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"b37a59e3-521c-42dd-b56c-e0a082bec73b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx8Myqkykgq5hk9qHzjF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FtGPZ7HpUVtNYXmT5pmvZJ","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a4acf55fce15d0b8f/.changeset/lockfile-refresh-drop-success.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nThe `version` JSON report's lockfile refresh result no longer has `success` or `exitCode`, and the `status`, `version`, `snapshot` and `matrix` reports now say `schemaVersion: 3`.\n\n- `success` was always `true`, because a failed refresh stops the command with error E208 instead of appearing in the report. `exitCode` only mirrored `success`.\n- Only the `version` report changed shape. The other three reports change just their `schemaVersion`, because they share one version number.\n\nBreaking: scripts that read `success` or `exitCode` from the lockfile refresh result of `version --format json` get nothing back. Check the command's exit code instead. A script that pins `schemaVersion` to 2 for `status`, `snapshot` or `matrix` must accept 3.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4108,"cache_read_input_tokens":616932,"output_tokens":399,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4108,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":399,"cache_read_input_tokens":616932,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4108},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_mana