{"parentUuid":"6128637d-2f81-42d1-a91f-0ec16b53bfdc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx8PtaoY6WaCfkZ2S3Gq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RdCPf1j7aid3VCV5A8w87B","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_lockfile.md","content":"## Summary\n- `LockfileRefreshResult` in the `version` report had `success: bool` that was only ever `true` (a failed refresh returns error E208 and never reaches the report) and `exit_code: Option<i32>` that only mirrored it. Both fields are removed.\n- Because those are fields of a serialized report, the shared `PACKAGE_REPORT_SCHEMA_VERSION` goes from 2 to 3. That constant is shared by the `status`, `version`, `snapshot` and `matrix` reports (its doc comment says they move together), so all four now say `schemaVersion: 3` even though only the `version` report changed shape. Splitting the constant would add one more; I kept the existing design.\n- Touched: `callisto-model/src/report.rs`, `callisto-graph/src/apply.rs`, the schema-guard and CLI tests, and `docs/specs/cli.json` and `matrix.json`.\n- Decision to confirm before merge: this removes a field from the JSON output before 1.0 (preferred over freezing an always-true field) and bumps schemaVersion on three reports that did not change shape. If the second part is unwanted, the alternative is a separate constant for the `version` report.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Breaking change: JSON report fields and `schemaVersion`. Migration: stop reading `success` and `exitCode` from the lockfile refresh result (use the command's exit code), and accept `schemaVersion: 3` for `status`, `snapshot` and `matrix`.\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/lockfile-refresh-drop-success.md` (minor, with Breaking and Action lines, like the other unreleased breaking entries).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] `docs/specs/cli.json` (CLI-OUT-05) and `docs/specs/matrix.json` updated to schemaVersion 3.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [x] The schema-guard test now rejects `exitCode` on `refreshCommand` instead of the removed field\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":736,"cache_read_input_tokens":621569,"output_tokens":929,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":736,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":929,"cache_read_input_tokens":621569,"cache_creation_input_tokens":736,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":736},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01RdCPf1j7aid3VCV5A8w87B":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_lockfile.md","content":"## Summary\n- `LockfileRefreshResult` in the `version` report had `success: bool` that was only ever `true` (a failed refresh returns error E208 and never reaches the report) and `exit_code: Option<i32>` that only mirrored it. Both fields are removed.\n- Because those are fields of a serialized report, the shared `PACKAGE_REPORT_SCHEMA_VERSION` goes from 2 to 3. That constant is shared by the `status`, `version`, `snapshot` and `matrix` reports (its doc comment says they move together), so all four now say `schemaVersion: 3` even though only the `version` report changed shape. Splitting the constant would add one more; I kept the existing design.\n- Touched: `callisto-model/src/report.rs`, `callisto-graph/src/apply.rs`, the schema-guard and CLI tests, and `docs/specs/cli.json` and `matrix.json`.\n- Decision to confirm before merge: this removes a field from the JSON output before 1.0 (preferred over freezing an always-true field) and bumps schemaVersion on three reports that did not change shape. If the second part is unwanted, the alternative is a separate constant for the `version` report.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Breaking change: JSON report fields and `schemaVersion`. Migration: stop reading `success` and `exitCode` from the lockfile refresh result (use the command's exit code), and accept `schemaVersion: 3` for `status`, `snapshot` and `matrix`.\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/lockfile-refresh-drop-success.md` (minor, with Breaking and Action lines, like the other unreleased breaking entries).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] `docs/specs/cli.json` (CLI-OUT-05) and `docs/specs/matrix.json` updated to schemaVersion 3.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [x] The schema-guard test now rejects `exitCode` on `refreshCommand` instead of the removed field\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d7ace4ce-b9ba-471e-b4a8-d31ee14e03bd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgx8PtKgPrWgKFq2vXK5R","requestRef":"db4621ae-f5cb-40f6-ad3a-23e009d79077","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fd1e6318-c477-4e0e-9bcb-cfaa6a626cae","timestamp":"2026-11-12T00:59:37.722Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a4acf55fce15d0b8f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
