{"parentUuid":"e27ccf44-2e0d-4283-a7e9-7166f536e403","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"46a99c82-2069-4d31-b822-5b5effb1145d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U7Be9EgiKKunMwdj3o21Hw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcallisto-cli: minor\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\tMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n6\t\n7\t- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n8\t- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n9\t\n10\t- `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` is rejected (E256). It was accepted as `off` but never documented; use `\"off\"`.\n11\t\n12\tAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it, and replace `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` with `\"off\"`.\n13\t"}]},"uuid":"3290ba60-9dd0-434b-94d3-630d5f9aa557","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:07:54.445Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list/.changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n\n- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n\n- `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` is rejected (E256). It was accepted as `off` but never documented; use `\"off\"`.\n\nAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it, and replace `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` with `\"off\"`.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e27ccf44-2e0d-4283-a7e9-7166f536e403","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"docs/changeset-list-fix","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
