with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.","-"," - `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` is rejected (E256). It was accepted as `off` but never documented; use `\"off\"`."," "," Action: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it, and replace `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` with `\"off\"`."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bcfa291f-c2e8-4092-b0bf-10d400e21ec2","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"docs/changeset-list-fix","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
