{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"2570aa76-3556-4d0e-9a44-b721f0e6917e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx96tFbPYVqMobV3KJ7m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, a few things are worth settling before 0.20.0. The release PR itself is ready to read: `main` is green and #493 is out of draft, with 15 changes and clear Breaking and Action notes.\n\n**Decide before cutting 0.20.0**\n1. **#526 (drops `success` and `exitCode`, schemaVersion 2 to 3):**\n   - Merge it first, so the breaking JSON change ships once. A schemaVersion bump on four reports is awkward to follow one release later.\n   - Decide whether `status`, `snapshot` and `matrix` should really move to 3 when only `version` changed shape. The alternative is a separate constant for `version`.\n   - If you merge #526, #493 regenerates and gains its changeset, so I'd re-read it once more.\n2. **#527 (changeset list nit):** merge it so the `pre-major-inference` note renders in the same list. It's a one-line fix I opened just now.\n3. **Exit-2 boundary (#523, already merged):** the one thing I'd still want you to confirm is leaving E103 at exit 1. `add --package` reaches it, but a changeset can too through `version`, and the variant carries no origin. If you'd rather make it exit 2 for the flag case, that's a small follow-up.\n\n**Worth doing before the release if you have the appetite**\n- **A real-binary run from a subdirectory workspace.** PR #511 fixed the `rev:./dir` bug in six sites, but the agent didn't run the binary there, and two sites have no dedicated test. It's about 30 minutes of checking, and it's the least-proven fix in this release.\n- **The 1.0 blockers check is still running.** Its list of unenforced `stability.md` promises is exactly what you'd want before another breaking release, so I'd read it before merging #493.\n\n**Can wait until after the release**\n- The `pub` narrowing, the test tables and the `runner.rs` dedupe (all low value).\n- Caliper change #224, which needs its own session.\n\nMy recommendation: merge #527 and #526, wait for the blockers report, then I'll re-read #493 and you merge it.\n\nneeds input: your call on #526 (merge as is, or split the constant for `version` only)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":229,"cache_read_input_tokens":643929,"output_tokens":726,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":229,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":726,"cache_read_input_tokens":643929,"cache_creation_input_tokens":229,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":229},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"af54405c-7d41-4ab2-8129-c9ccee2a226f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgx96sxyvYYP2XooRmEki","requestRef":"f560dfe5-aecf-48f5-85da-c3562d573dd3","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"64289ad1-c90e-4c60-b1ec-48d22a59bda2","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:08:54.216Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"docs/changeset-list-fix","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
