{"parentUuid":"6b3ecf8c-849d-43f1-99b8-18d3a16e04d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx98BtHK8Q65hThDADB8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PYrbiV59zwBpkPudQx68fM","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Contain emit and decision paths","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","effort":"medium","isolation":"worktree","run_in_background":"true","prompt":"You work in an isolated git worktree of orin-dx/callisto (Rust release CLI). Read AGENTS.md (\"Enforcing an invariant\") and docs/stability.md. `git fetch origin` then `git switch -c fix/contain-emit-paths origin/main`.\nHOUSE RULES: prefer types and reuse; add NO new error code, flag or JSON key; delete before adding; one-line comments only for a non-obvious WHY. Commit signed (`git commit -S`; if gpg fails inside the sandbox retry that same command with dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true; never gpgsign=false); no Claude-Session trailers or claude.ai links. Verify by EXIT CODE with the repo's recipes, one at a time, run with dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true after committing: `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test`, `just workflow-contracts` (all exit 0; re-run workflow-contracts once if it fails). Push `git push -u origin fix/contain-emit-paths`. No PR, no changeset (the caller writes it).\nPROBLEM (verified by reading code on origin/main): (1) `callisto version --emit-decision <path>` (crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/version.rs ~47-55) does `ws.root.join(path)` with no containment check, so `../x` or an absolute path writes outside the workspace, and `--emit-preview <path>` (`global.resolve_file_arg`, ~60) likewise; `release plan`'s decision path IS validated in crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/release.rs ~495-520 (`CliError::ReleaseDecisionOutsideSource`, `ReleaseDecisionPathInvalid`, both usage errors exiting 2). (2) `callisto release pending --decision ../x` exits 1 with a raw git error (E051) instead of a usage error.\nTASK: reproduce each with the real binary in a temp fixture (`cargo run -q -p callisto-cli -- ...` under $TMPDIR; build once), then fix by REUSING the existing validation from release.rs (extract a small shared helper if the logic is inline; do not duplicate it) so: `version --emit-decision` rejects a path outside the workspace root with the existing outside-source error (exit 2) BEFORE anything is written; `version --emit-preview` — first decide from docs/specs, docs/releasing.md and the release-PR action script (.github/actions/callisto-action/scripts/create-or-update-release-pr.sh) whether the preview file is legitimately written outside the workspace (e.g. to a runner temp dir); if it is, leave --emit-preview alone and say so; if not, contain it the same way; `release pending --decision` with a path outside the workspace or otherwise invalid exits 2 with the same existing error instead of E051. Do not break the action script's use of these flags (grep .github for emit-decision, emit-preview, --decision). Add one real-binary test per fixed case to crates/callisto-cli/tests/usage_exit_codes_tests.rs (exit 2, nothing written outside) and update docs/specs/release.json and docs/stability.md only if they say otherwise.\nREPORT (under 200 words): what you reproduced, what changed, what you left alone (esp. --emit-preview) and why, commit signed?, five exit codes."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,"cache_read_input_tokens":649704,"output_tokens":3322,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":809},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":707,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3322,"cache_read_input_tokens":649704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,