sage error.\nTASK: reproduce each with the real binary in a temp fixture (`cargo run -q -p callisto-cli -- ...` under $TMPDIR; build once), then fix by REUSING the existing validation from release.rs (extract a small shared helper if the logic is inline; do not duplicate it) so: `version --emit-decision` rejects a path outside the workspace root with the existing outside-source error (exit 2) BEFORE anything is written; `version --emit-preview` — first decide from docs/specs, docs/releasing.md and the release-PR action script (.github/actions/callisto-action/scripts/create-or-update-release-pr.sh) whether the preview file is legitimately written outside the workspace (e.g. to a runner temp dir); if it is, leave --emit-preview alone and say so; if not, contain it the same way; `release pending --decision` with a path outside the workspace or otherwise invalid exits 2 with the same existing error instead of E051. Do not break the action script's use of these flags (grep .github for emit-decision, emit-preview, --decision). Add one real-binary test per fixed case to crates/callisto-cli/tests/usage_exit_codes_tests.rs (exit 2, nothing written outside) and update docs/specs/release.json and docs/stability.md only if they say otherwise.\nREPORT (under 200 words): what you reproduced, what changed, what you left alone (esp. --emit-preview) and why, commit signed?, five exit codes."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"bc15bbe4-23a1-4186-b25b-33f6f19ee69c","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgx98BafWmUv2fpbPm1Ep","requestRef":"b76875e0-1f68-40d5-a6d8-6fc57fb634ec","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5d449591-eeaf-40b1-990a-95b10d6f4025","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:09:20.953Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","sessionId":"6cc3e