git commit -S`; if gpg fails inside the sandbox retry that same command with dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true; never gpgsign=false); no Claude-Session trailers or claude.ai links. Verify by EXIT CODE with the repo's recipes, one at a time, run with dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true after committing: `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test`, `just workflow-contracts` (all exit 0; re-run workflow-contracts once if it fails). Push `git push -u origin fix/contain-emit-paths`. No PR, no changeset (the caller writes it).\nPROBLEM (verified by reading code on origin/main): (1) `callisto version --emit-decision <path>` (crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/version.rs ~47-55) does `ws.root.join(path)` with no containment check, so `../x` or an absolute path writes outside the workspace, and `--emit-preview <path>` (`global.resolve_file_arg`, ~60) likewise; `release plan`'s decision path IS validated in crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/release.rs ~495-520 (`CliError::ReleaseDecisionOutsideSource`, `ReleaseDecisionPathInvalid`, both usage errors exiting 2). (2) `callisto release pending --decision ../x` exits 1 with a raw git error (E051) instead of a usage error.\nTASK: reproduce each with the real binary in a temp fixture (`cargo run -q -p callisto-cli -- ...` under $TMPDIR; build once), then fix by REUSING the existing validation from release.rs (extract a small shared helper if the logic is inline; do not duplicate it) so: `version --emit-decision` rejects a path outside the workspace root with the existing outside-source error (exit 2) BEFORE anything is written; `version --emit-preview` — first decide from docs/specs, docs/releasing.md and the release-PR action script (.github/actions/callisto-action/scripts/create-or-update-release-pr.sh) whether the preview file is legitimately written outside the workspace (e.g. to a runner temp dir); if it is, leave --emit-preview alone and say so; if not, contain it the same way; `release pending --decision` with a path outside the workspace or otherwise invalid exits 2 with the same existing error instead of E051. Do not break the action script's use of these flags (grep .github for emit-decision, emit-preview, --decision). Add one real-binary test per fixed case to crates/callisto-cli/tests/usage_exit_codes_tests.rs (exit 2, nothing written outside) and update docs/specs/release.json and docs/stability.md only if they say otherwise.\nREPORT (under 200 words): what you reproduced, what changed, what you left alone (esp. --emit-preview) and why, commit signed?, five exit codes.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/ac9ece27b6e55b889.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"bc15bbe4-23a1-4186-b25b-33f6f19ee69c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","branch":"docs/changeset-list-fix","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5d449591-eeaf-40b1-990a-95b10d6f4025","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8"