hort bullets only where they add something, plain language, no AI slop, one line per paragraph; mark Breaking if scripts could break. Front matter `callisto-cli: minor` like the other unreleased breaking CLI entries unless their convention says otherwise. Return ready-to-write file text with a kebab-case file name, plus changeset@3 JSON. Do not write files."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3581,"cache_read_input_tokens":672127,"output_tokens":944,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3581,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":944,"cache_read_input_tokens":672127,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3581,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3581},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01CFH1piwcAFxSSs4TAjTe26":{"description":"Changeset for contained decision paths","subagent_type":"courier:changeset-analyzer","model":"sonnet","effort":"medium","run_in_background":"true","prompt":"Produce changeset text for orin-dx/callisto branch `fix/contain-emit-paths` (base main). Diff: `git diff origin/main...origin/fix/contain-emit-paths` (run from /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/fix-changeset-list; do not cd elsewhere). First read the unreleased `.changeset/` files on origin/main (`git ls-tree --name-only origin/main .changeset/`, then `git show origin/main:.changeset/<file>`) and fold into an existing entry only if it is the same user-visible outcome; otherwise write a new file. Facts (verified by running the old and new code): before, `callisto version --emit-decisio