{"parentUuid":"25409841-f30a-4cc2-bc5b-018c02bbc7aa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx9fzUpocUAmYWPiTcSA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TVyR2H1hRZGj7GtoVxm8w7","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-ac9ece27b6e55b889/.changeset/contain-decision-paths.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nBreaking: `version --emit-decision` and `release pending --decision` now reject a decision path outside the workspace, as `release plan` always did.\n\n- `version --emit-decision ../x` or an absolute path outside the workspace used to write the decision file there and exit 0. It now exits 2 with E225 (outside the workspace) or E226 (invalid path) and writes nothing.\n- `release pending --decision ../x` used to fail with exit 1 and a raw git \"outside repository\" error. It now exits 2 with E225 or E226.\n- `version --emit-preview` is unchanged, so a preview can still go to a temp file outside the workspace.\n- A workspace-relative path, such as the release PR action's `--emit-decision \"$INPUT_DECISION_PATH\"`, works as before.\n\nAction: a script that passes an absolute or `../` decision path to `version --emit-decision` or `release pending --decision` must use a path inside the workspace.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4243,"cache_read_input_tokens":679561,"output_tokens":445,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4243,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":445,"cache_read_input_tokens":679561,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4243,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemera