{"parentUuid":"a0bdeda9-2b4d-4af2-8c70-3b28f33ef4f5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx9haJ5jKWWefGK3jNa2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HiQ2p6aKxLMfXeU7M43eNk","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_contain.md","content":"## Summary\n- `version --emit-decision <path>` wrote the release decision file wherever the path pointed, including outside the workspace via `../` or an absolute path (exit 0), and `release pending --decision ../x` failed with exit 1 and a raw git \"outside repository\" error. `release plan` already validated its decision path.\n- The inline validation in `release plan` is extracted into `workspace_decision_path` in `commands/release.rs`, still returning E225 (`ReleaseDecisionOutsideSource`) and E226 (`ReleaseDecisionPathInvalid`). It also accepts a not-yet-existing absolute path inside the workspace (its parent must exist), because `--emit-decision` names a new file.\n- `release plan` uses the helper unchanged. `release pending --decision` and `version --emit-decision` now call it too, and both exit 2. `version --emit-decision` checks before anything is written. No new error code.\n- `version --emit-preview` is unchanged on purpose: the release PR action passes `preview_file=$(mktemp)`, outside the workspace. The action's `--emit-decision \"$INPUT_DECISION_PATH\"` is workspace-relative and still works.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n- [x] Breaking change: a script that passes an absolute or `../` decision path to `version --emit-decision` or `release pending --decision` must use a path inside the workspace.\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/contain-decision-paths.md` (minor, with Breaking and Action lines, like the other unreleased breaking CLI entries).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None needed: `docs/specs/release.json` and `docs/stability.md` already describe the decision path as workspace-relative.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [x] Two real-binary tests in `usage_exit_codes_tests.rs`: `version --emit-decision` with absolute and `../` paths exits 2 and writes nothing, and `release pending --decision` gives E226 for `../x` and E225 for an absolute outside path. Run against `origin/main`, both fail as described (`release pending` exits 1 with the raw git error; `version --emit-decision` exits 0 and writes outside).\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":684373,"output_tokens":988,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":731,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":988,"cache_read_input_tokens":684373,"cache_creation_input_tokens":731,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":731},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01HiQ2p6aKxLMfXeU7M43eNk":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_contain.md","content":"## Summary\n- `version --emit-decision <path>` wrote the release decision file wherever the path pointed, including outside the workspace via `../` or an absolute path (exit 0), and `release pending --decision ../x` failed with exit 1 and a raw git \"outside repository\" error. `release plan` already validated its decision path.\n- The inline validation in `release plan` is extracted into `workspace_decision_path` in `commands/release.rs`, still returning E225 (`ReleaseDecisionOutsideSource`) and E226 (`ReleaseDecisionPathInvalid`). It also accepts a not-yet-existing absolute path inside the workspace (its parent must exist), because `--emit-decision` names a new file.\n- `release plan` uses the helper unchanged. `release pending --decision` and `version --emit-decision` now call it too, and both exit 2. `version --emit-decision` checks before anything is written. No new error code.\n- `version --emit-preview` is unchanged on purpose: the release PR action passes `preview_file=$(mktemp)`, outside the workspace. The action's `--emit-decision \"$INPUT_DECISION_PATH\"` is workspace-relative and still works.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n- [x] Breaking change: a script that passes an absolute or `../` decision path to `version --emit-decision` or `release pending --decision` must use a path inside the workspace.\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/contain-decision-paths.md` (minor, with Breaking and Action lines, like the other unreleased breaking CLI entries).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None needed: `docs/specs/release.json` and `docs/stability.md` already describe the decision path as workspace-relative.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [x] Two real-binary tests in `usage_exit_codes_tests.rs`: `version --emit-decision` with absolute and `../` paths exits 2 and writes nothing, and `release pending --decision` gives E226 for `../x` and E225 for an absolute outside path. Run against `origin/main`, both fail as described (`release pending` exits 1 with the raw git error; `version --emit-decision` exits 0 and writes outside).\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"3b082d93-5b98-49ff-a39a-9f118a9fd651","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgx9hZyEYxB4AdMooqo1e","requestRef":"dd0ee40f-addd-416c-b411-79b2f5bfa422","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d725fcbc-b8e3-4082-b5c8-2b9dca71fa6b","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:16:44.531Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","e