{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"e77cfbf9-7d35-4071-a4e7-960bce4419fa","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:17:21.640Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"061c200486ebc9b0312f567dd75bc581bc0a5e74fd96255fbb8887ebe6350a68","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"e2c2e26e-52b9-44a3-b4d2-5a9d0d812078","keep":863,"tail":["d97951ff02eccd97d0e2803c244a1241bb5845cf9f2e4450cd1297370614abb3","1008ca30de97f2aa13d3424a2ca7657927616d67759365644b215055d8ce9904","41d93bbfb52011e0642c79c34afc54c3cc4c2007798d6922697df613e3d63011"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",865,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"69ad26acb2edd96f51e309b1f0228d7c31e7fdd5d043c43bf6aa337562b624ae"}
{"parentUuid":"3cbfb4eb-dc52-4901-9075-275e0350da58","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx9kkRNSzvPdPboHKPmy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two more PRs are open and every commit on them shows `valid` on GitHub.\n\n- **#528: keep decision paths inside the workspace.**\n  - `version --emit-decision` and `release pending --decision` now reject paths outside the workspace with the existing E225/E226 at exit 2, and `version --emit-decision` rejects them before writing anything.\n  - I ran its tests against the old `main` code and they fail there as claimed.\n  - It has a Breaking changeset (`contain-decision-paths.md`, minor, like the other unreleased breaking entries).\n- **#529: snapshot every report schema.**\n  - Eight `insta` snapshots, driven by clap's `value_variants()`, with a mutation check that failed when I renamed a field.\n  - If #526 and #529 both merge, the second needs its `version` snapshot regenerated, which the PR text says.\n\n**Open PRs now:** #526 (drops `success`/`exitCode`, schemaVersion 3), #527 (changeset list nit), #528, #529, plus the release PR #493 and the older #495.\n\n**Suggested merge order:** #527 first (trivial), then #528, #526 and #529 in whichever order you prefer. #493 regenerates after each, and I'll re-read it before you merge the release.\n\n**Still waiting on your decisions** from the 1.0 blockers report:\n1. **Action inputs:** trim or hide the internal ones (`version_command`, `decision_path`, `setup_callisto`, `release_branch`), or state which are promised.\n2. **`release pending`:** promise it, or list it as plumbing.\n3. **ADR 12:** flip it to Accepted.\n4. **#526:** whether `status`, `snapshot` and `matrix` should really move to schemaVersion 3 too, or only `version`.\n\nneeds input: your decisions on those four, and the merges when you're ready."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":687799,"output_tokens":617,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":617,"cache_read_input_tokens":687799,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"61cd242b-cf16-4e0f-93a7-82c737fc0b1d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgx9kk6mCvrEP7iScZkFf","requestRef":"e77cfbf9-7d35-4071-a4e7-960bce4419fa","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"875d9525-e3aa-4eba-8273-45ded7cdb0fc","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:17:26.517Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-ac9ece27b6e55b889","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/contain-emit-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
