{"parentUuid":"74258fcd-b155-4a67-8cbf-1eb29cc4aa29","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx9peeUBEpqfSvLVrFH6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #529 is closed and I've saved the lesson to memory. The branch `test/schema-goldens` still exists on `origin`, and I haven't deleted it.\n\nSince you're asking, here are the other things I did this session that may be heavier than they're worth, so you can veto them:\n- **#528 (decision-path containment):** small and defensible. It reuses existing validation and adds two real-binary tests and no new codes. I'd keep it, but it is a breaking change, so say if you'd rather not take it in this release.\n- **#526 (drop `success`/`exitCode`):** it bumps `schemaVersion` on four reports for one removed always-true field. If that feels like churn, the lighter option is to leave the field in place and document it. Your call.\n- **The 1.0 blockers list:** items 3 to 5 (action inputs, `release pending`, ADR 12) are decisions, not work. I won't build anything for them until you choose.\n\nneeds input: whether to keep #526 as is, split its constant, or drop it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1991,"cache_read_input_tokens":688977,"output_tokens":330,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1991,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":330,"cache_read_input_tokens":688977,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1991},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8320e40