{"parentUuid":"43115a7e-711d-4d91-956d-0d7df9479ff3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx9yvXCeqmgv4zUDNuWi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's my recommendation on each, with the timing, in order of what blocks 0.20.0.\n\n| Decision | Recommendation | Why | When |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **#526** (drop `success`/`exitCode`, schemaVersion 3) | **Merge as is** | The field is always true and `exitCode` just mirrors it. Removing it before 1.0 costs one more Breaking note in a release that already has about eight, while after 1.0 it would be a major bump. The shared bump to 3 on `status`, `snapshot` and `matrix` is how the project already versions these four reports, and the only user is you. Dropping the PR is also fine if you'd rather have zero more churn; it just leaves a permanent wart. | Before 0.20.0 |\n| **E103 exit code** (left at 1) | **Leave it** | `add --package` reaches it, but a changeset can too, and the error carries no origin. Fixing it means threading an origin through for one edge case. | No action |\n| **Action inputs** (12 in, 3 out; snake_case in, camelCase out, frozen on `@v1`) | **Mark the internal ones, don't trim or rename** | Mark `version_command`, `decision_path`, `setup_callisto` and `release_branch` as internal in their `action.yml` descriptions, with one sentence in `stability.md` saying only documented inputs are promised. That's about 6 lines and no behavior change. Renaming to one case would break every current workflow, for nothing. | Before 1.0, after 0.20 |\n| **`release pending`** | **List it as CI plumbing** | The release workflow uses it, and `stability.md` already has a plumbing list. One line there avoids both hiding the command and promising its output. | Before 1.0, after 0.20 |\n| **ADR 12** (still \"Proposed\" though implemented) | **Flip to Accepted** | E316/E317 are enforced and tags follow it, so the status is simply stale. Add one line recording what remains of ADR 11. | Before 1.0, after 0.20 |\n\nThe last three are about 15 lines of docs in total, so I'd do them in one small PR right after 0.20.0 ships and not hold the release for them. The one remaining pre-release item is the subdirectory-workspace run. Merge order: #527, #528, #526, then I re-read #493.\n\nneeds input: say \"yes\" to take these recommendations. I'll then do the subdirectory run now and prepare the one docs PR (action inputs, `release pending`, ADR 12) to open after the release."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57,"cache_read_input_tokens":692388,"output_tokens":1824,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":988},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1824,"cache_read_input_tokens":692388,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cd8279b0-02bf-4815-9b04-43e10671b6cd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgx9yvEpw9K6JJ7sn6gHr","requestRef":"cb7b4ae1-b320-4c1b-9ed2-a6fe2dbdcde6","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d35c3b2e-b4e0-4305-9a43-589396af6368","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:20:36.567Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-ac9ece27b6e55b889","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/contain-emit-paths","slug":"m