{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"3b0152db-b527-450f-b211-410a4b5acd8a","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:25:47.484Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"061c200486ebc9b0312f567dd75bc581bc0a5e74fd96255fbb8887ebe6350a68","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"79c54b38-8969-443a-831c-01d00fd0e055","keep":920,"tail":["b14627608cc4819f315871b48eec38de2c0a5d7a3a00fda8ec83bce98b006b24","096c0707b62761f8e8730578296b305334ed1ef374456c68e670af0b612a9686","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",922,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"0298625a32cc28f1cd64df1f8df3b4c87e6d2cafe5f20d14c0a041682fece616"}
{"parentUuid":"a0667367-774c-4da1-816a-e8c55f7367be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxAQ3BxSSzNQsi6JhBta","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The finding on change #136 is valid, and it's fixed and pushed on #528. All three commits show `valid` on GitHub, and `just pre-push`, `lint`, `doc-check`, `test` and `workflow-contracts` all exit 0.\n\n- **The bug:** for an absolute decision path whose file is missing, my helper canonicalized only the parent directory. If that parent was missing too (for example `.callisto/` on a first run), `canonicalize(parent)` failed with `NotFound` and the command exited 1. Before #528 the path was joined to the workspace root and the writer created the missing directories, so this was a regression for absolute paths.\n- **What isn't affected:** workspace-relative paths, which the release PR action uses (`--emit-decision \"$INPUT_DECISION_PATH\"`). The helper doesn't touch them.\n- **Proof:** I added a real-binary test (an absolute path under `.callisto/nested/` that doesn't exist). It exited 1 before the fix and passes after.\n- **Fix:** `canonicalize_through_missing` canonicalizes the nearest existing ancestor and re-appends the missing components, as the finding suggested. The earlier tests still pass, so `../x` and absolute paths outside the workspace are still rejected with E225/E226 at exit 2.\n- **Edge left as is:** an absolute path that goes through missing directories and then uses `..` (such as `/ws/missing/../../x`) fails with an I/O error at exit 1 and not a usage error. It's a contrived input, so I didn't add handling.\n\nThe subdirectory-workspace run I'd started is still pending. I built the binary from `main` but haven't run the scenarios yet.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll do the subdirectory run next, then the docs PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":225,"cache_read_input_tokens":715295,"output_tokens":587,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":225,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":715295,"cache_creation_input_tokens":225,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":225},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"793c9a7d-b230-4190-a567-ff058a451aa5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxAQ2odiTR6fVeK8EroE","requestRef":"3b0152db-b527-450f-b211-410a4b5acd8a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"cafebd76-a263-43b0-8ff5-cc268551b3a0","timestamp":"2026-11-12T01:25:52.126Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-ac9ece27b6e55b889","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/contain-emit-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
