{"parentUuid":"581ec66e-f185-4d0c-88ac-2f218bd292f7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxTuRCZt37imXaCz4JeW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BVtNpmS5wfCbaZ9eisN7NA","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_docs_contract.md","content":"## Summary\n- The four Action inputs that are plumbing (`version_command`, `decision_path`, `release_branch`, `setup_callisto`) are marked \"Internal: may change without notice.\" in `action.yml`. `docs/stability.md` now says only the inputs and outputs documented as supported are promised, and the ones marked Internal are not.\n- `release pending` is listed in `docs/stability.md` next to the CI plumbing. It shows in `release --help` and the release workflow uses it; its JSON follows the report envelope, but its flags are not part of the 1.0 CLI promise.\n- ADR 12 is Accepted (E316 and E317 are enforced and tags follow it), its README row is updated, and ADR 11 says ADR 12 revises its selector-promotion half. The directory key and default tag stand.\n- `docs/stability.md` gains a `--dry-run` row: accepted by every command, writes nothing on commands that write, does nothing on read-only commands, and is a usage error where it cannot apply (for example `release plan`). This matches `docs/specs/cli.json` and changes no behavior.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Documentation only\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] None needed: docs and action input descriptions only; no input, flag or behavior changes.\n\n## Docs\n- [x] `docs/stability.md`, `docs/adr/0011` and `0012`, `docs/adr/README.md`, and the `description:` text of four inputs in `.github/actions/callisto-action/action.yml`.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just doc-check`, `just pre-push`, `just lint` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [ ] Not verified: the ADR 12 ownership derivation and rerun semantics were spot-checked, not fully traced\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n\n<!-- entire