r.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Documentation only\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] None needed: docs and action input descriptions only; no input, flag or behavior changes.\n\n## Docs\n- [x] `docs/stability.md`, `docs/adr/0011` and `0012`, `docs/adr/README.md`, and the `description:` text of four inputs in `.github/actions/callisto-action/action.yml`.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just doc-check`, `just pre-push`, `just lint` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [ ] Not verified: the ADR 12 ownership derivation and rerun semantics were spot-checked, not fully traced\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d35a98e4-08e1-448e-a90e-5df73eabae7c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgxTuQpzEJh4RmpBYbt7A","requestRef":"b5cbe2e1-5f81-4382-a4fe-e37db4b25f83","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6139a1dd-3946-4289-98ff-5eb9028311f5","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:15:27.323Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3331bef90d4c2276","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"docs/1-0-contract-clarifications","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
