{"parentUuid":"5c3e5a09-fc2a-4c17-af21-be4f69e58331","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxTwDiZfBZBUgTLZ24ni","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The next set is moving, but the release has not been verified yet.\n\n- **PR #530 (docs):** open and ready for review. It's linked to trail #357 before its PR existed, so Entire opened it and I edited it. It marks the four internal Action inputs, lists `release pending` as plumbing, accepts ADR 12 (with an ADR 11 pointer), and adds a `--dry-run` row to `stability.md`. It changes no behavior. Per the agent, `doc-check`, `pre-push`, `lint` and `workflow-contracts` exit 0, and I re-ran `doc-check` after my added row.\n- **`--dry-run` investigation:** I took its recommendation, which is to document it and change nothing. It's accepted everywhere, does nothing on read-only commands, and `release plan` and similar reject it. Moving it to writing commands only would break scripts and tests for no real gain, so that's off the table.\n- **\"No pending changesets\" fix:** pushed on `fix/no-pending-changesets-message`, signed. It now skips the warning when a bump was inferred from commits. Before, `version --strict` exited 1 on a valid inferred plan, and now it exits 0. `docs/specs/versioning.json` VER-AGG-06 and two tests are updated. Its changeset is being drafted, and then I'll link and open its PR.\n  - **One test failed:** `just test` ended with a single failure in the agent's sandbox, a test that calls the real `cargo info` (network). It fails identically on `main`, so I'm treating it as an environment limit, but CI is the real check.\n  - **Agent slip:** its first repro script overwrote `Cargo.toml` and `callisto.toml` in its worktree because `mktemp` was denied. The pre-commit hook blocked the commit and it restored both files.\n- **Release 0.20.0:** I haven't confirmed it published. The Release workflow was queued when I last looked, and a `gh run watch` is running in the background. I'll verify tags, the GitHub release and its five assets when it finishes.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll report once the release is verified and the message-fix PR is open."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1361,"cache_read_input_tokens":777481,"output_tokens":704,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1361,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":704,"cache_read_input_tokens":777481,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1361,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1361},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"feafd4d1-000c-4214-9780-5ffcac3cae34","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxTwDMEfyKxgCHMCDhLZ","requestRef":"0985e11b-55bb-4a16-a5ac-a16fde4de286","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5607925e-baa4-487d-b089-7eb4667270b1","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:15:52.214Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3331bef90d4c2276","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"docs/1-0-contract-clarifications","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
