{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"c4dcb93e-3c04-4bfc-9a36-060a52c057a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxTxi8tLHw1RNexaj86e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019wDcfvfJfthCs9dZojC6WG","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d/.changeset/version-no-empty-warning-on-inferred-bump.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\n`callisto version` no longer says \"No pending changesets found in workspace\" when it has just planned a bump inferred from commits.\n\n- With `release-trigger = \"auto\"` and a `feat:` commit after the last tag but no changeset file, `version` printed the plan (for example `cargo/a` 0.1.0 to 0.2.0) and then warned there were no changesets, which contradicted the plan beside it. It now prints only the plan.\n- `version --strict` turned that warning into an error and exited 1 on a valid inferred plan. It now exits 0.\n- The JSON `diagnostics` array no longer carries the `empty-changeset` diagnostic when the bump was inferred from commits.\n- When there is nothing to release (no changesets and no inferred bumps), the warning still appears, and `--strict` still fails on it. `status` is unchanged.\n- You do not need to do anything, unless a script relied on that warning (or the `empty-changeset` diagnostic) to detect inferred bumps. Check the plan output instead.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4023,"cache_read_input_tokens":781350,"output_tokens":481,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4023,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":481,"cache_read_input_tokens":781350,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4023,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4023},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019wDcfvfJfthCs9dZojC6WG":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d/.changeset/version-no-empty-warning-on-inferred-bump.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\n`callisto version` no longer says \"No pending changesets found in workspace\" when it has just planned a bump inferred from commits.\n\n- With `release-trigger = \"auto\"` and a `feat:` commit after the last tag but no changeset file, `version` printed the plan (for example `cargo/a` 0.1.0 to 0.2.0) and then warned there were no changesets, which contradicted the plan beside it. It now prints only the plan.\n- `version --strict` turned that warning into an error and exited 1 on a valid inferred plan. It now exits 0.\n- The JSON `diagnostics` array no longer carries the `empty-changeset` diagnostic when the bump was inferred from commits.\n- When there is nothing to release (no changesets and no inferred bumps), the warning still appears, and `--strict` still fails on it. `status` is unchanged.\n- You do not need to do anything, unless a script relied on that warning (or the `empty-changeset` diagnostic) to detect inferred bumps. Check the plan output instead.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"5c5663ee-ab50-43da-b7c1-2b680f9a923c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxTxhq2JG9mwwsQZdoUC","requestRef":"3f442407-7677-42ae-ada2-5ec9d4ab8e88","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0cf4307b-59d7-40c7-958f-db6ae404b0b2","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:16:09.552Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projec