{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"85e9f666-b578-4429-82ae-38fc0825e610","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:17:43.329Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"061c200486ebc9b0312f567dd75bc581bc0a5e74fd96255fbb8887ebe6350a68","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"f7464f18-84cb-4d66-9894-0d8beec3dab4","keep":1078,"tail":["50b02d0366b7a89391edeef8ae08b107aec2b6a203d00a658e74cb6574c504c7","9c52e92efbdac4e9ed5c3cbfcf1f727dc7f1a54569c9f1fd6b87deb11e516251","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1080,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"75ed83669c95447d11e47f00fed6a89c7b0c99d37beac365fa8e123174685db6"}
{"parentUuid":"a028ae4d-fd56-48eb-a465-3bbbad340fd0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxU5qTcAGttoHDNmrGUF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Callisto 0.20.0 is published and checks out, and two follow-up PRs from the next set are open.\n\n**Release 0.20.0 verified**\n- **GitHub release:** `callisto@0.20.0` is Latest, not a draft or prerelease, with all 5 assets. Its notes are the layered text with the Breaking and Action lines.\n- **Tags:** all four exist on `origin` (`callisto@0.20.0`, `callisto-model@`, `callisto-graph@`, `callisto-manifests@`).\n- **crates.io:** `callisto-cli` and `callisto-model` report 0.20.0 as their latest version. I didn't check `callisto-graph` or `callisto-manifests` there.\n- **Not applicable:** `callisto-fixtures` isn't published, and the floating `v1` tag only starts at 1.0.0.\n\n**Next set, linked to trail #357 before their PRs existed** (Entire opened them, and I edited the title and body of each)\n- **#530 (docs):** marks the four Action inputs Internal, lists `release pending` as CI plumbing, accepts ADR 12 with a pointer in ADR 11, and adds a `--dry-run` row to `stability.md`. It changes no behavior.\n- **#531 (fix):** `callisto version` no longer warns \"No pending changesets\" next to a plan inferred from commits. `version --strict` used to exit 1 on that valid plan and now exits 0. It has a patch changeset and two tests. One test in the agent's sandbox failed because it calls the real `cargo info` (network), and it fails the same way on `main`, so CI is the real check.\n\nBoth are marked ready for review, with no CI run yet.\n\n**Decided with no PR:** `--dry-run` stays global. It's accepted everywhere, a no-op on read-only commands, and a usage error where it can't apply. Narrowing it would break scripts for no real gain, so #530 documents it.\n\n**Still open for later:** the E194 shared tag and title for fixed groups, OIDC trusted publishing (needs its own design pass), the first `v1` tag rehearsal, and the Caliper `Props<string>` fix (needs a session in that repo).\n\nneeds input: merge #530 and #531 when CI passes, and tell me which of the later items you want next."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":643,"cache_read_input_tokens":790687,"output_tokens":759,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":643,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":759,"cache_read_input_tokens":790687,"cache_creation_input_tokens":643,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":643},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ef0abcdd-de82-4d69-9138-421d2c3a29f0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxU5pzqCzWyiptBNjgu5","requestRef":"85e9f666-b578-4429-82ae-38fc0825e610","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"62694315-9e51-40a1-bc39-9f5a48a1d487","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:17:48.827Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
