{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"eadee796-f9f0-4c86-8586-ded2e7a03ceb","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:29:10.105Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"061c200486ebc9b0312f567dd75bc581bc0a5e74fd96255fbb8887ebe6350a68","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"b5ea540d-0d5b-49db-bee4-61b9f4d80668","keep":1149,"tail":["73d2d7e20992641f403142af351d42b494642dc133f28512f2568051bc8ba3fc","3fc3b55aa52d64abd3f66172f7a498ebe01196c2fee3287746915284c69cf909","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1151,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"56f5373fff4ff1c0a19f477099ba08e8e2204b48f9a567915c328ae6cb6a5d8e"}
{"parentUuid":"4c33b0a8-cf0a-4e9d-9984-b5bc79aa213b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxUxTbPRC18a27yUYPY8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The finding on change #139 (#531) is valid, and it's fixed and pushed. All three commits show `valid` on GitHub.\n\n- **Confirmed:** `inference_commits` is filled when a bump is inferred from commits, before the changesets are read. On a prerelease rerun, a recorded major changeset can override a minor inference and then be dropped by the \"already recorded in `pre.json`\" cleanup. That removes the bump but leaves `inference_commits` populated, so my guard suppressed the empty-plan warning and `--strict` succeeded with nothing to release.\n- **Test first:** I added `plan_version_recorded_changeset_overriding_an_inferred_bump_still_warns_nothing_pending`. On the old guard, `plan.bumps` was empty but the warning was missing, so the test failed.\n- **Fix:** the guard now asks whether an inferred bump survived aggregation (`named_by` still `Inference`), not whether an inference record exists. A changeset override or the recorded-only cleanup both clear that, so the warning returns correctly.\n- **Checks:** all 3 related tests pass, including the original two. `pre-push`, `lint`, `doc-check` and `workflow-contracts` exit 0. `just test` runs 2,585 passed and 1 failed. The one failure is `a_version_the_registry_serves_is_exact_with_no_checksum_or_yank_claim`, a `cargo info` output test that fails identically on `main`, so I'm treating it as environment-specific (CI is the real check).\n\nThe changeset text is unchanged and still accurate. I didn't edit #531's description, which says the warning is skipped when `agg.inference_commits` is non-empty. It's now slightly out of date, so I'll update it to say \"when an inferred bump survived\" if you want the PR text to match.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll update #531's body next unless you'd rather leave it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":239,"cache_read_input_tokens":817481,"output_tokens":627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":239,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":817481,"cache_creation_input_tokens":239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":239},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"22d6efcf-7b21-44a6-9c2b-1b3a58888e80","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxUxTHXQRJoAuoLdCwFP","requestRef":"eadee796-f9f0-4c86-8586-ded2e7a03ceb","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"53c2d2df-2f0a-43f6-8889-d2ecc76f85bd","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:29:14.906Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
