{"parentUuid":"36f720b6-5393-46db-b9de-47fc7ab5bebf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxV91WnZBYoT5sauyKm2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019UFHtbFqmhgeCRhiiHYbsK","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_nopending.md","old_string":"The warning is now skipped when a bump was inferred from commits (`agg.inference_commits` is non-empty).","new_string":"The warning is now skipped only when a bump inferred from commits survived aggregation (`named_by` is `Inference`), so a prerelease rerun whose inferred bump was overridden by an already-recorded changeset still warns that nothing is pending."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":362,"cache_read_input_tokens":819615,"output_tokens":286,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":42},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":362,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":286,"cache_read_input_tokens":819615,"cache_creation_input_tokens":362,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":362},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019UFHtbFqmhgeCRhiiHYbsK":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_nopending.md","old_string":"The warning is now skipped when a bump was inferred from commits (`agg.inference_commits` is non-empty).","new_string":"The warning is now skipped only when a bump inferred from commits survived aggregation (`named_by` is `Inference`), so a prerelease rerun whose inferred bump was overridden by an already-recorded changeset still warns that nothing is pending."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"7afe50d7-eeaf-4296-85b9-e7a92847b81c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgxV91Axc4syHcNYaqY9b","requestRef":"b6b18a1c-1c30-4462-bf8b-46cdf2e8c9ea","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2f7a8929-0988-4f25-8f47-8d8513242ccf","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:31:35.346Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"2f7a8929-0988-4f25-8f47-8d8513242ccf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"441c3284-fc70-43f5-a6c8-53f403bdde3b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019UFHtbFqmhgeCRhiiHYbsK","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_nopending.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"dc7f2f72-45c4-4a61-b7f7-6867cb75f57d","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:31:35.514Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_nopending.md","oldString":"The warning is now skipped when a bump was inferred from commits (`agg.inference_commits` is non-empty).","newString":"The warning is now skipped only when a bump inferred from commits survived aggregation (`named_by` is `Inference`), so a prerelease rerun whose inferred bump was overridden by an already-recorded changeset still warns that nothing is pending.","originalFile":"## Summary\n- With `release-trigger = \"auto\"` and a `feat:` commit after the last tag but no changeset file, `callisto version` printed the plan (for example `cargo/a` 0.1.0 to 0.2.0) and then warned \"No pending changesets found in workspace\", which contradicted the plan beside it. The warning is now skipped when a bump was inferred from commits (`agg.inference_commits` is non-empty). The diagnostic code and message are unchanged, and when there is truly nothing to release it still appears.\n- `version --strict` turned that spurious warning into an error and exited 1 on a valid inferred plan. It now exits 0.\n- The JSON `diagnostics` array no longer carries `empty-changeset` for an inferred bump. `status` already described the inferred bump correctly and is unchanged.\n- `docs/specs/versioning.json` VER-AGG-06 now reads \"no changeset is consumed and no bump is inferred from commits\". Two tests: `plan_version_inferred_bump_does_not_warn_no_pending_changesets` and `plan_version_nothing_to_release_warns_no_pending_changesets`.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/version-no-empty-warning-on-inferred-bump.md` (patch).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] `docs/specs/versioning.json` VER-AGG-06 reworded to match.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 in the agent's run. Reproduced with the real binary before and after (the warning and the `--strict` exit 1, then neither).\n- [ ] `just test` exited 100 in the agent's sandbox on one test, `a_version_the_registry_serves_is_exact_with_no_checksum_or_yank_claim`, which calls the real `cargo info` (network) and fails the same way on `main`. Everything else passed (1303 of 1304). CI is the real check.\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":5,"newStart":1,"newLines":5,"lines":[" ## Summary","-- With `release-trigger = \"auto\"` and a `feat:` commit after the last tag but no changeset file, `callisto version` printed the plan (for example `cargo/a` 0.1.0 to 0.2.0) and then warned \"No pending changesets found in workspace\", which contradicted the plan beside it. The warning is now skipped when a bump was inferred from commits (`agg.inference_commits` is non-empty). The diagnostic code and message are unchanged, and when there is truly nothing to release it still appears.","+- With `release-trigger = \"auto\"` and a `feat:` commit after the last tag but no changeset file, `callisto version` printed the plan (for example `cargo/a` 0.1.0 to 0.2.0) and then warned \"No pending changesets found in workspace\", which contradicted the plan beside it. The warning is now skipped only when a bump inferred from commits survived aggregation (`named_by` is `Inference`), so a prerelease rerun whose inferred bump was overridden by an already-recorded changeset still warns that nothing is pending. The diagnostic code and message are unchanged, and when there is truly nothing to release it still appears."," - `version --strict` turned that spurious warning into an error and exited 1 on a valid inferred plan. It now exits 0."," - The JSON `diagnostics` array no longer carries `empty-changeset` for an inferred bump. `status` already described the inferred bump correctly and is unchanged."," - `docs/specs/versioning.json` VER-AGG-06 now reads \"no changeset is consumed and no bump is inferred from commits\". Two tests: `plan_version_inferred_bump_does_not_warn_no_pending_changesets` and `plan_version_nothing_to_release_warns_no_pending_changesets`."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2f7a8929-0988-4f25-8f47-8d8513242ccf","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
