{"parentUuid":"6aa01df8-8361-4344-a42f-14f71f8bb529","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxV9uRxBoXFqfg5kjmVX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#531 has no merge conflict, and its description now matches the final guard. The `entire-shadow-pr` marker is still in the body, so Entire can still close the PR with its trail.\n\n- **Merge state:** GitHub says `MERGEABLE`, and a local merge test against current `main` was clean. `BLOCKED` is the Entire approval gate, not a conflict.\n- **Description:** it now says the warning is skipped only when an inferred bump survived aggregation, and that a prerelease rerun whose inferred bump was overridden by a recorded changeset still warns.\n\nI'm waiting on CI and your merge for #530 and #531, plus your pick for the next work (the OIDC or E194 decision brief, or the Caliper session).\n\nneeds input: merge #530 and #531 when CI passes, and say which brief to write next."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":340,"cache_read_input_tokens":820370,"output_tokens":270,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":340,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":270,"cache_read_input_tokens":820370,"cache_creation_input_tokens":340,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":340},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3ff5546e-42b3-4662-a168-95de68e67a6d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxV9u6NSJsMfKU7a1hYz","requestRef":"c306da3a-8528-43fd-8426-a71abef615f8","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assis