{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"077569aa-4701-495f-b03e-d2419cf12540","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:36:34.824Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"061c200486ebc9b0312f567dd75bc581bc0a5e74fd96255fbb8887ebe6350a68","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"92229a0d-484f-46a7-8fcb-d1f224f7bdd4","keep":1179,"tail":["a946ee98b39cbc516e9d2a07cb3621b8a49e3e21b654cd784284a1637bfb9387","350260ac0f22b5216dbbedac3a12e43bca579c1c5702e22c49cf427e32b3c1ad","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1181,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"bf0c17cd94b65997dc0208adbc1701503be9a20de6daed86f7835ce9c9fdaf4d"}
{"parentUuid":"29121c89-af53-42d6-8f27-e5c65a1257f9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxVXF7xTzd3upEMgWs4e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Mostly no, with two small gaps worth one tiny docs PR.\n\n**What I checked and found current**\n- **Stale references:** none in any `.md` or `docs/` file to anything removed this session.\n- **Already updated in their own PRs:** `stability.md`, `errors.md`, `config.md` and the specs.\n- **README:** doesn't describe exit codes, schema versions or report fields, so nothing to change.\n- **`wire-compat.md`:** mentions a hard-coded `schemaVersion: 2` for `release-pr` snapshots, which is a different schema from the one that moved to 3, so it's correct.\n\n**The two gaps**\n1. **`ARCHITECTURE.md` invariants.** Invariant 7 says errors carry a stable code. It doesn't yet say two things that are now enforced and worth one line each:\n   - **Exit classification:** a failure caused by a flag value exits 2 and everything else exits 1, decided per error type by `exit_kind()`, with runtime as the default.\n   - **Typed JSON reports:** every `--format json` report goes through the typed envelope (`emit_report`), and untyped JSON output is crate-private. This is #505's invariant and it isn't recorded anywhere.\n2. **`docs/specs/versioning.json` VER-APPLY-10.** It says `--emit-decision <path>` is \"relative to the workspace root\". After #528 the path must also be inside the workspace (E225/E226, exit 2), and the criterion should say so.\n\nNothing else needs touching: the architecture pages describe the release flow, not the CLI's error or output plumbing, and the AGENTS.md ladder already covers contributor guidance.\n\nI'd make both as one docs-only PR (about 5 lines), linked to trail #357 first.\n\nneeds input: say \"yes\" and I'll make that PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1708,"cache_read_input_tokens":824073,"output_tokens":606,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1708,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":606,"cache_read_input_tokens":824073,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1708,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1708},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0e069668-5ee6-4fa8-a92e-22787a288afe","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxVXEhfaPxVfejTwJQ47","requestRef":"077569aa-4701-495f-b03e-d2419cf12540","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"26147d42-3004-4843-9ce0-9d4c23ae1538","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:36:39.739Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
