rom [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/releases) (tag `callisto@<version>`):","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1b93f88c-cd33-4d2b-8aa6-50c70c160356","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","branch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e015b391-a424-455d-89ee-a11c49ec8bba","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"attachment":{"command":"","content":"","durationMs":47,"exitCode":0,"hookEvent":"","hookName":"","stderr":"","stdout":"","toolUseID":"","type":"hook_success"},"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"5de3da6a-a0db-4670-9050-211161accfe4","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:38:41.942Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"acb76d50-1c00-4e12-a847-d94408b4ec31","version":"2.1.311"}
{"parentUuid":"c6a3f440-8cff-4925-8608-bc5e419f6d8d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"53dc0921-d374-48f7-b8b9-94b668952236","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ELgdnWV8SLMrjTmUiZMVmA","type":"tool_result","content":"<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/brand/hero-dark.png\">\n    <img src=\"assets/brand/hero-light.png\" alt=\"callisto, an Orin DX tool\" width=\"360\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>Dependency-aware, changeset-driven versioning and releases for Cargo, npm, and PyPI monorepos.</b>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml\"><img src=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"CI\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT%20%2F%20FSL--1.1--MIT-blue.svg\" alt=\"License\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nCallisto turns per-package changesets into a version plan for Cargo, npm/pnpm, and Python/PyPI workspaces. It reads native manifests to decide which dependents need updates, then prepares the files and release operations for review.\n\n## A change through Callisto\n\nSuppose `service` depends on a Cargo crate `core` at `^0.2`. A contributor records a minor change to `core`:\n\n```sh\ncallisto add --package cargo/core:minor --summary \"Add streaming API\"\ncallisto version --dry-run\n```\n\nWith the default cascade policy, the plan is:\n\n| Package | Before | Planned change |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `core` | `0.2.0` | `0.3.0` from the changeset |\n| `service` | `1.4.2`, requires `core ^0.2` | `1.4.3` from the default patch cascade; requirement updated to `^0.3` |\n| Unrelated npm or Python package | Its current version | No bump just because it shares the repo |\n\nThe dependency requirement triggers the `service` bump; sharing a repo does not. Callisto does not infer arbitrary cross-language dependencies. Explicit version groups can couple packages that should move together.\n\n- `callisto version` updates affected manifests, lockfiles, and changelogs for review and commit.\n- The release workflow uses native publishers and coordinates configured tags, GitHub releases, and assets. Package owners retain their hooks and credentials.\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'flowchart': {'curve': 'basis', 'nodeSpacing': 40, 'rankSpacing': 56}, 'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif', 'fontSize': '14px', 'lineColor': '#94a3b8', 'edgeLabelBackground': '#ffffff'}}}%%\nflowchart LR\n    classDef source fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1e1b4b,rx:10px,ry:10px,font-weight:600;\n    classDef store fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0f172a,rx:10px,ry:10px;\n    classDef engine fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#8b5cf6,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4c1d95,rx:10px,ry:10px;\n    classDef router fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#78350f,rx:10px,ry:10px,font-weight:600;\n    classDef output fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#064e3b,rx:10px,ry:10px,font-weight:600;\n\n    changesets[\"<b>Changesets</b><br/>release intent\"] --> plan[\"<b>Version plan</b><br/>dependency-aware\"]\n    manifests[(\"<b>Native manifests</b><br/>Cargo · npm/pnpm · Python\")] --> plan\n    plan --> updates[\"<b>Version updates</b><br/>manifests · changelogs · lockfiles\"]\n    updates --> review{{\"<b>Review and commit</b><br/>versioned state\"}}\n    review --> release[\"<b>Release</b><br/>configured operations\"]\n    release --> outputs([\"Packages · tags · GitHub releases\"])\n\n    class changesets source\n    class manifests store","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b2bb4c3c-cf8a-4d4c-92b1-62056b75de04","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:38:41.971Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/brand/hero-dark.png\">\n    <img src=\"assets/brand/hero-light.png\" alt=\"callisto, an Orin DX tool\" width=\"360\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>Dependency-aware, changeset-driven versioning and releases for Cargo, npm, and PyPI monorepos.</b>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml\"><img src=\"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/actions/workflows/callisto-ci.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"CI\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT%20%2F%20FSL--1.1--MIT-blue.svg\" alt=\"License\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nCallisto turns per-package changesets into a version plan for Cargo, npm/pnpm, and Python/PyPI workspaces. It reads native manifests to decide which dependents need updates, then prepares the files and release operations for review.\n\n## A change through Callisto\n\nSuppose `service` depends on a Cargo crate `core` at `^0.2`. A contributor records a minor change to `core`:\n\n```sh\ncallisto add --package cargo/core:minor --summary \"Add streaming API\"\ncallisto version --dry-run\n```\n\nWith the default cascade policy, the plan is:\n\n| Package | Before | Planned change |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `core` | `0.2.0` | `0.3.0` from the changeset |\n| `service` | `1.4.2`, requires `core ^0.2` | `1.4.3` from the default patch cascade; requirement updated to `^0.3` |\n| Unrelated npm or Python package | Its current version | No bump just because it shares the repo |\n\nThe dependency requirement triggers the `service` bump; sharing a repo does not. Callisto does not infer arbitrary cross-language dependencies. Explicit version groups can couple packages that should move together.\n\n- `callisto version` updates affected manifests, lockfiles, and changelogs for review and commit.\n- The release workflow uses native publishers and coordinates configured tags, GitHub releases, and assets. Package owners retain their hooks and credentials.\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'flowchart': {'curve': 'basis', 'nodeSpacing': 40, 'rankSpacing': 56}, 'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif', 'fontSize': '14px', 'lineColor': '#94a3b8', 'edgeLabelBackground': '#ffffff'}}}%%\nflowchart LR\n    classDef source fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1e1b4b,rx:10px,ry:10px,font-weight:600;\n    classDef store fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0f172a,rx:10px,ry:10px;\n    classDef engine fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#8b5cf6,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4c1d95,rx:10px,ry:10px;\n    classDef router fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#78350f,rx:10px,ry:10px,font-weight:600;\n    classDef output fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#064e3b,rx:10px,ry:10px,font-weight:600;\n\n    changesets[\"<b>Changesets</b><br/>release intent\"] --> plan[\"<b>Version plan</b><br/>dependency-aware\"]\n    manifests[(\"<b>Native manifests</b><br/>Cargo · npm/pnpm · Python\")] --> plan\n    plan --> updates[\"<b>Version updates</b><br/>manifests · changelogs · lockfiles\"]\n    updates --> review{{\"<b>Review and commit</b><br/>versioned state\"}}\n    review --> release[\"<b>Release</b><br/>configured operations\"]\n    release --> outputs([\"Packages · tags · GitHub releases\"])\n\n    class changesets source\n    class manifests store","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1b93f88c-cd33-4d2b-8aa6-50c70c160356","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","branch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":