{"attachment":{"command":"","content":"","durationMs":41,"exitCode":0,"hookEvent":"","hookName":"","stderr":"","stdout":"","toolUseID":"","type":"hook_success"},"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"docs/catch-up-with-0-20","isSidechain":false,"parentUuid":"08e21525-9cde-4bf7-860d-617cab700a9a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:47:48.508Z","type":"attachment","userType":"external","uuid":"a93eee46-cb3e-4dfd-b23e-9dbea1ecdc20","version":"2.1.311"}
{"parentUuid":"1af030ce-735b-4d94-927f-4cca5cee4bc2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5c9a5cae-3f13-45ff-beb4-ab43bbf076d6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WvkYuKQSAgSeN6hTY3uKDq","type":"tool_result","content":"+## What you get\n+\n+- **Ecosystems:** Cargo, npm, and Python/PyPI. npm packages publish with npm, pnpm, yarn or bun, whichever the workspace uses; Python packages need a static PEP 621 or Poetry version and are built with `python -m build` and uploaded with Twine ([support](docs/how-callisto-works.md#current-support), [credentials](docs/publishing.md)).\n+- **Native-extension packages:** napi-rs platform packages take their owner's version, the generated workflow builds each `napi.targets` addon, and platform packages publish before the owner. Maturin gets no generated workflow, and Cargo plus maturin in one directory fails with E007 ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#platform-package-publish-order)).\n+- **Tags:** one per package, `{name}@{version}`, or `ecosystem/name@{version}` when another ecosystem has a package of that name; `tag-template` overrides it ([stability](docs/stability.md), [config](docs/config.md)).\n+- **GitHub releases:** notes come from the package's changelog section, and the product package's release carries your binary assets ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#generated-workflows)).\n+- **Supply chain:** the generated build workflow attests each Cargo binary asset with GitHub build provenance, and `release execute` checks its SHA-256 and runs `gh attestation verify` before uploading it; the receipt records each asset's size and SHA-256. npm provenance is on when the publishing job sets `NPM_CONFIG_PROVENANCE` ([publishing](docs/publishing.md#provenance)).\n+- **Release PR:** one PR, rebuilt on every push to the default branch, holds the versions, changelogs and a \"Merging will publish\" plan. Merging it is the approval ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#release-pr-and-approval)).\n+- **Safe reruns:** a failed release can be rerun; versions, tags and releases that already landed are adopted, not repeated, and a receipt is written only when every operation succeeded ([publication checks](docs/releasing.md#publication-checks)).\n+- **Scripting:** every command accepts `--dry-run`, `--format json` reports carry a `schemaVersion`, and a bad flag value exits 2 ([stability](docs/stability.md)).\n+","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8fd38c40-9a74-4c7e-a31e-bc759e7d3b7f","timestamp":"2026-11-12T05:47:48.515Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"+## What you get\n+\n+- **Ecosystems:** Cargo, npm, and Python/PyPI. npm packages publish with npm, pnpm, yarn or bun, whichever the workspace uses; Python packages need a static PEP 621 or Poetry version and are built with `python -m build` and uploaded with Twine ([support](docs/how-callisto-works.md#current-support), [credentials](docs/publishing.md)).\n+- **Native-extension packages:** napi-rs platform packages take their owner's version, the generated workflow builds each `napi.targets` addon, and platform packages publish before the owner. Maturin gets no generated workflow, and Cargo plus maturin in one directory fails with E007 ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#platform-package-publish-order)).\n+- **Tags:** one per package, `{name}@{version}`, or `ecosystem/name@{version}` when another ecosystem has a package of that name; `tag-template` overrides it ([stability](docs/stability.md), [config](docs/config.md)).\n+- **GitHub releases:** notes come from the package's changelog section, and the product package's release carries your binary assets ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#generated-workflows)).\n+- **Supply chain:** the generated build workflow attests each Cargo binary asset with GitHub build provenance, and `release execute` checks its SHA-256 and runs `gh attestation verify` before uploading it; the receipt records each asset's size and SHA-256. npm provenance is on when the publishing job sets `NPM_CONFIG_PROVENANCE` ([publishing](docs/publishing.md#provenance)).\n+- **Release PR:** one PR, rebuilt on every push to the default branch, holds the versions, changelogs and a \"Merging will publish\" plan. Merging it is the approval ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#release-pr-and-approval)).\n+- **Safe reruns:** a failed release can be rerun; versions, tags and releases that already landed are adopted, not repeated, and a receipt is written only when every operation succeeded ([publication checks](docs/releasing.md#publication-checks)).\n+- **Scripting:** every command accepts `--dry-run`, `--format json` reports carry a `schemaVersion`, and a bad flag value exits 2 ([stability](docs/stability.md)).\n+","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c4863565-3a1f-480e-a41b-73e72e86c389","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","branch":"fix/no-pending-changesets-message","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1af030ce-735b-4d94-927f-4cca5cee4bc2","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff