{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"2a3cc54d-c09a-45b8-b067-bd0f866d79a9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgxc9oWKcAj7Xd1Y1x64o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Work continues on three fronts.\n\n- **Merged:** #530, #531 and #532. Cleaned up their worktrees and branches, with nothing unpushed lost.\n- **Regression hunt running (bug-hunter, Sonnet, read-only):** it attacks the 0.20 code with real-user inputs. The areas are:\n  - the new unscoped `changed.rs` diff with globset (nested packages, odd directory names, renames, a workspace in a subdirectory);\n  - the decision-path containment, including symlinks;\n  - `object_at`;\n  - `exit_kind()` against `stability.md` for 20 random error codes;\n  - the Python requirement fix;\n  - the \"No pending changesets\" guard with groups, prereleases and `--strict`;\n  - `add`'s duplicate handling and did-you-mean.\n  \n  It reports only defects it can demonstrate.\n- **Release PR #533:** the patch release carrying the #531 fix (and the docs PRs, which have no changesets). It's open and not draft, waiting on CI approval and your merge. I'll read its rendered body once the hunt is done, in case a fix needs to land first, because merging anything before #533 changes it.\n- **The `cargo info` test** that fails locally is environmental (`CommandFailed` with no local registry tools), not a time bomb. I'm leaving it.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll bring back the hunt's findings, verified, before anything is fixed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3109,"cache_read_input_tokens":892582,"output_tokens":478,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3109,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens