{"parentUuid":"672f1fb0-3b54-4773-99bd-33e433276c6c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxcTNMyvY9ug68Z2Y8CX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"E194 is settled: we keep the `init` guard and its help as they are and add nothing. I saved the decision to Brain with its reasoning, so it won't be re-litigated by accident. The reasoning is that a release-title key and a shared group tag each add permanent surface at 1.0, and sharing one tag changes tag identity (ADR 9) and release ownership (ADR 12). Revisit a release-title template only when a real adopter needs it.\n\nStill running: the regression hunt on the 0.20 code. Release PR #533 is waiting on CI approval and your merge, and I'll read its body after the hunt reports, in case a fix needs to land first.\n\nStill open on your side: the two OIDC decisions (the `execute` permission and the generated-workflow shape). They aren't urgent, since OIDC is targeted after v1.\n\nneeds input: none right now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":900386,"output_tokens":278,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":587,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":278,"cache_read_input_tokens":900386,"cache_creation_input_tokens":587,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":587},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8b0b98d8-5458-4cc6-ac3d-5d7151be52f6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxcTMuDAfsYbQ4mts2KT","requestRef":"e6424eb5-9287-4286-ae58-75be04a8727a","request