{"parentUuid":"bd11c9f1-9977-49f4-9b24-8a5a4b44793a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxdacMfm8LTmhhZzy4d6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y3YsdMSmnvP9oK5mYeWvbJ","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Changesets for parser and decision-target fixes","subagent_type":"courier:changeset-analyzer","model":"sonnet","effort":"medium","run_in_background":"true","prompt":"Produce TWO separate changeset files for orin-dx/callisto (one per user-visible outcome). Diffs (run from /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d; do not cd elsewhere; `git fetch origin` first): (1) `git diff origin/main...origin/fix/python-parenthesized-requirements` and (2) `git diff origin/main...origin/fix/validate-decision-target-before-apply`. First list the unreleased `.changeset/` files on origin/main (`git ls-tree --name-only origin/main .changeset/`) and fold in only if the SAME outcome already exists.\nFACTS (1): a Python dependency written in the legacy PEP 508 parenthesized form `name (==1.0.0)` was not recognized as a dependency, so bumping that dependency did not cascade to the dependent and its pin was not rewritten (the same pin written `name==1.0.0` worked). Now the name ends at whitespace, `(`, `[`, `@`, `,` or an operator, the dependent is patch-released and the pin becomes `name (==2.0.0)` keeping the parentheses. Also: a requirement of the form `name[extra] @ https://...` is parsed with the URL kept out of the extras. Patch-level fix; front matter `callisto-cli: patch`.\nFACTS (2): `callisto version --emit-decision <path>` only checked the SHAPE of the path before it changed anything and wrote the file at the end, so a path that resolved to a directory or the workspace root (`.changeset`, `.`, the root), a trailing-slash path, a path inside `.git`, or a relative path through an in-workspace symlink pointing outside the workspace either failed late with 'Is a directory' (E213, rc 1) after bumping and staging manifests and deleting changesets, leaving the workspace half-versioned (a rerun then failed with E121), or wrote outside the workspace (the symlink case). Now one shared check (also used by `release plan --decision` and `release pending --decision`) rejects them BEFORE anything changes: outside the workspace is E225, the root, an existing directory, a trailing separator, anything under `.git` and an unresolvable path are E226, all exit 2 with nothing written. A new file under directories that do not exist yet still works. Front matter `callisto-cli: patch` (this tightens a check introduced in the unreleased 0.20.0 follow-up; decide whether it should instead be folded into the existing unreleased `contain-decision-paths` entry if that file is still unreleased on origin/main, and say which).\nStyle: say what changed, why it matters, what to do (nothing, unless a script relied on the old behavior); lead line, short bullets only where they add something, plain language, no AI slop, one line per paragraph. Return the two files as ready-to-write text with kebab-case names, plus changeset@3 JSON for each. Do not write files."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5880,"cache_read_input_tokens":925223,"output_tokens":1588,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":424},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5880,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1588,"cache_read_input_tokens":925223,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5880,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5880},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wir