{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"eb250743-13cb-4ac6-9bf0-5d8eafa47038","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:22:26.915Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"061c200486ebc9b0312f567dd75bc581bc0a5e74fd96255fbb8887ebe6350a68","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"a4f0bdba-fd14-4528-9b32-4f089de2d778","keep":1331,"tail":["70f1496dfab93ad274ee4a94b72ff69f53ef1890eb5e927a2c6ad2f374014fd4","5bd67bc5fba2e8ff32db7c41b3a8ecdd2f84465b3883f456dc4162103a506241","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1333,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"87c02df8059166c5e09938bd28fc78be052db0608d2048ee7e2c97fb40e636a0"}
{"parentUuid":"c8648e1f-17c7-4792-ab41-d215165da66e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxdbUtyqPkbKhd5ogKnj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two of the three fixes are ready, and the third is still running.\n\n**Parenthesized Python requirements** (`fix/python-parenthesized-requirements`, one signed commit)\n- **Reproduced:** with `app` pinning `lib-py (==0.1.0)`, bumping `lib-py` to 0.2.0 left `app` unchanged. Now `app` is patch-released and the pin becomes `lib-py (==0.2.0)`, keeping the parentheses.\n- **Parser:** the name now ends at whitespace, `(`, `[`, `@`, `,` or an operator. A `Requirement` gains a `parenthesized` flag so rewrites keep the user's form, and `name[extra] @ url` keeps the URL out of the extras.\n- **No new dependency:** no crate in `Cargo.lock` parses PEP 508 requirements (`pep440_rs` only handles version specifiers), so it extended the hand parser.\n- **Safety:** the `;` marker split still comes first. The proptest passes at 20,000 cases and it caught and fixed a `\"(\"` edge case along the way.\n\n**Decision-target validation** (`fix/validate-decision-target-before-apply`, two signed commits)\n- **One shared helper** for `version --emit-decision`, `release plan --decision` and `release pending --decision` now rejects a bad target before anything changes. A path outside the workspace gets E225. The root, an existing directory, a trailing separator, anything under `.git`, and an unresolvable path get E226. All exit 2 with nothing written.\n- **Symlinks:** a relative path through an in-workspace symlink to the outside is now caught.\n- **Tests:** before the fix, 3 of the 4 reject tests failed (directory/root, `out/` and `.git`, and the symlink escape). The fourth, a valid relative path under new directories, passed before and after as the guard.\n- **One unplanned edit:** an existing test relied on a file-as-parent failing late. I accept the change: it now uses a read-only directory and is unix-only.\n\nBoth agents report `pre-push`, `lint`, `doc-check` and `workflow-contracts` at 0. `just test` ends with only the known environment failure.\n\n**Still running:**\n- **Subdirectory siblings:** the `--relative` fix for the release-commit shape check and the E121 guard, plus a sweep of every other git call.\n- **Changesets:** the courier agent is writing them for the two finished branches.\n\nThen I'll link each branch to trail #357, open its PR and edit the body, as I did before.\n\nneeds input: none."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2001,"cache_read_input_tokens":931103,"output_tokens":852,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2001,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":852,"cache_read_input_tokens":931103,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2001,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2001},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5d335d0d-7201-4413-9cbe-cf6df2fbdda2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxdbUXQHkzsvqU7u78x1","requestRef":"eb250743-13cb-4ac6-9bf0-5d8eafa47038","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e19eb270-c246-40e4-9876-6eac43b0f726","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:22:32.936Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-acb69fdff4fb3419d","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/n