{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"2f3bb53d-6496-4687-a7dc-8e18020b9e37","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxdgmjQEr16yR2B8yeJC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011d3zE79mEGU47CfdKvHtqX","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a60b96e3da64503b6/.changeset/validate-decision-target-before-apply.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\n`callisto version --emit-decision <path>` now rejects a bad path before it changes anything, instead of failing after the workspace is already half-versioned.\n\n- Before, only the shape of the path was checked up front, and the file was written at the end. A path that was a directory or the workspace root (`.changeset`, `.`, the root), had a trailing slash, or was inside `.git` failed late with `E213` (\"Is a directory\", exit 1). By then manifests were bumped and staged and changesets deleted, and a rerun failed with `E121`.\n- A relative path through an in-workspace symlink that points outside the workspace wrote the file outside the workspace.\n- Now one check runs first, and it also covers `release plan --decision` and `release pending --decision`. All rejections exit 2 with nothing written:\n  - `E225`: the path resolves outside the workspace.\n  - `E226`: the workspace root, an existing directory, a trailing separator, anything under `.git`, or a path that cannot be resolved.\n- A new file under directories that do not exist yet still works.\n- If a script expected the late `E213` (exit 1) for these paths, expect `E225` or `E226` with exit 2 instead, and nothing is changed.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3633,"cache_read_input_tokens":943300,"output_tokens":535,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3633,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":535,"cache_read_input_tokens":943300,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3633,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3633},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_011d3zE79mEGU47CfdKvHtqX":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a60b96e3da64503b6/.changeset/validate-decision-target-before-apply.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\n`callisto version --emit-decision <path>` now rejects a bad path before it changes anything, instead of failing after the workspace is already half-versioned.\n\n- Before, only the shape of the path was checked up front, and the file was written at the end. A path that was a directory or the workspace root (`.changeset`, `.`, the root), had a trailing slash, or was inside `.git` failed late with `E213` (\"Is a directory\", exit 1). By then manifests were bumped and staged and changesets deleted, and a rerun failed with `E121`.\n- A relative path through an in-workspace symlink that points outside the workspace wrote the file outside the workspace.\n- Now one check runs first, and it also covers `release plan --decision` and `release pending --decision`. All rejections exit 2 with nothing written:\n  - `E225`: the path resolves outside the workspace.\n  - `E226`: the workspace root, an existing directory, a trailing separator, anything under `.git`, or a path that cannot be resolved.\n- A new file under directories that do not exist yet still works.\n- If a script expected the late `E213` (exit 1) for these paths, expect `E225` or `E226` with exit 2 instead, and nothing is changed.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b37552aa-dc5c-452a-a650-a1513ab00304","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxdgmN5LvqSW5AEuZSQh","requestRef":"2f326fad-8964-4645-a5b5-974ad888723c","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0eaa8424-3e62-431f-bd80-57125b804117","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:23:41.931Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a60b96e3da64503b6","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/validate-decision-target-before-apply","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
