type":"assistant","uuid":"38ca6ec4-5377-4e29-bc56-037409931f1a","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:24:27.601Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a60b96e3da64503b6","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"38ca6ec4-5377-4e29-bc56-037409931f1a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ff9399f1-0b5a-41e5-884a-19d01d4bdf02","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AdbyzGTyP1TGz7CngmeUzn","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_decision_target.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"bb96cb19-8724-4da3-9b50-3a238130c377","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:24:28.002Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_decision_target.md","oldString":"- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `just test`-minus-one and `just workflow-contracts` as below","newString":"- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0","originalFile":"## Summary\n- `callisto version --emit-decision <path>` checked only the shape of the path (the helper added in #528) but wrote the file after the plan was applied. A path that resolved to a directory or the workspace root (`.changeset`, `.`, the root) bumped and staged manifests and deleted changesets, then failed with E213 \"Is a directory\" (exit 1), leaving the workspace half-versioned, and a rerun then failed with E121. A relative path through an in-workspace symlink to the outside wrote outside the workspace, while the absolute spelling was rejected.\n- `workspace_decision_path` in `crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/release.rs` is now the one check shared by `version --emit-decision`, `release plan --decision` and `release pending --decision`. It resolves relative paths against the workspace root, canonicalizes through the nearest existing ancestor (following symlinks), and rejects before anything changes: a path outside the root is E225; the root itself, an existing directory, a trailing separator, anything under `.git`, and an unresolvable path such as `missing/..` are E226. All exit 2 with nothing written. No new error code.\n- A new file under directories that do not exist yet still works, as does the release PR action's workspace-relative `--emit-decision \"$INPUT_DECISION_PATH\"`.\n- One existing test, `partial_run_tests::decision_write_failure_leaves_staged_evidence...`, relied on a file-as-parent failing late, which is now rejected early. It now uses a read-only (0o555) directory and is unix-only.\n- Found by a regression hunt after 0.20.0.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/validate-decision-target-before-apply.md` (patch).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None apply: `docs/specs/release.json` and `docs/stability.md` already describe the decision path as workspace-relative.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `just test`-minus-one and `just workflow-contracts` as below\n- [x] Real-binary tests in `usage_exit_codes_tests.rs` for the directory and root, trailing-slash, `.git`, `missing/..` and symlink-escape spellings, each asserting exit 2, the error code, and that `Cargo.toml` and `.changeset` are untouched. Before the fix, three of the four reject tests failed; the fourth (a valid relative path under new directories) passes before and after as the guard.\n- [ ] `just test` exits 100 in the agent's sandbox on one test, `a_version_the_registry_serves_is_exact_with_no_checksum_or_yank_claim`, which needs the registry test tools CI installs and fails the same way on `main`. Everything else passed.\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":15,"oldLines":7,"newStart":15,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - [x] None apply: `docs/specs/release.json` and `docs/stability.md` already describe the decision path as workspace-relative."," "," ## Test Plan","-- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `just test`-minus-one and `just workflow-contracts` as below","+- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0"," - [x] Real-binary tests in `usage_exit_codes_tests.rs` for the directory and root, trailing-slash, `.git`, `missing/..` and symlink-escape spellings, each asserting exit 2, the error code, and that `Cargo.toml` and `.changeset` are untouched. Before the fix, three of the four reject tests failed; the fourth (a valid relative path under new directories) passes before and after as the guard."," - [ ] `just test` exits 100 in the agent's sandbox on one test, `a_version_the_registry_serves_is_exact_with_no_checksum_or_yank_claim`, which needs the registry test tools CI installs and fails the same way on `main`. Everything else passed."," - [ ] Not run: CI"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"38ca6ec4-5377-4e29-bc56-037409931f1a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a60b96e3da64503b6","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
