{"parentUuid":"9091e492-01ea-480d-bfa5-c77e1a5aeca6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgxdndg8A9ECKMwaPWqok","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two more PRs are open and ready for review, and every commit on them shows `valid` on GitHub.\n\n- **#534: parenthesized Python requirements.** `name (==1.0.0)` is now a recognized dependency, so a bump cascades to the dependent and the pin is rewritten as `name (==2.0.0)` with its parentheses kept. `name[extra] @ url` no longer lets the URL leak into the extras. It has a patch changeset, an end-to-end test that failed before the fix, and a proptest passing at 20,000 cases.\n- **#535: validate the decision path before `version` changes anything.** A path that is a directory, the root, a trailing-slash path, under `.git`, or reached through an in-workspace symlink to the outside is now rejected up front with E225 or E226 at exit 2, with nothing written. Three of the four new reject tests failed before the fix. It changes one existing test (read-only-directory failure instead of file-as-parent), noted in the PR. It has a patch changeset.\n\nBoth are linked to trail #357 and show the checks as exit 0 per the agents. `just test` has the one known environment failure (the `cargo info` test, which needs registry tools CI installs), and CI hasn't run yet.\n\nThe release PR #533 will include both fixes' changesets, along with #531's, as patches. That's a lot for a 0.20.1, so I'd wait for the third fix before merging it.\n\nStill running: the subdirectory-workspace siblings (`--relative` in the release-commit shape check and the E121 guard), plus the git-call sweep. Then everything lands in 0.20.1.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll bring back the third fix when it finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_read_input_tokens":952432,"output_tokens":551,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":551,"cache_read_input_tokens":952432,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"59d810c0-2aca-46ad-b48c-921b3b3968e5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgxdndKnth76BAUncMedi","requestRef":"2cbc2a85-0382-4696-af97-436f7e594629","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ba8ed1e0-01de-4113-a9f3-216951f19d00","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:25:03.075Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a60b96e3da64503b6","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
