{"parentUuid":"544fa622-952b-4168-b847-8a01f260dad9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"51bf2e4a-aaab-45ba-a926-376f645f0712","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C1K2kXhWqPNUiFke12vp9g","type":"tool_result","content":"### Limits\n\n- Cargo, npm and PyPI only. `nuget` is accepted in `publish-to`, but there is no NuGet publisher or package discovery ([config](docs/config.md#registries)).\n- Dependencies across languages are not inferred; use groups to move packages together ([guide](docs/how-callisto-works.md#current-support)).\n- Python versions must be static (PEP 621) or Poetry. Maturin gets no generated workflow, and Cargo plus maturin in one directory fails with E007 ([publishing](docs/publishing.md#current-python-suppor\n- Generated workflows are GitHub Actions only, and build only Cargo binaries and napi addons; other products need a manual workflow ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#generated-workflows)).\n- A bump inferred from commits shows in `status` and `version`, but the release PR reads changesets only, so add a changeset to release it ([spec](docs/specs/cli.json)).\n- A release across several registries is not atomic ([guide](docs/how-callisto-works.md#current-support)).\n- Registry credentials are tokens passed to the native tools. OIDC trusted publishing is planned, not built ([plan](docs/projects/OIDC-TRUSTED-PUBLISHING.md)).\n- Windows is not supported ([stability](docs/stability.md)).\n\n## Install","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9cf18ad9-4801-4c87-a393-0b1d85a31cc1","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:29:28.931Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"### Limits\n\n- Cargo, npm and PyPI only. `nuget` is accepted in `publish-to`, but there is no NuGet publisher or package discovery ([config](docs/config.md#registries)).\n- Dependencies across languages are not inferred; use groups to move packages together ([guide](docs/how-callisto-works.md#current-support)).\n- Python versions must be static (PEP 621) or Poetry. Maturin gets no generated workflow, and Cargo plus maturin in one directory fails with E007 ([publishing](docs/publishing.md#current-python-suppor\n- Generated workflows are GitHub Actions only, and build only Cargo binaries and napi addons; other products need a manual workflow ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#generated-workflows)).\n- A bump inferred from commits shows in `status` and `version`, but the release PR reads changesets only, so add a changeset to release it ([spec](docs/specs/cli.json)).\n- A release across several registries is not atomic ([guide](docs/how-callisto-works.md#current-support)).\n- Registry credentials are tokens passed to the native tools. OIDC trusted publishing is planned, not built ([plan](docs/projects/OIDC-TRUSTED-PUBLISHING.md)).\n- Windows is not supported ([stability](docs/stability.md)).\n\n## Install","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"00a6a6db-539b-4235-af1c-767879b0a912","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","branch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"544fa622-952b-4168-b847-8a01f260dad9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"sessio