{"parentUuid":"e63e7a86-c92b-40e0-b8ab-7b3a1d118779","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"51bf2e4a-aaab-45ba-a926-376f645f0712","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FPuU93VTqxc6ymKL1LwYUN","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a/.changeset/subdir-workspace-interrupted-version-and-release-commit.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"d03b7c67-2a9b-432d-abd9-7f8ede8ce4e1","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:29:36.387Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a/.changeset/subdir-workspace-interrupted-version-and-release-commit.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nFixes two checks that misbehaved when the Callisto workspace is a subdirectory of the git repository (`repo/ws`). Both compared repository-relative git paths with workspace-relative ones.\n\n- `callisto version` now refuses to run again with E121 (exit 1) after an interrupted run. If a first `version` staged a bump and you then restored the working tree to HEAD, the second run used to exit 0 with a misleading \"No pending changesets\" warning. This matches the behavior when the workspace is at the repository root.\n- `callisto release plan --from-release-commit` no longer fails with E165 \"release-decision file was not written by this commit\" for a valid release commit. Edits outside the workspace are still refused.\n- That command still cannot succeed from a subdirectory workspace. `release` requires the repository root to be the workspace root (E170), and it now reports E170 instead of the misleading E165.\n- You do not need to do anything, unless you hit either problem. If you want to release, move the workspace to the repository root.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e63e7a86-c92b-40e0-b8ab-7b3a1d118779","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
