{"parentUuid":"30b6a82d-96d2-4fee-8ac5-7b209a2fb183","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"51bf2e4a-aaab-45ba-a926-376f645f0712","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jp9mxp42s2gUYcnm4a9rbX","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a/README.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"22650e18-e0c6-4c79-b163-c6990aae6975","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:29:36.587Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a/README.md","oldString":"- Windows is not supported ([stability](docs/stability.md)).","newString":"- `release` requires the workspace to be at the repository root; `status` and `version` also work in a subdirectory ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#local-release-callisto-release)).\n- Windows is not supported ([stability](docs/stability.md)).","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":124,"oldLines":6,"newStart":124,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - A bump inferred from commits shows in `status` and `version`, but the release PR reads changesets only, so add a changeset to release it ([spec](docs/specs/cli.json))."," - A release across several registries is not atomic ([guide](docs/how-callisto-works.md#current-support))."," - Registry credentials are tokens passed to the native tools. OIDC trusted publishing is planned, not built ([plan](docs/projects/OIDC-TRUSTED-PUBLISHING.md)).","+- `release` requires the workspace to be at the repository root; `status` and `version` also work in a subdirectory ([releasing](docs/releasing.md#local-release-callisto-release))."," - Windows is not supported ([stability](docs/stability.md))."," "," ## Install"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"30b6a82d-96d2-4fee-8ac5-7b209a2fb183","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
