{"parentUuid":"0ec77d45-c9e7-4976-85c8-91e6663b34c3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"51bf2e4a-aaab-45ba-a926-376f645f0712","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xca4g5awkrRPE52fx67dSM","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a/docs/releasing.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"a0cc7ca3-da18-4b28-ac17-fafdddee29f9","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:29:36.783Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a/docs/releasing.md","oldString":"- It prints `Nothing to release.` and exits 0","newString":"- It requires the git repository root to be the workspace root; a workspace in a subdirectory fails with `E170`.\n- It prints `Nothing to release.` and exits 0","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":6,"newStart":13,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - `callisto release --dry-run` prints the plan and performs no effect. It works anywhere, including on a dirty worktree or without an `origin` remote (tags are then noted as unbound)."," - `--package <ecosystem/name>` (repeatable) restricts the run to named unreleased packages, all distributions of each (naming `npm/dual` also releases `cargo/dual`), plus every member of their fixed or linked groups. An unreleased workspace package that a selected one depends on (runtime, optional, or peer) must be selected too."," - It refuses a dirty worktree: a tracked modification or an untracked file not covered by `.gitignore`. Ignored files never count.","+- It requires the git repository root to be the workspace root; a workspace in a subdirectory fails with `E170`."," - It prints `Nothing to release.` and exits 0 when every package is already tagged."," - It prints a summary. With `--receipt <file>` it also writes the receipt there, only when every selected operation succeeded. An existing tag can exclude unfinished work before those operations are selected; see the retry limit below."," - A workspace with artifact slots or napi platform packages must release through CI. See the generated workflow below."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0ec77d45-c9e7-4976-85c8-91e6663b34c3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
