{"parentUuid":"b0a8474e-8773-440f-a896-144425aee101","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgxeE81eucgWAnqyidvhH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #536 is open and ready for review. All three commits show `valid` signatures on GitHub. It fixes the two subdirectory-workspace git-path bugs and documents the limit that `release` needs the workspace at the repository root.\n\n- **Checks run:** `just doc-check` and `just lint` exited 0. The earlier `just test` run failed only `a_version_the_registry_serves_is_exact_with_no_checksum_or_yank_claim`, which needs registry tools the sandbox lacks and fails the same way on `main`. CI has not run yet.\n- **Not run on the final commit:** `just pre-push` and `just workflow-contracts` were not re-run after the docs-only commit.\n- **Where:** branch `fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths`, linked to trail #357. The PR body has no session link, per your standing rule.\n- **Your action:** CI approval and the Entire Gates approval are needed to merge. Release PR #533, which now includes #531, #534 and #535, should be re-read before it merges. Once #534, #535 and #536 are merged, the worktrees and branches from this work can be removed.\n\nresult: PR #536 (subdirectory-workspace git-path fixes, changeset and release-root docs) is pushed with signed commits, linked to trail #357 and marked ready, pending CI and the user's merge."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":210,"cache_read_input_tokens":80320,"output_tokens":442,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":210,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":442,"cache_read_input_tokens":80320,"cache_creation_input_tok