{"parentUuid":"99820f30-6313-47e3-b498-d9fb8bc8911b","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"We're hardening Callisto before the next patch release, and I just opened PR #536, which fixes subdirectory-workspace git-path bugs and documents that release needs the repo root. Next, you approve CI and the Entire gate so #536 can merge, then re-check release PR #533.","timestamp":"2026-11-12T07:33:52.980Z","uuid":"e869134d-183b-49d3-9ecd-2a0c0e54105c","isMeta":false,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"e869134d-183b-49d3-9ecd-2a0c0e54105c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d143f630-cd63-4009-9319-d9f152ab6444","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"we haven't addressed the findings for change #238:\n\n<pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">\n### Medium finding\n\n**Location:** `crates/semantic/src/checker.rs:374`\n\nWhen `createSnapshot` or `updateSnapshot` builds a program importing an over-nested file, this branch discards the successful response containing the new snapshot ID while keeping the session alive. Callers obtain IDs and release snapshots through `crates/semantic/src/rpc.rs:414–448`, so the discarded snapshot cannot be released; repeated attempts accumulate retained programs and can eventually disable the checker at its memory bound. Release the newly created snapshot or close the session before returning this error.\n</pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">\n"},"uuid":"0619d276-6852-42ba-8551-6d18438321ec","timestamp":"2026-11-12T17:34:35.709Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":247,"turnIndex":352},"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
