{"parentUuid":"991f0a66-4488-4497-bc36-e87680ad637f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgySJDV2ZPUaFTUwJ4L81","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't fix this one from this session. `crates/semantic/src/checker.rs` isn't in the local Caliper checkout, which is on a branch that predates `feat/checker-supplies-facts`. This session's git and writes are also confined to the Callisto worktree. I have not read the code, so I haven't confirmed the finding.\n\nThe fix belongs on `feat/checker-supplies-facts` in `~/Projects/caliper`, in the same session that already needs to handle change #224 (`Props<string>` losing `HTMLAttributes` in `convert.rs`). Paste this into it:\n\n> Change #238, medium: in `crates/semantic/src/checker.rs` around line 374, `createSnapshot` and `updateSnapshot` return an error when the program imports an over-nested file, but they throw away the successful response that holds the new snapshot ID and keep the session alive. Callers get and release snapshot IDs through `crates/semantic/src/rpc.rs` (around lines 414–448), so that snapshot can never be released. Repeated attempts pile up retained programs until the checker hits its memory bound and disables itself.\n>\n> First reproduce it: call `createSnapshot` repeatedly on an over-nested import and watch retained-snapshot count or memory grow. Then release the newly created snapshot (or close the session) before returning the error. Add a test that fails before and passes after. It should assert that no snapshot is retained after the error. Check the `updateSnapshot` path as well as `createSnapshot`. Sign commits and run the repo's own checks.\n\nSay if you'd rather I check out that branch from a Caliper session instead.\n\nneeds input: a Caliper session on `feat/checker-supplies-facts` to fix change #238 (and #224). That code isn't reachable from this Callisto worktree."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":428,"cache_read_input_tokens":81879,"output_tokens":665,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":73},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":428,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":665,"cache_read_input_tokens":81879,"cache_creation_input_tokens":428,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":428},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5bc5f196-d5ab-482a-9f59-9b66b1cef6bd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgySJDDQu12Pw839B5ww4","requestRef":"a8c533b3-424e-49ba-a639-b4c7fa22395d","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5836825a-221c-4764-9ccd-2a8ee2c496df","timestamp":"2026-11-12T17:34:59.127Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-af481f5a6fc7e809a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-workspace-git-paths","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
