{"parentUuid":"555e5001-540b-4bad-8564-1a7be72b5800","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyUYFyUfodTNUU9waT1j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Lvyn7Fu9tb1MKBtJ5SFNJN","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_limit.md","content":"## Summary\n- `callisto release pending --limit 0` examined no release commits and printed the same result as a workspace with no unfinished release, which is misleading. `--limit` now has to be at least 1, so `0` is rejected while parsing arguments (exit 2).\n- The flag is now a `u64` with a clap range, converted to `usize` at the one call site.\n- Found by a regression hunt after 0.20.0.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/release-pending-limit-must-be-positive.md` (patch).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None apply.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0\n- [x] `release pending --limit 0` added to the parse-rejection cases in `usage_exit_codes_tests.rs` (exit 2 for json and text output).\n- [ ] Not run: `just test` in full, CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":508,"cache_read_input_tokens":99473,"output_tokens":657,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":508,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":657,"cache_read_input_tokens":99473,"cache_creation_input_tokens":508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":508},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"cont