{"parentUuid":"0d680b57-536f-42ef-a3d4-ac152f9b4a4b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyUpW3kknedgr3JoAM79","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is waiting on me. Both open PRs are `BLOCKED` on approvals that only you can give.\n\n- **#537** (`release pending --limit 0` fix): needs CI approval and the Entire Gates approval, then merge.\n- **#533** (release PR, patch release): same approvals. If you merge #537 first, #533 will regenerate with it included. If you merge #533 first, #537 rides the next release.\n- **#495** (old docs draft on changeset authoring): still open. I can check whether it's stale and close it or refresh it.\n\nWhat else is open:\n\n1. **OIDC trusted publishing.** It needs your decision: a generated-workflow option or a config key, and whether to allow `id-token: write` on `execute`. The plan is in `docs/projects/OIDC-TRUSTED-PUBLISHING.md`. This is the largest remaining design item.\n2. **Another bug hunt.** I can run another targeted pass for regressions after 0.20.0, which has been finding real bugs. It costs a few agents.\n3. **Pause.** The backlog of known items is otherwise empty.\n\nI'd suggest approving and merging #537 and #533 first, then settling OIDC."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":102452,"output_tokens":391,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":391,"cache_read_input_tokens":102452,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_tra