{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"b47474fa-9d11-4adb-8aca-6890c86b2875","snapshotMessageId":"af66a25e-d13a-4541-9cc7-fdc5ccf4a255","trackingPath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_pre_down.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-11-12T20:06:41.391Z","realParentDir":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp"},"timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:06:41.394Z"}
{"parentUuid":"9f0054dc-611c-4376-ae58-dda1346f2100","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgydsEWjkwjtWu9CoU2eG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fdw2BeWWanoyV4SAek8HNg","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_pre_down.md","content":"## Summary\n- In pre-release mode, `callisto version` could write a version older than the one already released. A package whose changeset is recorded in `pre.json` is not re-named on the next run, so a later changeset on a dependency or a fixed-group sibling bumped it with a lower severity from the pinned baseline: `1.1.0-beta.0` became `1.0.1-beta.0` (Cargo printed \"Downgrading\").\n- `versioned_bump` now raises the severity (minor, then major) until the result is not behind the live version, so that case yields `1.1.0-beta.1`. If no severity gets past the live version, such as after switching the tag from `rc` to `beta`, it returns the existing `VersionRegression` error instead of writing an older version.\n- `test_bump_target_uses_pinned_pre_baseline_not_current_prerelease` encoded the downgrade (live `2.0.0-next.0` pulled back to `1.1.0-next.0`), so its expectation is now `2.0.0-next.1`. The bump still starts from the pinned baseline, not from the live version.\n- Found by a regression hunt after 0.20.0.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/pre-mode-never-downgrades.md` (patch).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None apply.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint` and `just doc-check` exit 0; `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli` reports no failures.\n- [x] Reproduced with the real binary: pre enter, changeset `a: minor`, `version`, then changeset `b: patch` (a depends on b), `version`. Before, a went 1.1.0-beta.0 → 1.0.1-beta.0; after, 1.1.0-beta.1. A unit test covers `versioned_bump` directly.\n- [ ] Not run: `just workflow-contracts`, CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":135441,"output_tokens":880,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":880,"cache_read_input_tokens":135441,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Fdw2BeWWanoyV4SAek8HNg":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_pre_down.md","content":"## Summary\n- In pre-release mode, `callisto version` could write a version older than the one already released. A package whose changeset is recorded in `pre.json` is not re-named on the next run, so a later changeset on a dependency or a fixed-group sibling bumped it with a lower severity from the pinned baseline: `1.1.0-beta.0` became `1.0.1-beta.0` (Cargo printed \"Downgrading\").\n- `versioned_bump` now raises the severity (minor, then major) until the result is not behind the live version, so that case yields `1.1.0-beta.1`. If no severity gets past the live version, such as after switching the tag from `rc` to `beta`, it returns the existing `VersionRegression` error instead of writing an older version.\n- `test_bump_target_uses_pinned_pre_baseline_not_current_prerelease` encoded the downgrade (live `2.0.0-next.0` pulled back to `1.1.0-next.0`), so its expectation is now `2.0.0-next.1`. The bump still starts from the pinned baseline, not from the live version.\n- Found by a regression hunt after 0.20.0.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/pre-mode-never-downgrades.md` (patch).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None apply.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint` and `just doc-check` exit 0; `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli` reports no failures.\n- [x] Reproduced with the real binary: pre enter, changeset `a: minor`, `version`, then changeset `b: patch` (a depends on b), `version`. Before, a went 1.1.0-beta.0 → 1.0.1-beta.0; after, 1.1.0-beta.1. A unit test covers `versioned_bump` directly.\n- [ ] Not run: `just workflow-contracts`, CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"945f4e78-01c3-437b-8a5c-eb2c84e7fb5a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgydsE5TJd8LP5oLFdN3A","requestRef":"c0809d78-0cf7-4991-a749-7b44db6f7dbd","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b47474fa-9d11-4adb-8aca-6890c86b2875","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:06:41.286Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/pre-mode-no-downgrade","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"b47474fa-9d11-4adb-8aca-6890c86b2875","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b5f1f17e-6f0f-410e-b205-05dcd0d14cfb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fdw2BeWWanoyV4SAek8HNg","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_pre_down.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"5c9980db-dd9f-4327-b57d-eb81c793d8ab","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:06:41.438Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_pre_down.md","content":"## Summary\n- In pre-release mode, `callisto version` could write a version older than the one already released. A package whose changeset is recorded in `pre.json` is not re-named on the next run, so a later changeset on a dependency or a fixed-group sibling bumped it with a lower severity from the pinned baseline: `1.1.0-beta.0` became `1.0.1-beta.0` (Cargo printed \"Downgrading\").\n- `versioned_bump` now raises the severity (minor, then major) until the result is not behind the live version, so that case yields `1.1.0-beta.1`. If no severity gets past the live version, such as after switching the tag from `rc` to `beta`, it returns the existing `VersionRegression` error instead of writing an older version.\n- `test_bump_target_uses_pinned_pre_baseline_not_current_prerelease` encoded the downgrade (live `2.0.0-next.0` pulled back to `1.1.0-next.0`), so its expectation is now `2.0.0-next.1`. The bump still starts from the pinned baseline, not from the live version.\n- Found by a regression hunt after 0.20.0.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/pre-mode-never-downgrades.md` (patch).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None apply.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint` and `just doc-check` exit 0; `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli` reports no failures.\n- [x] Reproduced with the real binary: pre enter, changeset `a: minor`, `version`, then changeset `b: patch` (a depends on b), `version`. Before, a went 1.1.0-beta.0 → 1.0.1-beta.0; after, 1.1.0-beta.1. A unit test covers `versioned_bump` directly.\n- [ ] Not run: `just workflow-contracts`, CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b47474fa-9d11-4adb-8aca-6890c86b2875","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/pre-mode-no-downgrade","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
