{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","prNumber":538,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/538","prRepository":"orin-dx/callisto","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:06:53.205Z"}
{"parentUuid":"a9d350f3-c2ee-4439-a532-8a7e400f9517","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgydtSjEh8a8BZ2dyVQ2k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #538 is open and ready for review. It fixes the High finding from the hunt: in pre-release mode `callisto version` could write a version older than one already published.\n\nI confirmed the bug myself before fixing it, rather than relying on the agent's report. With `a` depending on `b`, a minor changeset on `a` gave 1.1.0-beta.0. A later patch changeset on `b` then took `a` back to 1.0.1-beta.0, and Cargo printed \"Downgrading\". After the fix `a` goes to 1.1.0-beta.1.\n\n- **Fix:** it is in `versioned_bump` in `groups.rs`. If the bump ends up behind the live version, the severity is raised until it isn't. If nothing gets past the live version, for example after switching the tag from `rc` to `beta`, it stops with the existing version-regression error instead.\n- **Existing test changed:** `test_bump_target_uses_pinned_pre_baseline_not_current_prerelease` expected a live `2.0.0-next.0` to be pulled back to `1.1.0-next.0`, which is the same downgrade. Its expectation is now `2.0.0-next.1`. There is no recorded decision behind the old behaviour (a Brain recall found nothing), but say so if you want the old behaviour kept.\n- **Checks:** `just pre-push`, `just lint` and `just doc-check` exit 0, and `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli` shows no failures. I did not run `just workflow-contracts`, and CI hasn't run. The commit is signed and the PR is linked to trail #357.\n- **Not yet fixed:** the hunt also reported two medium and one low changelog problems, which I haven't reproduced:\n  - A cascaded package's \"Dependency updates\" lists only the first dependency bump.\n  - That entry can show a stale version.\n  - `pre exit` loses the dependency line.\n\n  They affect only changelog text. I'll reproduce and fix them as one separate PR next, unless you'd rather skip them.\n\nThe branch for #537 is still in this worktree. It is pushed, so nothing is lost.\n\nresult: PR #538 fixes a pre-release downgrade bug that the hunt found and I reproduced. It is signed, checked and ready for review; three changelog findings from the same hunt are still open."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_read_input_tokens":136943,"output_tokens":768,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":240,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":768,"cache_read_input_tokens":136943,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":240},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c2e79c40-d63a-460e-9923-085229f594fa","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgydtSLvCCfC6FYgeiDxn","requestRef":"68d22b81-dafa-42ce-a9a8-c9293bed18e6","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"22b19dd0-24df-4409-92ec-ca1b082af739","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:06:58.211Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/pre-mode-no-downgrade","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
