{"parentUuid":"37a0a9da-c9c8-41ce-8f99-b06a624c6b49","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgzB7R7U8kFhhWtmeSPbs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017MmqvyVsaYzEgH1BtrLzJY","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview/.changeset/changelog-lists-every-dependency-update.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nA package released because its dependencies changed now lists every one of them under \"Dependency updates\" in its changelog, each at the version it actually reached.\n\n- Before, only the first dependency that bumped the package was listed. A package with its own changeset got no dependency line at all, though its manifest pins were rewritten.\n- A fixed group could also leave the line one version behind the manifest (`b → 1.0.1` while the pin said `=1.1.0`).\n- You do not need to do anything. Changelog sections already written are not changed.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":527,"cache_read_input_tokens":156901,"output_tokens":487,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":527,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":487,"cache_read_input_tokens":156901,"cache_creation_input_tokens":527,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":527},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_017MmqvyVsaYzEgH1BtrLzJY":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview/.changeset/changelog-lists-ev