{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","prNumber":539,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/539","prRepository":"orin-dx/callisto","timestamp":"2026-11-13T03:00:45.882Z"}
{"parentUuid":"d70e8f0d-a266-4d23-b7ff-d9a27000ddbe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgzBSyUurxwqyaKzRAJWr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #539 is open and ready for review. It fixes the two changelog bugs from the hunt that I reproduced against the real binary: a cascaded package's \"Dependency updates\" list was incomplete or stale.\n\n- **Missing dependencies:** a package released because several dependencies changed listed only the first one. A package that also had its own changeset listed none, even though its pins were rewritten. All of them are listed now.\n- **Stale versions:** with a fixed group, the line could say `b → 1.0.1` while the manifest pin said `=1.1.0`. Each line now shows the version the dependency actually reached.\n- **Test and checks:** a plan-level test covers the two-dependency case, and the commit is signed. `just pre-push`, `just lint` and `just doc-check` exit 0. The only failing test is `a_version_the_registry_serves_is_exact_with_no_checksum_or_yank_claim`, which needs the registry test tools CI installs and fails the same way on `main`. I did not run `just workflow-contracts`, and CI hasn't run.\n- **Not verified:** the third, low-priority finding is that `pre exit` writes \"Version bump (patch)\" instead of a dependency line. The same change probably covers it, but I haven't reproduced it.\n\nMy three PRs are all waiting on your CI and Entire Gates approvals before they can merge:\n\n| PR | What it does |\n|---|---|\n| #537 | Rejects `release pending --limit 0` |\n| #538 | Stops pre-release mode lowering a version |\n| #539 | Complete changelog dependency lists |\n\nRelease PR #533 is still waiting too.\n\nI'll hold off on further changes until some of these merge. Say if you want another hunt on a new area, such as npm workspace parsing, the GitHub Release/tag flow, or lockfile refresh, or the OIDC design decision.\n\nresult: PR #539 (changelog lists every bumped dependency at its final version) is signed, checked and ready for review, alongside #537 and #538; all three await the user's approval and merge."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1107,"cache_read_input_tokens":158786,"output_tokens":669,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1107,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":158786,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1107,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1107},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"71c89e61-077d-4677-a855-c5b7360e6c12","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgzBSyFXq58kHowSjNQ52","requestRef":"3824180c-f241-456d-9418-12f012d5b465","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"88e24b43-6922-4812-ad9a-35246e11512c","timestamp":"2026-11-13T03:00:50.740Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/changelog-dependency-updates","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
