{"parentUuid":"f0306ce4-e9ba-4cb3-99fa-9566470eda95","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"72cc1dc1-3f03-43fe-a150-9551427c3ef7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014he83hHW5p7hpc83CwwPfS","type":"tool_result","content":"A trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  attachment      Upload, list, and remove images for a trail's description\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  ci-pr           Create or link the GitHub pull request that runs CI\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  ready           Mark a trail ready for review\n  rerun-review    Review a trail's current head again\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  retarget        Change the base branch a trail merges into\n  sessions        List the agent sessions behind a trail's commits\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  stack           Show the pull request stack a trail belongs to\n  timeline        Show a trail's activity: commits, reviews, findings, and approvals\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  update-branch   Merge the base branch into a trail's branch\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help[=true|false]   help for trail\n      --project string      Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string         Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8674a255-07bb-46df-80d9-8f01505876bc","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:36:31.786Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"A trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  attachment      Upload, list, and remove images for a trail's description\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  ci-pr           Create or link the GitHub pull request that runs CI\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  ready           Mark a trail ready for review\n  rerun-review    Review a trail's current head again\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  retarget        Change the base branch a trail merges into\n  sessions        List the agent sessions behind a trail's commits\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  stack           Show the pull request stack a trail belongs to\n  timeline        Show a trail's activity: commits, reviews, findings, and approvals\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  update-branch   Merge the base branch into a trail's branch\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help[=true|false]   help for trail\n      --project string      Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string         Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ec59fe33-b756-48ba-84e0-7287a5565eda","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","branch":"fix/ci-unused-exitcode","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,