{"parentUuid":"b8236ad8-806f-40fa-bebc-c101c5725c11","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgzTzDFcpfE44MgaxH6vW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There are no open findings on any of our branches.\n\n| Branch | PR | Open findings | Review agent |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `fix/release-pending-limit-positive` | #537 | 0 | Code review (custom) succeeded on `37570fcd` |\n| `fix/pre-mode-no-downgrade` | #538 | 0 | succeeded on `2a7e5919` |\n| `fix/changelog-dependency-updates` | #539 | 0 | succeeded on `b0998f5d` |\n| `fix/ci-unused-exitcode` | #540 | 0 | no agent has run yet (just pushed) |\n| `callisto/version-packages` | #533 | 0 | no agent on this change |\n\nThose reviews ran on each branch's latest commit. The resolved, dismissed and stale counts are all 0 too.\n\nEntire Gates \"fail\" is therefore not a findings problem. Trail #357 has no approvals, and I assume that missing approval is why the gate fails. I haven't checked what else the gate requires.\n\n**Retrieving findings efficiently:** `entire trail finding --repo gh/orin-dx/callisto --branch <branch>` shows the dashboard for a branch. Findings are per branch, so this is one command per branch. Useful flags are `--severity high,medium`, `--status any` and `--json`. I can run these in parallel without scripts.\n\n**Why I keep writing scripts:**\n- The worktree guard refuses any command it can't prove is git-free. That includes `jq` filters, quoted regexes, loops and chained commands.\n- The sandbox also blocks writes to `/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs`, gpg signing and network access, so those commands need `dangerouslyDisableSandbox`.\n- I defaulted to a script each time instead of a single plain command. Going forward I'll use single commands, and use scripts only for the bulk code edits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_read_input_tokens":189517,"output_tokens":630,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":630,"cache_read_input_tokens":189517,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7d5e2cd7-a0e1-4954-bcce-16dd5d2ab915","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgzTzD2V7irvnajDiobrD","requestRef":"4f2c3a3a-cea0-4bf9-a5fc-d770a3447f34","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"73005dbd-ff53-4be6-af22-e274d9f87304","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:37:43.140Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/small-batch-limit-and-preview","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/ci-unused-exitcode","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
