{"parentUuid":"27bbfd89-0818-404a-98af-f27e9b9f1510","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch219YY6wNXstGe7h7GEp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1419,"cache_read_input_tokens":225810,"output_tokens":1142,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":464},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1419,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1142,"cache_read_input_tokens":225810,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1419,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1419},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4005,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"8ebdd4a1-6c44-4d36-b7ac-7b54f54ff154","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch219YHxtb6uVZ2ZXkcLn","requestRef":"1ea94b0f-d1cf-4192-83c3-6266b73a257e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4057bb0d-443a-4ee3-859c-5938d38e7c64","timestamp":"2026-11-14T02:06:56.795Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"4057bb0d-443a-4ee3-859c-5938d38e7c64","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch219YY6wNXstGe7h7GEp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, with three changes, because the prompt is written for a diff and a whole codebase has none.\n\n1. **Drop \"this Change introduced it\".** There is no diff base, so a defect only needs to be real and traceable in current code. I'd keep the rest of the bar as is: a named trigger, a cited caller or guard, a disproof attempt, and the 0.5 confidence floor.\n2. **Shard by subsystem.** One agent can't trace 46k lines, and per-diff review works because the scope is small. Each agent traces its shard and follows callers into other crates only to confirm or disprove a candidate.\n3. **Verify before acting.** I'd reproduce each finding with the real binary or a failing test before fixing anything, since earlier hunts produced both real bugs and non-issues.\n\nProposed shards (about 6 read-only agents):\n\n| Shard | Scope |\n|---|---|\n| Version planning | `callisto-graph`: aggregate, cascade, groups, pre mode |\n| Changelog and release decision | `callisto-graph`: changelog, `release_decision`, `release/pending` |\n| Release execution | `callisto-cli`: `release/*`, providers, registry and artifact verification |\n| Commands and CLI contracts | `callisto-cli`: the other commands, exit kinds, JSON envelopes |\n| Manifests | `callisto-manifests`: cargo, npm, python read and write, lockfiles |\n| Model, config and generated workflows | `callisto-model`, config, workflow generation |\n\nTwo rules stay in force: nothing is built or run by the agents except my own repro afterwards, and the review rules come from `AGENTS.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/stability.md`, since there is no `REVIEW.md`.\n\nThe cost is roughly six agents' worth of reading, a lot more than the single hunts so far, so I'd run them in one batch. Say \"go\" and I'll launch it. Tell me if you'd rather run only the three highest-risk shards (version planning, release execution, manifests) first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1419,"cache_read_input_tokens":225810,"output_tokens":1142,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":464},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1419,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1142,"cache_read_input_tokens":225810,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1419,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1419},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8ebdd4a1-6c44-4d36-b7ac-7b54f54ff154","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch219YHxtb6uVZ2ZXkcLn","requestRef":"1ea94b0f-d1cf-4192-83c3-6266b73a257e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"95e9e769-9a9b-47c9-aef1-91323623ea77","timestamp":"2026-11-14T02:07:01.948Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
