{"parentUuid":"0f97aed9-e6f8-4d8f-be37-a953ca0923da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch21jWYFjVxZ6NLnGWCsn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two agents are running, each in its own worktree. Both have the goal, the invariants to check and free use of the real binary, and both report only defects they've reproduced.\n\n| Agent | Focus |\n|---|---|\n| Plan to publish | `version`, the decision file, `release plan`, `pending` and `release`, partial failure and reruns, pre mode, groups, workspaces below the repo root |\n| Manifests and cascade | Cargo, npm and Python read and rewrite, the cascade's planned rewrites against the writers, config, generated workflows against the code |\n\nEach was told what was already fixed and what's settled, so they won't re-report the emoji, E194, the exit-code calls and the other known items.\n\nWhen they report, I'll reproduce each finding myself before fixing it, then fix and PR the real ones separately. Nothing else is running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6399,"cache_read_input_tokens":240382,"output_tokens":272,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6399,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":240382,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6399,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6399},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2e01a779-4f5a-4d79-b600-f62331879762","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch21jWGt1q7hffQqUg37H","requestRef":"544a2e87-f216-4223-847a-4