{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"9a51ec6e-fd91-457b-adcc-89362dd77d82","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3de37e0d-1775-44fa-86e9-cd5b184c34fe","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qetm2bsJygjUNur4Hka9mv","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_roll.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"e320a5e1-7024-42b8-a361-9b8dbf976375","timestamp":"2026-11-14T02:51:51.097Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_roll.md","content":"## Summary\n- When the lockfile refresh in `callisto version` failed (E208), the bumped manifests and new changelog sections stayed in the working tree with the changesets still in place. The error said to fix it and re-run `callisto version`, but the re-run was refused with E121 (\"looks like an interrupted `version` run\"), whose advice is to commit the half-applied release, with a lockfile that was never refreshed.\n- `apply_version_plan` now reads every file the plan writes before the first write (the same list the preflight checks) and puts them back, removing files it created, if the refresh fails. Nothing is staged and the changesets are still on disk at that point, so the retry works. If a file cannot be put back, that is reported as an apply error naming the original failure.\n- The E208 help and its `docs/errors.md` row now say nothing was left changed, instead of telling the user to run the refresh command themselves, which would succeed against the restored old versions.\n- `refresh_lockfiles_failure_stops_apply_...` asserted the half-applied manifest (`version == 1.1.0`); it now asserts the restored one.\n- Found independently by two bug hunts after 0.20.0, with different triggers (an unresolvable registry dependency, and a dev-dependency range that does not cover the new version).\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added `.changeset/restore-files-when-lockfile-refresh-fails.md` (patch).\n\n## Docs\n- [x] `docs/errors.md` E208 row, kept equal to the code's help text.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` and `cargo +1.100.0 clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings` exit 0; `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli -p callisto-manifests` has no failures\n- [x] Reproduced with the real binary: a crate depending on an unresolvable registry package, `CARGO_NET_OFFLINE=true`, `add` then `version`. Before, the retry failed with E121 and `Cargo.toml` stayed at the bumped version; after, the retry reports the same E208 and the tree is unchanged. A new unit test covers the restore.\n- [ ] Not run: `just workflow-contracts`, CI\n\n<!-- entire-shadow-pr -->\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"666fd420-3681-4791-ae19-e729ea7872e3","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/verify-manifest-findings","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/verify-manifest-findings","branch":"fix/version-lock-refresh-rollback","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":5,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/verify-manifest-findings","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9a51ec6e-fd91-457b-adcc-89362dd77d82","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto